<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Ngombe-</book>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma LUKA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokwea ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Mokomi o mina omɔti, na kombe e Luka, akoma buku djibae Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Luka ko na Bikɔmeli bi Bapɔsɔlu. A buku e nde e boso, Luka akomeakadea bakilito ibia badi pɛ boda Bayudha ko bakabale gɛlɛke. Abatingodjakadea mondumba mo kombe djipipo ko makɔkɔ ma Bayudha bodii bo pɛ bodjeba. Iboa, bikomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bikomi: edii bato badi sokolu e Bayudha.</char></note> bi ngondo mobimba ko dji bihole bisusu bibwani bodjeba bo Yesu adi Moheledji. Bwɛndi Bopele bo Luka bokakimane popa ekaputoanedje Mɛndi Mapele masato ma boso. Endelo buku iye ekabale mɛɛnɛ isolo di mɔɔngɔ mo Yesu bobanga Galileya mbunoko Yelusalɛmɛ (9.51–19.28). A isolo dimina di bodala mbunoko a Yelusalɛmɛ, a esika etungi na Yesu bogwa, Luka atubanakadea midjɔ ko na masolo madii pɛpɛ bodaa Mɛndi makina: embete e, Yesu ndelo ekɛɛ iyo aindja Malata na Malia (10.38–42), isolo di Mosamalia mopele (10.29–37), isolo di sange moto abolodji mwana obunga (15.11–32). Mokomi ainedjakadea eka edii atei e nde iyo mɛɛnɛ a tei e bwɛndi ko a bomɔ bo Yesu: Ndjakomba aloma Yesu Masiya bɛngi aheledje ibia badi mbuti na bomodimea. Yesu iyo mɛnɛ akasapɛ na bato ibia batsiolama: bato ba pekato, bengɛ, bakwali, bato ba bipeko, bapaya. Bakilito ibia bakomeakadea Luka edii ibia bapeaka mɛnɛ madieli. Luka abomakadea masolo manɛnɛ mabomaka Yesu mabalakadea tina e bodieli, embete a 12.16–21 ko a ekenge 16. Ainedjakadea batingami ba Yesu basalee bodieli tina e djakomba ko tina e bato bakina. Batingami ba Yesu badi na nde na ndjea badi mbuti na bohombedja mida, basipoi bo Ndjakomba adi mopele ko akapale bato basusu. A bikomi bikondjama na ba Loma, bato bakabale bo: «Kaisala adi Kumu.» Endelo bakiito bakabale bo: «edii Yesu Kilito moto odii Kumu.» Modjɔ mo, Ndjakomba asisodja Yesu a bogwa ko amopa kpati a diko di midjɔ misusu. A Bwɛndi bokoma Luka Yesu akabeame Kumu mbala djinɛnɛ bonɔ Mɛɛndi makina. Buku e Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Luka esukea a Yelusalɛmɛ (Ekenge enɛnɛ e 24), a esika ebanga iyo (ekenge enɛnɛ e 1 ko 2). Yesu asinedja mɔsu na batingami ba nde, ko badi na mongandi monɛnɛ. Donga mbangi e bomɔ bonde adi bato, Yesu adi molumake na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke modongi adi Ndjakomba, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke (ekenge 3 ko 4). Batingami ba Yesu bamoasɔɔdea pongono (24.49). Ondingo Yesu, babwani boɔngɔnɔ ko boemba bopele bo Ndjakomba.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Tina e buku e Luka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mokumi Teopile,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Bato banɛnɛ bamekabi bokoma midjɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iye epalaka bobala midjɔ mi bomɔ, bogwa ko na bosisoa bo Yesu. </char></note> imimi mikokedjamabi ta ndanda e biso. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bakomaka midjɔ imimi mibatɔndeaka bato baɛnɛkɛ na miso, ta mbangi ko baimeaka basali ba botɔndɔ mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ta tina emina, ta pamba e mbi, ngɔngɔ dji bohomba sooti mɛnɛ midjɔ misusu minɔɔkɔ ta mbangi ko eɛnɛmɛkɛ bopele ta pamba e mbi bokoma ta tina e wɛ, mokumi Teopile, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />na mikɔi ta tina ebo obwane bodjeba midjɔ imimi midiaka wɛ midii sooti.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Andjelu omɔti adjebedji bobotama bo Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ta ehole edaaka Elode mokondji o Yudhea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudha: Luka ainedjakadea iputo di mokili mo Bayudha.</char></note>, nganga o Ndjakomba omɔti kombe e nde Djakalia, ta iputo di banganga ba Ndjakomba iputo di Abiya. Mwali o nde, adaaka pape e Alona, kombe e nde Isɛbɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ibo basusu babae badaaka na bodju ta boso bo Ndjakomba, ko badaaka badhimea na bosusu mibeko mi Kumu ko na bilomu bisusu bi nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Endelo baidaka na mwana modjɔ mo Isɛbɛti adaaka motete ko ibo basusu babae baimeaka babange.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Busa bomɔti, Djakalia adaaka akɔɔ midjɔ mi bonganga ta boso bo Ndjakomba, edaaka ehole e mosala e iputo di bobo. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Bobwaana na momɛsɛno mo bonganga bo Ndjakomba, ahɔɔmɔkɔ ta ngɔngɔ dji boboma djonga ta tina e botumba mbeka e paka e malasi ta tei esika ekatumbe bo mbeka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 30.7-8.</char></note> e Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Emumu e bato badaaka sokolu tina e boangɔnɔ ta ehole e botumbaka mbeka e paka e malasi.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Iboa obwɛndi o Kumu asainedja na Djakalia, asaemedjaka ta dɔɔngɔ di ebɔ e baami ta esika etumbelo e mbeka e paka e malasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 30.1-6; 1 Bak 7.48.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ehole emoɛnɛ Djakalia, adjakima ko alumaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Endelo obwɛndi abala na nde ibo: «Djakalia pɛpɛ bobanga, modjɔ mo Ndjakomba aoka miɔngɔnɔ mi wɛ, mwali o wɛ Isɛbɛti aoboteadea mwana moomi omɔti ko omobakeadea kombe e Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Okadea mongandi monɛnɛ ko bato banɛnɛ basepabi na bobotama bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Modjɔ mo adaabi monɛnɛ ta boso bo Kumu, atamwakabi vino ko na mana mapipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mits 6.3</char></note> ko alumabi na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke donga ta sɔpɔ dji nango. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Asɔmbedjabi bato banɛnɛ ba Isalɛlɛ ta dɔɔngɔ di Kumu Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mal 2.6</char></note> o bobo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Adalabi boso bo Ndjakomba na mwembo ko na ngulu edaaka na Eliya, ta tina e bosɔmbedja bwela bo basangi bato ta dii baana ba bobo, ko adaledjabi bato bataka e isuma ta bosooti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal 3.23-24</char></note>; abɔngedjabi bato ibibi babwani na Kumu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Endelo Djakalia abala na obwɛndi bo: «Nadjebadea modjɔ momina modii sooti ndenge nda? Modjɔ mo mbi naimei mobange, ko mwali o mbi aimei pongono mobange.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Obwɛndi amosɔmbedja bo: «Mbi, nadii Gabiyɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Dan 8.16; 9.21; Luk 1.26.</char></note> nakaemae ta boso bo Ndjakomba; alomini bɛngi naotɔndee ko naolwɛe Bwɛndi ibubu Bopele. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Endelo odimiti mibalo mi mbi imimi mikokedjamabi bokina busa, oimedea emimi ko otadiadea enɔli e bobala mbunoko busa bokokedjamabi midjɔ mimina.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ta ehole emina, bato badaaka baamba Djakalia ko bakamoaka mondumba moyeyoa iyo ta esika ekatumbe bo mbeka. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ndelo eimana iyo, aibɔngɔkɔ bobala na bu, ko bato badjebaka bo aɛni ndjɛnɛ ta esika ekatumbe bo mbeka, abatɔndeaka na bimbete adikama emimi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ehole esia masu ma Djakalia ma mosala, aso ayana ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ngɔngɔ dji mo ehole mokɛkɛ, mwali o nde Isɛbɛti, alwaa deemi, ko abolamaka ta ndako songe batano itombo, ko asabaleaka bo: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Indja eka ekɔi Kumu tina e mbi ta ehole iyeye, iyo aokeini ndjokwa ko adongedjini sɔni ta boso bo bato.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndi omɔti adjebedji bobotama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ngɔngɔ dji songe basamano, obwɛndi Gabiyɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binda 1.19 ko nase.</char></note> alomama na Ndjakomba ta ngando emɔti e Galileya kombe eyu Nadjalɛtɛ, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ta dii mwana mwali omɔti o pɛpɛ bodjebana na moomi bamopandedjaka na moto omɔti kombe e nde Yosepu, ta ibota di mokondji Dhapiti; mwana mwali omina bamobeaka Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Andjelu akwea ta dii iyo ko abala na nde bo: «Daa na mongandi! Wɛ obolodji ngɔlu enɛnɛ ta boso bo Ndjakomba, Kumu adii na wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Aoka iyo mɛko mimina, asatungea ta molema ko asawadjaka tina e ndese emina. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Iboa obwɛndi abala na nde: «Pɛpɛ bobanga, Malia, tina, Ndjakomba ainedji ngɔlu e nde ta dii wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ko indja edɛdiyeye mɛnɛ olwadea deemi ko obotadea mwana moomi ko omobakeadea kombe e Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Adaabi moto monɛnɛ ko bamobeabi Mwana Onɔi Diko disusu, ko Kumu Ndjakomba amopabi kiti e bokumu bo Dhapiti, kɔkɔ o nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Adaabi Mokondji ta ibota di Yakobo kɔbili, ko bokondji bo nde bodaetebi na suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2 Sam 7.12,13,16; Isa 9.6; Dan 7.14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia abala na obwɛndi bo: «Ekɔmɔdea mondumba nda modjɔ mo napakina djebana na moomi?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Obwɛndi amosɔmbedja bo: «Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mootiteadea ko ngulu e Iyona Onɔi Diko disusu eodipadea na esii e nde. Ta tina emina, mwana obotamadea adabi mosɛnɔke, ko abeamadea Mwana o Ndjakomba, obotamadea. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Bwela bo wɛ Isɛbɛti, iyo pongono adii na deemi ko abotadea mwana moomi, nongo asa imea yo mobange; Babalaka na nde bo adii motete ko edɛdiyeye adii na deemi dikɔi songe basamano! <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tina ebo pɛpɛ nongo modjɔ mo mɔti monɔi Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mba 18.14.</char></note> na bopipo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Iboa Malia asɔmbedji bo: «Mbi nadii mosali mwali o Kumu; kina bo misusu mikɔɔme na mbi oko mondumba mosatɔndeini wɛ.» Mbunoko obwɛndi aso amokina.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malia akɛi aindja Isɛbɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu, Malia akɛɛ, pɛpɛlɛ ta ngomba, ta ngando emɔti e Yudhea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Akwea ta ndako e Djakalia ko aso aisea Isɛbɛti ndese. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ndelo eoka Isɛbɛti ndese e Malia mwana aso akumana ta sɔpɔ dji nde. Isɛbɛti aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ko aso agama na ngulu bo: «Ndjakomba aodjongoi bonɔ bali basusu, mwana obotadea wɛ adjongoami na Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mbi nadii ndani bɛngi nange e Kumu o mbi adoe ta dii mbi? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Modjɔ mo ndelo eoki mbi ndese e wɛ mwana akumani na mongandi ta sɔpɔ <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Odii na mongandi: Modjɔ mo odhimabi bo Kumu akokedjadea midjɔ miotɔndea yo.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeembo e Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Iboa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja mil. 46-55 ko 1Sam 2.1-10.</char></note> Malia abala bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Na bomɔ bo mbi itombo napali boinedja bonɛnɛ bo Kumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Molema mo mbi molumi na mongandi ta tina e Ndjakomba Moheledji o mbi;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />modjɔ mo aindjabi miso ma nde ta dii mbi mosali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 1Sam 1.11.</char></note> mwali o nde o pɛpɛ gala. Edɛdiyeye ko bihole bisusu, bato basusu babeabini mwali o mongandi.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Modjɔ mo Ndjakomba Onɔi na Bopilo akɔmeini midjɔ mipele.Kombe ende edii esɛnɔke.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Aluma na bopele ta bihole na bihole ta dii ibia bakamosume.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ainedja bokondji bo nde na boinedja ngulu e nde: Abungedja bato ba milema mi malɛno ma molumba ndjea,<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />adongedja bakondji ta kiti dji bobo dji bokumu ko adedja bato babosatitedja ta polo e boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja Yob 5.11; 12.19.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Agoledja bato ba ndja, ko ayanedja badieli mɔmɔ ngasa.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Adoa na bokomedja ta Isalɛlɛ mosali o nde, modjɔ mo aibosa boinedja bopele bo nde<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />na ndjea e Abalayama ko na batitani ba nde tina e seko mondumba mobala iyo na bakɔkɔ ba biso.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia adikamaka na Isɛbɛti bokimana songe basato, ngɔngɔ djimina asɔmbɔ ta dii iyo mɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛbɛti aboti Yoane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Aimea busa bo Isɛbɛti bo bobota aso abota mwana moomi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bato badaaka mbuti na nde ko na denga di nde baoka bo Kumu amokɔi mongandi monɛnɛ ko basepaka na nde engbanga emɔti.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ta ehole ekokedja mwana masu bomwambe, bakɛɛkɛ na nde tina bomolena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 12.3.</char></note> epole. Bapalaka bomobakea kombe e sango, Djakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Endelo nango alonaka ko atɔndɔkɔ bo: «Pɛpɛ, abeamadea Yoane.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamotɔndea bo: «Moto omɔti o ibota di wɛ adiiti na kombe emina!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ko bawadja sange e mwana na bimbete, kombe ndani epali wɛ obakee mwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Djakalia abea moo ibaya mokɛkɛ ko akoma bo: «Kombe e nde edii Yoane.» Ko bato basusu baso bakamoa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mbala emɔti Djakalia asɔmbɔ bobala naikina abanga bokumedja Ndjakomba na kɔpi e diko. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Iboa, bato basusu badaaka ta ngando dji mbuti ko na dji ngomba djisusu dji Yudhea baluma na bɔɔ ko basatɔndeanaka mɛko mi mina. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Ibibi baokaka mɛko mimina bamibaneaka ta milema ko basatɔndeanaka bo: «Iboa mwana omina adaabi mondumba nda?» modjɔ mo edii sooti bo ebɔ e Kumu edaaka na nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeembo e Djakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Djakalia, sange mwana, alumaka na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko atɛlɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 67 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epalaka pongono bobala bo bosakola.</char></note> bo:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Adjongoame Kumu, Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">modjɔ mo adoi ainedja bato ba nde bopele ko abaimedji basɔmi,<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />alopi Moheledji mopipo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">ta ibota di Dhapiti, mosali o nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Oko mondumba momaka iyo tɔndɔ na ndjea e batɛli ba nde basɛnɔke bayou.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Aadikana bo, aloheledjabi ta mabɔ ma baloni ba biso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">ko adii bato basusu ibibi bakalolone.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ainedjaka bopele bo nde ta dii bakɔkɔ ba biso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">ko aibosa mokongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Mat 26.28 ko na nase.</char></note> Mosɛnɔke mo nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Tengasa Ndjakomba akata seleka na kɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 73 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mba 22.16-17</char></note> o biso Abalayama bo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 73 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mba 22.16-17.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />alodongedjabi ta mabɔ ma baloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">ko bɛngi lomokɔmee na pɛpɛ bobanga,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />bɛngi lodae bato basɛnɔke ko bato ba bodju ta boso bo nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">masu masusu ma bomɔ bo biso.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ko wɛ, mwana o mbi, odaadea motɛli Onɔi Diko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">modjɔ mo odaladea ta boso bo Kumu ta tina ebobɔngedja ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 76 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mlki 3.1.</char></note> e nde,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 76 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mlki 3.1.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ko otɔndeabi bato ba nde bo adoabi abaheledja</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">na bokutubanedja pekato dji bobo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ndjakomba o biso aluma na ndjokwa ko na bopele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">aloimanedjeabi moi imumu modonga o diko ko bokuana na modaakabusa ndelo ekaimane imo,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />modoa ta tina e boinedja bato badaaka ta tei e bulu ta modidi mo yogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ko ta tina e bolodaledja mɔndɔ ta ndjea e bogo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 79 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Esd 9.1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akandoaka ko alumaka na ngulu e Mwembo, adikamaka ta bisika bi bitengelenge mbunoko ta busa bosainedja iyo ta miso ma bana ba Isalɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bobotama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1, 18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ta ehole emina, Kaisala Ogisite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaisala Ogisite adaaka adaledja mokili mosusu mo Loma bobanga yanga e 29 boso Yesu Kilito bobotama ko a yanga e 14 ngɔngɔ dji Yesu Kilito bobotama</char></note>, apaka mobeko bo bakɛe akɔɔ motangi bɛngi badjebe bato basusu badaaka ta tei e bokondji bo Loma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Edaaka mbala e boso e bokɔɔ motangi ta ehole edaaka Kiliniusi gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Sili. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bato basusu bakɛɛkɛ akomedja kombe, moto na moto ta ngando e nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosepu pongono akina Nadjalɛtɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Galileya, akɛɛkɛ ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ta ekenge e mokili mo Yudhea, modjɔ mo adaaka moto omɔti o ibota di Dhapiti.<verse eid="LUK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Akɛɛkɛ akomedja kombe e nde engbanga emɔti na Malia, mwali o nde, iyo odaaka na deemi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ehole edaaka bo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ndelo e nde ebobota eso eimei. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Abotaka mwana moomi o nde o boso, amohua na bisendja ko amosambea ta esika ekayakedje bo tito bihole bisusu, modjɔ mo baidia esika ebowɛɛ ta ndako e bakɛndɛli.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Andjelu aimanei babanei ba tito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ta polo emina emɔti, babanei ba tito badaaka babanea tito ba bobo na bulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Obwɛndi o Kumu asainedja na bu, ekumu e Kumu eengɛsɛkɛ diko di bobo, ko baimeaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Endelo obwɛndi abatɔndeaka bo: «Pɛpɛ bobangani, modjɔmo, nadoi aodjebedjani Bwɛndi Bopele bomɔti, ibubu bosepedjabi bato basusu: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />ta bulu bo busa ibubu, baoboteini Moheledji ta ngando enɛnɛ e Dhapiti, iyo adii Kilito, Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ko indjani embete iyeye emodjebadea na nu: otaneadeani mwana mokɛkɛ oboti bo, ahuwami na bisendja ko asambi ta esika ekayakedje bo tito.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Na mbala emɔti babwɛndi banɛnɛ ba busa badoa baputoana na obwɛndi iyona ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba, ko baso babalaka bo: <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ekumu ta dii Ndjakomba iyo odii ta bisika binɔi o diko, ko bogo iya ta kpɔtɔ ta dii bato ibibi bakapale iyo!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babanei ba tito bakɛi a Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ehole esɔmbɔ babwɛndi ta busa, babanei ba tito basabalea bo: «Lokɛeni ibobo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, bɛngi lodjebe modjɔ ndani mosaimana iho, imumu molodjebedjaka Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bakɛɛ ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ebango ko baso batanea Malia, Yosepu ko mwana mokɛkɛ, oboti bo asambi ta esika ekayakedje bo tito. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ehole emoɛnɛ ibo, batɔndeaka bato midjɔ misusu mibatɔndeaka obwɛndi ta tina e mwana omina. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bato basusu ibibi baokaka mɛko mimina ta minɔko mi babanei ba tito baso bakamoa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Malia abaneaka modjɔ momina ta molema ko amoikoaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ta tina e babanei ba tito, bayana bakɛɛkɛ asakoe, ko akumedje Ndjakomba ndjea ndjea tina e mɛko misusu miokaka ibo ko miɛnɛkɛ ibo, bobwana na midjɔ mibatɔndeaka obwɛndi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babakei Yesu kombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu bomwambe, eimeaka ehole e bolena mwana epole, ko bamobakea kombe e Yesu, oko mondumba momatɔndea obwɛndi Malia boso bo bolwa deemi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 12.3; Luk 1.31</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ainedjama ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Iyaya akokaka masu mamina, bobwana na mobeko mo Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 12.3,6.</char></note>, ebɔngɔkɔ na bu bosasɛnodja, bakɛɛkɛ na mwana a Yelusalɛmɛ tina ebomoinedja ta dii Kumu, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />modjɔ mo bobwana na ndenge ekomaka bo ta mobeko mo Kumu bo: «Mwana mosusu moomi o boso iyoyo oboti bo ebwani na nde bopame ta dii Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta Boi 13.2,12.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Bobwana na mobeko imua mo Kumu babolodja elomu e bopa pongono tina e mbeka bidoa babae kaoko bakandoli ba bimbenga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 12.8.</char></note> babae.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Moto omɔti adaaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ kombe e nde Simeona. Moto omina adaaka na bosooti ko na isuma, aambaka busa ndani boduadea Ndjakomba asikoa Isalɛlɛ. Mwembo Mosɛnɔke modaaka na nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mo modjebedja bo eta bɔngɔ bo agwɛ mbunoko aɛnɛ Kilito o Kumu na miso. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mwembo mo moloma ta tepelo, ko ta ehole emina baboti ba Yesu bakɛɛ na nde tina ebokokedja midjɔ mikomama ta mobeko ta tina emina, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeona amotomba ta mabɔ ma nde ko asakoa Ndjakomba, ko aso abala bo:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Edɛdiyeye, Kumu, okokedji midjɔ midikanakani na wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">kina mosali o wɛ agwɛ na bogo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Modjɔ mo miso ma mbi mɛnɛ maɛni Moheledji,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />iyoyo oloma wɛ tina e boheledja bikomi bisusu.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Iyo adii moi tina e bopa bohu ta dii bikomi bisusu, apadea ekumu ta dii ekomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 42.6; 49.6;52.10.</char></note> e wɛ Isalɛlɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeona atɛli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Sange e Yesu ko na nange e nde badaaka bakamwa na midjɔ midaaka Simeona abala tina e nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeona abadjongoa ko abala na Malia nange e Yesu bo: «Mwana iyoyo ahɔɔmɔ tina e bodumba ko boangɔdjɔ bato banɛnɛ ba Isalɛlɛ; iyo adaabi embete e bopa motubano; <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ta tina emina, malɛno mabolamake ma bato madjebamabi. Iboa wɛ mɛnɛ Malia, molema mo wɛ modabi mobenake.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana, motɛli mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Motɛli mwali adaaka ena, kombe e nde Ana, mwana mwali o Panuwelo, motitani o Aselo. Aimeaka mobange. Ahelama bianga sambo na muma nde omoasɔkɔ donga a bwɛngɛ bo nde, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />ngɔngɔ djimina adika mwali o bogwa ko akokedjaka bianga tuku bomwambe na banɛi. Aidongaka ta tepelo asalealaka Ndjakomba bulu na moi: bokia miya ko aangɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Aimeaka ta ehole emina aso akumedjaka Ndjakomba. Ko abalaka midjɔ mitingi na mwana ta dii bato basusu ba ambaka bo Ndjakomba aheledje Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule ta Nadjaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokokedja midjɔ misusu mi mobeko mo Kumu Malia na Yosepu bayana ta Galileya ta Nadjalɛtɛ ngando e bobo. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana akandoaka, adaaka na ngulu. Alumaka na konga, ngɔlu e Ndjakomba edaaka ta dii iyo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo ndelo edaaka iyo na bianga doomi na bibae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Baboti ba nde bakɛɛkɛ aengi yanga ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta tina e tɛkɛ e Pasika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pasika: tɛkɛ e boimana bo bana ba Isalɛlɛ a ibuli di Edjipito</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ehole ekokedja Yesu bianga doomi na bibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a buku e Boi 12.1-27; Buku e Dit 16.1-8. Bianga 12: edii ndelo e bopinga bo mwana, bɛngi abange bokwea a tepelo e Bayudha. </char></note>, bakɛɛkɛ na nde oo momɛsɛno mo bobo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ehole esiaka masu ma tɛkɛ, bayanaka, Yesu adika ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko baboti ba nde baidjeba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Balɛdjɛkɛ bo Yesu adaaka engbanga emɔti ta ndjea na bina nde ta mɔongɔ, bakɔɔ busa bo mɔti na ndjea. Boso bamohombi ta dii mela ma bobo ko ta dii badjebani bakina. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Endelo baimodiaka. Basɔmbɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ amohomba. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ta busa bo basato, bamodiaka ta tepelo, adii na mobondo ta ndanda e balehi ba mibeko abahokamedja ko abawadja mawadja. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bato basusu badaaka bamohokamedja bakamwaka na bowɛi bo nde ko na misɔmbedja mi nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ehole emoɛnɛkɛ baboti ba nde bakamoa bobuke ko nange ende abala na nde: «Mwana o mba, olokɔi ibowa tina nda? Indja, mbi na sangwao lobangi bobuke ko loohombaki.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Abasɔmbedji bo: «Tina ehombakini na nu nda? Otadjebakadeani bo etungi na mbi bosala misala ta ndako e Sesa?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Endelo ibo baisipoaka tina e mɛko mibatɔndeaka iyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu ayana na bu engbanga emɔti ta Nadjalɛtɛ. Abasumaka. Ko nango abaneaka mɛko mimina ta molema mo nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu akandoaka na konga, na mokuku mopele ko na ngɔlu boso bo Ndjakomba ko na bato.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bileho bi Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Edaaka ta yanga e doomi na batano ba bokondji bo Kaisala Tibɛlɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tibɛlɛ adaaka moto o tomba kiti e bokondji bo Loma ngɔngɔ dji Ogisito (Boindja a 2.1)</char></note> Pɔsɔ Pilato adaaka gupɛlɛnɛlɛ o Yudhea, Elode adaledjaka Galileya, Pilipo mwange e Elode gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ta telitoale e Ituli ko e Talakonitide, ko Lisania adaledjaka Abilɛnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ane na Kaipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ akina mosala a yanga e domi na batano asalaka mosala ngɔngɔ dji motitani onde ko bokio bo Kaipe (bindja a Yoane 18.13; Bik 4.6).</char></note> badaaka ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, ta yanga emina iyena Ndjakomba abala na Yoane mwana o Djakalia ta etengelenge. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yoane adalaka ta mɔɔngɔ masusu ma ekenge e mokili mo madiba ma Yɔlɔdane. Adumbeaka bo: «Hombedjani milema mi bino, ko batisamani bɛngi odieni ekutubanedji e pekato dji bino.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Bobwana na mondumba mokoma bo ta buku e motɛli Isaya bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Moto omɔti adumbeakadea ta etengelenge bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">dongedjani mabaku bɛngi ndjea dji kɛkɛkɛkɛ djiemae bodju!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ibɛngɛ disusu ilumadea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ngomba na makoli masusu matitedjamadea; ndjea dji makumba djininoadea, ndjea dji mimbɔndɔ dji batatadea.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Ko bato basusu baɛnɛdea Moheledji odongi ta dii Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Motingodja mokina: ko bato basusu baɛnɛdea ndenge ekaheledje Ndjakomba</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Emumu e bato badoaka ta dii Yoane bɛngi ababatise. Abalaka na bu bo: «Ibota di mimbitɔ! Omina osaoinedjani ndjea e botiya kɛlɛ e Ndjakomba iyee ekɛɛkɛdea adoe nda? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Botani mbuma dji bimbete inedjakadea bo osɔmbɔtɔnini moda mo bino; kinani bosabaleani ino bɛnɛ bo: “Abalayama adii kɔkɔ o biso.” Modjɔ mo nadii bootɔndeani bo Ndjakomba abwani bohombedja ndeke djidji bo djiimee batitani ba Abalayama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Soka edii mbuti mɛnɛ tina e bolenakaka mole donga ta nginga: mole mosusu modaadea pɛpɛ bobota mbuma djipele bamokwɛlɛdea ko bamodumbadea ta mosa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Emumu e bato bamowadjaka bo: «Ebwani iso bokɔɔ nde?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Abasɔmbedjaka bo: «Moto iyoyo odii na bisendja bibae, apɛ emɔti na iyona otaki iyoyo odii na miya maboya, akabane na iyona otaki.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Baputedji ba puti badoaka bɛngi Yoane ababatise ko bamowadjaka bo: «Molehi, etungi nasu bokɔɔ nde?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Abatɔndea bo: «Pɛpɛ bobakeani eka diko di motwuya mosia bopama.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Basoda bamowadja: «Ko iso etungi nasu bokɔɔ nde?» Abasɔmbedja bo: «Pɛpɛ bokatoani palanga dji moto na ngulu ko pɛpɛ bopundani moto na bokuta, endelo sepani bodia oko iputi di bino.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bato badaaka ba amba na elɛndɛ enɛnɛ: moto na moto alɛnɛkɛ bo Yoane adaaka Kilito. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Iboa Yoane abasɔmbedja ibo basusu bo: «Mbi, naobatisakadeani na madiba, ekahia iyoyo odii na ngulu bonɔ mbi okɛɛkɛdea adoe, nadiiti na enɔi e botingoa mikpulu mi sapato dji nde. Iyo, aobatisadeani na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ta ebɔ e nde apeli inyɔngɛlɛ tina e bonyɔngɛlɛ mbuma na poso dji ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ble: edii mbuma imɔti edii a ibota imɔti na lɔsɔ, ko na ndongo.</char></note>. Adedjadea mbuma, ko atumbadea poso ta mosa mo pɛpɛ bodimea.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Iboa Yoane atɔndeaka bato Bwɛndi Bopele ko abapingedjaka na bileho bikina binɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Endelo Yoane adosaka Elode, iyoo odaledjaka Galileya, modjɔ mo aasɔkɔ Elodiade mwali o mwanango, akɔɔkɔ pongono mikina mɛko mibe minɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ko Elode akɔɔkɔ modjɔ mokina monɔi na bobe: apea Yoane ko amoisa ta bɔlɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batisimo ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mal 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ehole etombaka bato basusu batisimo, Yesu atombaka pongono batisimo; ndelo edaaka yo aangɔnɔ, diko didipoama, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motita ta dii Yesu na mondumba mo mokuku ondingo embenga. Ko kɔpi edonga o diko: «Wɛ odii Mwana o mbi, o epaleli nadii na sepi enɛnɛ na wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɔkɔ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1, 1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu adaaka na bianga bokimana tuku isato ehole ebangaka iyo elomu e nde. Bato balɛdjɛkɛ bo iyo adii mwana o Yosepu. Yosepu adaaka mwana o Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwana o Matata, mwana o Lewi, mwana o Mɛlɛki, mwana o Yanai, mwana o Yosepu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwana o Matatiasi, mwana o Amosi, mwana o Naume, mwana o Esile, mwana o Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwana o Maata, mwana o Matatiasi, mwana o Semeini, mwana o Yosɛkɛ, mwana o Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwana o Yoanani, mwana o Lesa, mwana o Djolobabɛlɛ, mwana o Seatiɛlɛ, mwana o Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana o Mɛlɛki, mwana o Adi, mwana o Kosama, mwana o Elimadama, mwana o Elɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwana o Yesu, mwana o Eliedjɛlɛ, mwana o Yolima, mwana o Matata, mwana o Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwana o Simeona, mwana o Yudha, mwana o Yosepu, mwana o Yoaname, mwana o Eliakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwana o Meleya, mwana o Mena, mwana o Matata, mwana o Natana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Natana ekomama a mikanda mikina Natama </char></note>, mwana o Dhapiti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwana o Yese, mwana o Obɛde, mwana o Boadji, mwana o Sala, mwana o Nasɔni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwana o Aminadaba, mwana o Adamini, mwana o Alini, mwana o Esɛlɔme, mwana o Pɛlɛsɛ, mwana o Yudha, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwana o Yakobo, mwana o Isaka, mwana o Abalayama, mwana o Tela, mwana o Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwana o Seluge, mwana o Leu, mwana o Pelɛge, mwana o Ebɛlɛ, mwana o Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwana o Kenani, mwana o Alapakasadi, mwana o Sɛmɛ, mwana o Noa, mwana o Lemɛki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwana o Matusalɛmɛ, mwana o Enoki, mwana o Yelɛde, mwana o Malalɛlɛ, mwana o Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwana o Enosi, mwana o Sɛti, mwana o Adama, mwana o Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Djabulu ameka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mal 1, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu, aluma na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, adonga ta Yɔlɔdane, ko Mwembo mo moloma ta etengelenge. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Iho, amekama na djabulu masu tuku inɛi. Aiyakaka eka emɔti ta masu mamina, ngɔngɔ dji masu mamina, aoka ndja. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Iboa djabulu abala na nde bo: «Wɛ okadaa Mwana o Ndjakomba, bala na ibanga ididi dikindoe ipa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Eekomama bo: “Moto abwaniti bohela oto na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 8.3.</char></note>mwɛmbɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Djabulu akɛɛ na nde ta diko, amoinedja mbala emɔti bokumu bosusu bo kpɔtɔ, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />ko djabulu na nde bo: «Naopadea bokondji ibubu bosusu ko na ekumu ko na bodieli bo bokumu ibu: midjɔ mia misusu mipama na mbi ko nabwani bomipa na moto yona opali mbi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Okakwa magbunda ta boso bo mbi, leka ilulu losusu lodaadea lo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Ekomama bo: “Okumeadea Kumu Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dit 6.13.</char></note> o wɛ, ko omosaleadea oko iyo mɛnɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Naikina, djabulu amotomba ta Yelusalɛmɛ, amobakei ta sɔngɔ e tepelo, ko abala na nde bo: «Wɛ okadaa Mwana o Ndjakomba, sadumba donga iyaya mbunoko ta kpɔtɔ; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />modjɔ mo ekomama bo: “Ndjakomba alomadea babwɛndi ba nde bɛngi baobanee.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Ko na ikina: “Baokaabi na mɔmɔ ma bobo, bɛngi bo egbota e wɛ edae pɛpɛ bota ibanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 10-11; Ndjem 91.11-12.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Eekomama bo: “Pɛpɛ bomeka Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ.” » <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Aɛnɛ djabulu bo ameki Yesu na mindumba misusu, aso amokina bɛngi aambe ehole ekina.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbangi e mosala mo Yesu ta Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mal 1, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Iboa Yesu aluma na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, asɔmbɔ ta Galileya. Ko gala e nde enangana ta ekenge e mokili momina mosusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Alehaka ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e bobo ko bato basusu bamokumedjaka.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baloni Yesu ta Nadjalɛtɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mal 6, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu aimeaka ta Nadjalɛtɛ, ta ngando iyeye ekandoama yo. Ta busa bo sabata, akwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha bobwana na momɛsɛno mo nde. Aangɔkɔ ta tina e bolanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ko bamopa buku e motɛli Isaya, aediipoa ta ekenge iyeye ekomama bo:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mwembo mo Kumu modii ta dii mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">modjɔ mo ahɔɔini tina e botɔndea bakwali Bwɛndi Bopele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Alomani tina e botɔndea bato ba bɔlɔkɔ bo baimanabi ta bɔlɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ko bato baagwa miso bo basɔmbɔbi boɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">bolwɛ bato badi bonyɔkɔmɔ bosɔmi,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />botɔndea bato bo yanga iyeye Kumu ainedjadea bopele bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 61.1-2, elangama ngɔngɔ dji mokongo moyou mo gɛlɛki.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ko Yesu akunda buku, ko aepa ta dii mosali ko adaa na mobondo. Bato basusu ta tei e ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha miso ma bobo madaaka mamoindja. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Iboa, abanga bobatɔndea bo: «Busa ibubu, Ikomi idii ikokedjami ta dii ino ibibi baokakadea busa ibubu.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bato basusu badaaka babala tina e nde, bakamoaka na mɛko mipele imimi mimanaka ta monɔkɔ mo nde, ko babalaka bo: «Iyoyo te mwana o Yosepu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ olangeadeanini ekuanedji iyeye: “Monganga, saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ.” Obaladeani na mbi pongono: “Iso lookabi misusu minɔkɔ ta Kapalanaume saheledja, kokedja midjɔ mimina misusu iyaya, ta ngando e wɛ mɛnɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ko abakeaka bo: «Naotɔndekadeani sooti bo te badhimee motɛli ta ngando e nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Sooti mɛɛnɛ, naotɔndeini bo bali bagwa na baami badaaka banɛnɛ ta Isalɛlɛ ta ndelo e Eliya, ehole ediipama busa mbuwa aikwaka bonɔ bianga bisato na mboka ko ndja enɛnɛ edaaka ta mokili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 1 Bak 17.1.</char></note> mo mina mosusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Enakoboa, Ndjakomba ailoma Eliya adii mwali omɔti ta tei e bobo endelo akɛɛ ta dii mwali ogwa na moomi ta ngando e Salepeta ta ekenge e mokili mo Sidona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 1 Bak 17.8616.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Bato ba mabha badaaka banɛnɛ ta Isalɛlɛ ta ehole e motɛli Elisa, ko pɛpɛ moto omɔti osɛnɔ na mabha ma nde, dongedja oko Namana, moto o Siliya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a 2 Bak 5.1-14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Iyaya aoka bo mɛko mimina, bato basusu baluma na kɛlɛ ta tei e ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Baangɔ diko, ko bamobengana ta ngando, ko bakɛɛ na nde mbunoko ta sɔngɔ e ikoli ta esika etongama ngando e bobo tina e bomodumba ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Endelo iyo, anɔi ta ndanda e bobo ko aso akɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mal 1, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu atiti naikina ta Kapalanaume, ngando emɔti enɛnɛ e Galileya; adaaka aleha bato ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sabata: busa bo iheme di Bayudha tina e miɔngɔnɔ</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bato bamokaka badaaka bakamoa na mondumba mo nde mo boleha, modjɔ mo bo adaaka abala na kpati esusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha, edaaka ena moto omɔti iyoyo odaaka na mwembo mo pita. Agama na ngulu bo: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Aa! Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ, modjɔ mo wɛ na su nda? Odoi tina e bolobedja? Naodjebaka bopele: Mosɛnɔke o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu agamea mwembo mobe; ko amolomi: «Dipa monɔkɔ mo wɛ ko imana ta dii moto iyoyo!» Mwembo mobe modumba moomi omina ta kpɔtɔ ta ndanda e bato, ko moimani ta tei e nde ko moimokɔ bobe. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bato basusu bakamoa bobuke mɛɛnɛ ko basawadjaka ibo na ibo: «Iyeye ndenge mɛko nda! Moto omina aimedjakadea membo mi pita na kpati ko na ngulu ko membo mibe mimanakadea!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ko gala e Yesu enangana ta bisika bisusu bi ekenge e mokili emina.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bego banɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mal 1, 29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu aimana ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha, akwea ta ndako e Simona. Bokiyo bo mwali o Simona adaaka na pɛpɛlɛ epipo, ko bamowadja bo akɔe moo eka tina e nde <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu angulama mbuti na nde, ko agamea pɛpɛlɛ. Ko pɛpɛlɛ emokina, na mbala emɔti asangɔdjɔ, ko abanga bobakɔmedja.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ta ehole e mɔkɔmɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mal 1.32 ko nase.</char></note>, bato basusu badaaka na bato ba bego dji mindumba misusu badoa na bu ta dii Yesu. Abakea mabɔ ta dii moto na moto ko abaheledjaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Membo mibe pongono mimanaka ta dii bato banɛnɛ, ko migamaka bo: «Wɛ odii Mwana o Ndjakomba!» Endelo Yesu abasia na ngulu badae pɛpɛ bobala, modjɔ mo badjebaka bo iyo adii Kilito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mal 1, 35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Iyana aya busa, Yesu aimana ko akɛi ta etengelenge. Emumu e bato bamohombaka; bamotanea ko bamekaka bomosiya bo adae pɛpɛ bo bakina. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Endelo abala na bu bo: «Etungi na mbi botɔndea Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ta ngando djinɛnɛ dji kina pongono modjɔ mo nalomama na tina emina.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ko atɔndɔkɔ Bwɛndi Bopele ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha ba Yudhea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei batingami ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1, 16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu aemaka ta mokula mo ibeke di Genedjalɛtɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibeke di Genedjalɛtɛ: kombe ekina e ibeke a Galileya. Boindja pongono a Mal 6.53</char></note> ko emumu e bato bamombambamedjaka tina e booka mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Aɛnɛ maato mabae matingi ta ibongu mbuti na ngondo. Baoweli baswi baduboa ta tei e mu basosaka midjanga mi bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Ta maato imia mabae atitea ta bomɔti ibua bodaaka bo Simona. Amowadja bo atangodje bwato ta dua ko, adaaka na mobondo ta tei e bwato ko alehaka emumu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ehole esiedja iyo boleha, abala na Simona bo: «Titedja bwato ta mbɛngɛ, ko dumbani midjanga mi bino bɛngi bo oowoeni swi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simona amosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, losatungei bulu bosusu ko lodiiti eka emɔti endelo, asabala wɛ iboa, nadumbadea midjanga naikina.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Iboa badumba midjanga ta madiba ko mitaedja swi banɛnɛ, midjanga mi bobo mibangaka boaleana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 21.6.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Babea binabu ibibi badaaka ta bwato bokina bo badoe a bakamoa. Binabu badoa ko balumedja maato mabae ma swi botɔɔ mbuti na bodinda. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ehole eɛnɛ Simona Petelo midjɔ mimina, akwa na magbunda ta boso bo Yesu ko abala na nde bo: «Kumu, donga mbuti na mbi, modjɔ mo na dii moto o pekato.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Adaaka na bokamoa bonɛnɛ, iyo na bato ibibi badaaka na nde, tina e swi banɛnɛ ibia baowa bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Edaaka oko boa tina e binande Djake ko Yoane, bana ba Djebede. Endelo Yesu abala na Simona: «Pɛpɛ bobanga oko, banga busa ibubu oimei mohombeli o bato.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Basɔmbedja bwato ta ibongu, bakina losusu, ko baso bakimana Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mal 1, 40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ehole edaaka Yesu ta ngando enɛnɛ emɔti, moto omɔti iyoo oluma mokuku na mabha. Aɛnɛ iyo Yesu, asunami ta kpɔtɔ ko amoangɔnɔkɔ ko abala na nde bo: «Kumu, okapala, obwani bosɛnodjani.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu aninodja ebɔ e nde ko amobɛndjɛ ko abala na nde bo: «Napalakadea modjɔ momina, sɛnɔɔ!» Ko na mbala emɔti mabha ma nde masia. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu amosia bo adae pɛpɛ botɔndea moto: «Kɛɛ asainedje ta di nganga o Ndjakomba ko pa mbeka mondumba mokoma Mose ta mobeko mo nde, iboa bato basusu badhimadea bo osɛnɔi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 14.2-32.</char></note> sooti.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ta tina emina, gala e Yesu enangana pamba djisusu, ko emumu e bato badoa ta esika edaaka iyo tina e bomohokamedja ko abaheledje na bego dji bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Endelo Yesu asatiedjaka ta etengelenge tina e boɔngɔnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moto o binama bikatatake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mal 2, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu adaaka aleha. Bapalisai ko na balehi ba mibeko badaaka ena; badongaka ta ngando djisusu dji Galileya ko idji dji Yudhea, ko na dji Yelusalɛmɛ. Ngulu e Kumu edaaka ta dii iyo ko aheledja bato ba bego. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Bato badoa, na moto omɔti o binama bikatatake na ngaka; bahombaka bo bamokwedje ta ndako ko bamosambee ta boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Endelo baidia esika e bomokwedja, tina emumu e bato. Baiwea ta diko di ndonga e ndako, batɔi ndɛlɛ ta diko di etondo, ko bamotitedji na ngaka ta ndanda e bato, boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu aɛnɛ edhimeli e bobo, abala na moto o yogo bo: «Mina mbi, pekato dji wɛ djikutubani.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Balehi ba mobeko na Bapalisai balɛnɛ bo: «Moto iyoyo adii nda? Iyoyo otiolakadea Ndjakomba? Moto ndani obwani bokutubanedja pekato? Ediiti oko Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Endelo Yesu adjebaka malɛno ma bobo, abasɔmbedjaka bo: «Tina elɛnɛkɛ ino ta milema mi bino iboa nda? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Modjɔ monɔi na bopipo nda bobala bo: “Pekato dji wɛ djikutubani”, kaoko bobala na nde bo: “Angɔɔ ko dala?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Endelo napalakadea odjebeni bo: Mwana o moto adii iyaya ta kpɔtɔ na bokondji tina e bokutubanedja pekato.» Abala na moto o binama bikatatake bo: «Angɔɔ, andowa ngaka e wɛ ko yana ta ndako e wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Mbala emɔti, moto omina asangɔdjɔkɔ ta boso bo bato basusu, aandoa ngaka ko ayana ta ndako e nde ko adaaka akumedja Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bato basusu bakamoa. Ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba, balumaka na bɔɔ, ko babalaka bo: «Iso loɛni busa ibubu midjɔ mi bokamoa!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mal 2, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu aimanaka ko aɛnɛ moputedji o puti omɔti kombe e nde Lewi, adaaka na mobondo ta bilo e puti. Yesu abala na nde bo: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi aangɔ, ko akina losusu ko amokimana. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lewi akɔɔ tɛkɛ enɛnɛ tina e nde ta ndako e nde; baputedji ba puti banɛnɛ ko bato bakina badaaka esika emɔti ta mesa na bu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bapalisai ko balehi ba mobeko bakotoa modjɔ momina; bawadjaka na batingami ba nde bo: «Tina ndani oyakakadeani mia ko omwakakadeani na baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba pekato?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bato ibibi badii na mikuku mipele te bakambe na monganga, endelo bato ba bego bakakambe na monganga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Naidoa abeya bato ba bodju, endelo nadoa abeya bato ba pekato bɛngi bahombedje milema mi bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko na mongilo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mal 2, 18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bapalisai babala na Yesu bo: «Batingami ba Yoane, ko na ibibi ba biso, bakakɔe mongilo mandɛi mandɛi ko bakaɔngɔne; ko ibibi ba wɛ, bakayake ko bakamwake.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ndenge ndani bato ibia babeami ta tɛkɛ e moki ba bwani bokɔɔ mongilo ta ndelo edii moswa moki ta ndanda e bobo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Endelo masu ma ngɔngɔ ehole ebakinabi moomi o moki; ta masu mamina, bakɔɔbi mongilo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu abala na bu pongono ekuanedji iyeye: «Moto taalake epasa e esendja eyeene bɛngi bo atonge na esendja eyou; tengasa, esendja eyeene ealeadea ko esendja eyeene etabwanadea na iyee eyou. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Moto taise vino eyeene ta mbola djiyou; tengasa, vino eyeene ebwani bobatodja mbola: ko vino ebwani bosopea ko mbola djibatoanadea. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Endelo vino eyeene, ebɔngi na mbola djiyeene! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ko moto ndani okadhimee bomwa vino eyeene ngɔngɔ dji bomwa vino eyou. Basɔmbedja bo: “Vino eyou edii epele.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko na busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mal 2, 23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ta busa bomɔti bo sabata, Yesu anɔɔkɔ ta gbie dji mbuma dji ble. Batingami ba nde batswaka mbuma dji ble ba dji sianaka na mɔmɔ ma bobo ko ba dji yakaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Busa bomɔti bo sabata, a mikanda mikina mikoma bo na mɔmɔ madi na sabata e babae a songe o boso ekadae mbuti na ehole ekabuke bo mbuma (boindja a Lew 23.5-14). Ko bayakaka mbuma: Boindja a Dit 23.26 </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ndambo e Bapalisai babala bo: «Tina ndani obedjakini mobeko imu mosii bokɔɔ mosala ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 34.21.</char></note>?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Oilangani nongo modjɔ mikɔɔ Dhapiti ehole edaaka iyo na ndja, na bato badalaka na nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ndenge ndani akwea ta ndako e Ndjakomba, atomba mapa ma mabondja, amaya ko amapa na bato badalaka na nde, mapa mamina nongo moto omɔti aidaka na enɔli e bomayaka, dongedja oko banganga ba Ndjakomba ibo bɛnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu abalaka na bu bo: «Mwana o moto adii moswa busa bo sabata.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto o ebɔ ekatatake</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mal 3, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ta busa bokina bo sabata, Yesu akwea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko abanga boleha. Moto omɔti adaaka ena ebɔ e nde e baami edaaka ekatatake. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Balehi ba mobeko na Bapalisai bakokoledjaka Yesu, embingi akaheledja moto ta busa bo sabata, bɛngi bamodie na modjɔ mo bomopunda. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Endelo Yesu adjebaka malɛno ma bobo. Abala na moto iyoyo odaaka na ebɔ ekatatake: «Angɔ ko ema yana ta ndanda.» Asangɔdjɔ ko aema diko. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abala na bu bo: «Naowadjakadeani bo: Edhimama bokɔɔ ta busa bo sabata nde? Bokɔɔ bopele kaoko bokɔɔ bobe? Boheledja bomɔ bo moto kaoko bobobedja?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Iboa, abaindja ibo basusu, ko abala na moto o omina bo: «Ninodja ebɔ.» Aninodja ebɔ e nde ko eso ehela. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Endelo balehi ba mobeko ko na Bapalisai baluma na kɛlɛ ko basatɔndɔnɔkɔ ta tei e bobo bo modjɔ ndani mo bwani ibo bokɔɔ tina e Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔi bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mal 3, 13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />A masu mamina, Yesu aiwea ta ngomba tina e boangɔnɔ ko anɔdjɔ bulu bosusu oko ta boangɔnɔ Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Aya busa, abeya batingami ba nde ahɔɔkɔ ta tei e bobo doomi na babae ko abapa kombe e bapɔsɔlu: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simona – iyo opa iyo kombe e Petelo – Andele mwanango, Djake, Yoane, Pilipo, Batelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo, Tomasi, Djake, mwana o Alipe, Simona – obeaka bo Djeloti –, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yudhe, mwana o Djake, ko na Yudhasi Isikaliote, iyoyo okaba Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi emumu e bato ko aheledji bato ba bego</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu atita ta ngomba engbanga emɔti na bu aema ta esika e nase, ta esika edaaka emumu e batingami ba nde. Ko badaaka ena pongono na bakina bato banɛnɛ badongaka ta Yudhea esusu, ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko ta ngando djinɛnɛ Tile na Sidona djidaaka ta mokula mo dua; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />ibo badoaka bɛngi bamohokamedje ko bɛngi bahele na bego dji bobo. Bato batungeamaka na membo mi pita batingoamaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ko bato basusu bahombaka ba mobɛndjɛe, modjɔ mo ngulu edaaka emɔti eimana na nde ko abaheledjaka ibo basusu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mongandi ko na ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu aindja batingami ba nde ko abala bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Mongandi ta dii, ino bakwali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">modjɔ mo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodii tina e bino!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mongandi, ta dii ino ibia baokakadea ndja edɛdiyeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">modjɔ mo ogoladeani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mongandi, ta dii ino bayeaka biyo edɛdiyeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">modjɔ mo osɛkɛbini!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />«Mongandi na ino bia ndelo elonadeani bato, nongo baka satuba na nu baka osingani nongo baka obaleani bobe ta tina e Mwana o moto. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Sepani ndelo ebwani modjɔ momina boimea pimboani na sepi, modjɔ mo ta busa iputi inɛnɛ dioambakadeani. Modjɔ mo bakɔkɔ ba bobo banɔngedjaka batɛli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja 2 Kolnk 36.16; Bik 7.52.</char></note> okomondumba momina momɔti.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />«Endelo ndjokwa ta dii ino badieli, modjɔ mo osiani bodia ibondo di bino ehele!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ndjokwa ta dii ino ibia balumi na igola edɛdiyeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">modjɔ mo okadeani ndja!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ndjokwa ta dii ino ibia basɛkɛkɛdea edɛdiyeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">modjɔ mo odiadeani malaka ko oyeadeani!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />«Ndjokwa ta dii ino ndelo ebaladea bato basusu bopele tina e bino, modjɔ mo edii oko mondumba momɔti imua mokɔɔkɔ bakɔkɔ ba bobo batɛli ba bokuta!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopala baloni</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5, 38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7, 12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Endelo nabalakadea na nu ibia baokakadeani bo: Palani baloni ba bino, kɔɔni mɛko mipele ta dii bato bakaoloneni, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />djongoani ibia baolakedjakani ko ongɔnɔni tina ebia baonyɔkɔlɔdeani. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Moto akaoboma epapata ta mobanga momɔti balea koko mokina; moto akaokatoa simisi mokinea pongono esendja e wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Moto akaowadja eka mopa, moto akaokatoa eka e wɛ pɛpɛ bosweana na nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Kɔmeani bato bakina oko mondumba mopalakadea ino baokɔmeeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja Lom 13.8-10.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Okapalani ibibi baka opaleni, tɛtɔ ndani ediiadea ino? Bato ba pekato pongono bakapale boto ibia bakapale! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ko okakɔɔni bopele oto ta dii ibia bakaokɔeni bopele, tɛtɔ ndani ibwani ino bodia? Bato ba pekato bo bɛɛnɛ bakakɔe koko iboa! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ko okabekedjani leka ta dii bato ibibi babwani bosɔmbedjani, tɛtɔ ndani ebwani ino bodia? Bato ba pekato bakabekedje leka pongono a di bato ba pekato na elɛndɛ ebo ba basɔmbedjabi! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Endelo ino palani baloni ba bino, kɔɔni bopele ko bekedjani na pɛpɛ bosɔmbedja. Iboa, ibondja i bino idaadea inɛnɛ odaadeani bana ba Onɔi Diko, modjɔ mo iyo adii mopele ta dii bato bakadae pɛpɛ bosɔmbedja bopele bo moto na ta dii bato babe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Sangwanu adii molumake na bwela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Boi 34.6; Ndj 86.15.</char></note>. Ino pongono daani ondingo iyo.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛpɛ bosambedjani bato bakina</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Pɛpɛ bosambedja minɔ moto modjɔ mo basaosambedja wɛ pongono; pɛpɛ bodumba minɔ moto na ikambo basaodumba wɛ pongono. Yɛɛni bato bakina ko baoyɛɛdeani. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Pani bato leka ko baopadeani leka, aisadea ta mabenga ma bino leka lonɛnɛ alodɛsɛdea alosueyadea bɛngi lolume botɔɔ, ko losopeane. Modjɔ mo aopadeani oko ndenge emɔti ekapɛ ino binanu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu abatɔndea naikina ekuanedji emɔti bo: «Moto omɔti o miso mago abwani koko boinedja minande o miso mago ndjea? Ibo basusu babae batakwadea ta mombɔndɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Pɛpɛ nongo motingami omɔti anɔi molehi o nde, endelo motingami iyoyo oikoi bopele bileho bisusu bi molehi abwani bobwana na molehi o nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Tina ndani oɛnɛkɛdea ebumbu e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di mwangwao, ko otaɛnɛkɛdea ibaya isulu idii na wɛ ta diiso? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ndenge ndani ebwani wɛ bobala na mwangwao bo: “Maninga, amba nadongedje ebumbu e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di wɛ”, ekahia wɛ mɛnɛ otaɛnɛkɛdea ibaya i sulu idii ta diiso di wɛ? Moto o ndango e mongi, dongedja boso ibaya isulu idi ta diiso di wɛ, ko oɛnɛdea bopele bɛngi odongedje epɛndjɛ e epɛtɛ edii ta diiso di mwangwao.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole ko na mbuma imu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12, 33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Mole mopele temobote mbuma djibe, ko mole mobe temobote mbuma djipele. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Modjɔ mo mole na mole mokadjebame na mbuma djimu, tebatswɛ mbuma dji pigi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Figi: mbuma e bopɛpɛtɛ ko epele e mole momɔti a Isalɛlɛ, ko ebwani na inono.</char></note> ta mole mo ndjubɛ, tebatswɛ mbuma dji vino ta mole mo kwɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwɛ: edii mole momɔti mokadae pɛ bobota mbuma, ko mokasie mole mokina bobota mbuma.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Moto mopele akainedje mɛko mipele imimi midii ta molema mo nde; moto mobe akainedje mɛko mibe imimi midii ta molema mo nde mobe. Modjɔ mo, monɔkɔ mo moto na moto mokaimedje midjɔ miluma ta molema mo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndako ibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Tina ndani okabeenini “Kumu, Kumu”, ko tosumeni mɛko mi mbi? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nadii boinedjani moto ndani obwani na iyoo odii badoa ta dii mbi, aoki mibalo mi mbi ko amiisi ta mosala: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />moto omina abwani na moto iyoyo opika ndako; alongea mombɔndɔ mombɛngɛ ko angɔdjɔ moboku ta ndeke. Ehole eduaka pela, madiba malumaka ta ndako, endelo ndako eikwaka, modjɔ mo epikamaka bopele. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Endelo moto okaoke mibalo mi mbi ko tamise ta mosala abwani na moto iyona opiki ndako diko di kpɔtɔ, pɛpɛ boisea moboku. Ko ta ndelo esadoa pela akwea ta ndako emina pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ ndako emina ekwa, ko ebukeani bobuke mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mosali o kapita o basodha mokama</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8, 5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ehole esiedja Yesu bobala mɛko mimina misusu na bato, akwea ta Kapalanaume. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kapita o basodha mokama omɔti adaaka na mosali o nde iyoyo opalaka iyo bobuke, adaaka apeka na yogo mbuti na bogwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Aoka iyo bato babala ta tina e Yesu, alomaka basuku bamɔti ba Bayudha ta dii iyo bamowadje bɛngi adoe aheledja mosali o nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Aimea bo ta dii Yesu, bamoɔngɔnɔkɔ na ngulu ko babalaka na nde bo: «Edii bopele okamoe moto iyoyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Modjɔ mo akapale ekomi e biso ko edii iyo moto olotongea ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Iboa Yesu akɛɛ na bu engbanga emɔti ko ehole eimea bo mbuti na ndako, kapita o basodha mokama aloma binande bamotɔndee bo: «Kumu, pɛpɛ bosatungeako ngasa, mbi na bwaniti bɛngi bo okwe ta ndako e mbi; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ta tina e mina nabwanakitiki bodoa mbi mɛɛnɛ ta di wɛ. Endelo bala oto kɔpi emɔti pɛ, bɛngi mosali o mbi ahele. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Modjɔ mo mbi nadii na bakondji diko di mbi, endelo nadii na basodha nase dji bokondji bo mbi, ko nakabala na omɔti bo: “Kɛɛ!” Ko adii bokɛɛ; nakabala na okina bo: “Doa!” Adii bodoa, ko nakabala na mosali o mbi bo: “Kɔɔ iboo!” Adii bokɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ndelo eoka Yesu mɛko mimina, amodhimea, aindja emumu e bato ibibi bamokimanaka ko abala bo: «Nabalakadea na nu nongo ta Isalɛlɛ napakina ɛnɛ moto omɔti o edhimeli mondumba imumu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ehole esɔmbɔ bato ibibi balomaka kapita o basodha mokama ta ndako, batanea mosali omina asi bohela.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asisodji mwana o mwali o bogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu akɛɛ na ikina ta ngando emɔti kombe eyu Naine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naine: edii ngando edii satina di pamba ekadonge modaakabusa a tei e Galileya.</char></note>. Batingami ba nde na emumu e bato bakina bakɛɛkɛ na nde engbanga emɔti. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ehole eimea bo mbuti na ngando, basonganaka bapeli mosongo mo moto omɔti mogo. Mwana moomi omina omɔti, nango adaaka mwali o bogwa, ko emumu e bato ba ngando badaaka na nde engbanga emɔti. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ndelo eɛnɛ Kumu mwali iyona, amookea pɛhɛ ko abala na nde bo: «Pɛpɛ boyeako!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ko asalinda mbuti, apea ibaya; bato ibibi bamopeaka baema. Abala bo: «Mwenga, nabali na wɛ, sisoa!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Iboa, moto iyoo ogwaka, adaa na mobondo ko abanga bobala. Ko amopa nango. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bato basusu baluma na bɔɔ, ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba ko babalaka bo: «Motɛli omɔti monɛnɛ aimei ta ndanda e biso ko Ndjakomba adoi aindja bato ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ko gala e Yesu enangana ta Yudhea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 6.17 ko nase.</char></note> mosusu ko ta ngango dji mbuti mbuti.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balomami ba Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11, 2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Batingami ba Yoane bamotɔndea midjɔ mimina misusu, ko iyo abea batingami ba nde babae, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />abaloma ta dii Kumu amowadja bo: «Odii Masiya iyoo okɛɛkɛdea adoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mat 11.3 ko nase. </char></note>? Kaoko ebɔngi na su boamba moto okina?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ehole eimea bo ta dii Yesu, babala na nde bo: «Yoane Mobatisi alolomi ta dii wɛ tina e boowadja bo: “Odii Masiya iyoyo okɛɛkɛdea adoe kaoko ebwani na su boamba moto okina?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Oko a ehole emina, aheledja bato banɛnɛ ba bego, bato ba yɛɛmɛ, ko bato badaaka na membo mibe ko aenɛdjɛ bato banɛnɛ badaaka na miso mago. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ko abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɛɛni atɔndea Yoane mɛko misusu miɛni ino ko mioki ino: bato ibibi baagwa miso basɔmbi boɛnɛ, bitumbɛ badalakadea, bato ba mabha basɛnɔkɔdea, bato ba matoi mago baokakadea, bato bago basisoakadea, ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 35.5-6; 61.1.</char></note> Bwɛndi Bopele botɔndeamakadea ta dii bakwali <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Ko mongandi ta dii moto iyoyo odaabi pɛpɛ bodumba edhimeli e nde ta tina e mbi!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ngɔngɔ dji boyana bo batingami ba Yoane, Yesu aso abanga bobala na emumu e bato ta tina e Yoane: «Eka ekɛɛki ino aindja ta etengelenge nda? Mososongo mokumanaki na mopɛpɛ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ekɛɛki ino aindja nde? Moto omɔti alwai bisendja bipele? Endelo ibia balwali bisendja bipele badii na bodieli bakadae ta ndako dji bakondji. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ekɛɛki ino aindja nde? Motɛli? Sooti, nabalakadea na nu bo: iyo anɔi motɛli. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Modjɔ mo ekomama tina e Yoane bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Indja nalomadea molomami o mbi boso bo wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">abobɔngedja ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal 3.1.</char></note> tina e wɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Naotɔndeini bo, ta ndanda e bato basusu ibibi babotama na bali, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti onɔi Yoane, endelo ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba iyo odii mokɛkɛ amonɔi na bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bato basusu na baputedji ba puti bamokaka badhimeaka Ndjakomba ko batombaka batisimo ba Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Endelo Bapalisai ko balehi ba mobeko badumba eka epalaka Ndjakomba tina e bobo ko balona pongono botomba batisimo ba Yoane.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu abala naikina bo: «Mbi nadii bokuanedja bato ba mbota e busa ibubu mɛnɛ na nda? Badii olongo ba nda? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Babwani na bɛngɛ ibibi badii na mbondo ta esika ekaputoane bato, baasagameana ibo na ibo: “Lobomeakini baa mindule bakɛkɛkɛkɛ ko obuitini! Loembeakini ndjembo dji ilaka ko oyeitini.” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Modjɔ mo, Yoane Mobatisi adowa iyo, ta yake mwɛmbɛ, ko ta mwake vino, ko obalini na nde bo: “Adii na mwembo mobe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana o moto adoa iyo, ayaki, ko amwaki, ko obalini na nde bo: “Indja moto iyoyo akapale seko boyaka ko na bomwaka, adii mwange e baputedji ba puti ko na bato ba pekato!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Endelo konga e Ndjakomba bodjebani sooti tadii bana ba nde basusu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako e Simona mopalisai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mopalisai omɔti abea Yesu bɛngi ayaka ta ndako e nde; akwea ta dii mopalisai ko adaa ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ta ngando emina enɛnɛ, mwali omɔti o pekato aoka bo Yesu adaaka ta ndako e mopalisai, adoa na molangi momɔti mo malasi mo motsuiya monɛnɛ molumake! <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ko aema diko sangɔngɔ dji nde, adaaka ayea biyo, ta mako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 38</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boema sangɔngɔ dji mako ma Yesu: edaka momɛsɛno mo ehole yena boninodja mako a bidie a mesa e nase. A ehole boyaka basaika na ebɔ ko boninodja mako sangɔngɔ.</char></note> ma Yesu, ko mbisoli dji nde ipɔɔdjɔkɔ mako ma nde, ko ahakoaka mako ma Yesu na swe dji nde; ama bhimbaka na isuma ko asuowaka malasi ta mako masusu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Iyaya aɛnɛ mopalisai iyoyo omobeaka iboa, asabalea ta molema bo: «Moto iyoyo asoada motɛli, akɔkidjeba bo mwali iyoyo omopeli adii: mwali o pekato.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu abala na mopalisai bo: «Simona, nadii na mɛko mibotɔndea.» Simona abala: «Molehi, tɔndeani.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Ko Yesu abala bo: «Bato babae badaaka na nyongo ta dii mobekedji o palanga omɔti. Omɔti adaaka na nyongo e palanga mikama mitano, okina palanga tuku itano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Iboa baidaaka na eka e bomosɔmbedja, abayɛɛ na nyongo dji bobo ibo basusu babae. Ta tei e bobo babae onɔɔdea bomopala nda?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simona asɔmbedja bo: «Nalɛdji edii iyoyo oyɛi iyo na nyongo enɛnɛ.» Yesu abali na nde bo: «Wɛ olongi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ko ahombana ta dii mwali, abala na Simona bo: «Wɛ oɛni mwali iyo? Nakwei ta ndako e wɛ, wɛ osopeitini madiba ta mako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi ndenge boyambi edii Byuda. Boindja a Mba 18.4; 19.2.</char></note>, endelo iyo, apɔdjini mako na mbisoli dji nde ko amahakoaki na swe dji nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wɛ obhimbitini, endelo iyo, donga akwei iyo ta ndako, akiniti bobhimba mako ma mbi. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Osopeiti mosula ta molo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boidja Ndj 23.5 ko nase</char></note> mo mbi, endelo iyo, asopeini malasi ta mako. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Na tina e mina nabalakadea na wɛ bo pekato dji nde djinɛnɛ djikutubani, modjɔ mo ainedjini bwela bonɛnɛ. Endelo adii iyona okutubanedji bo na midjɔ mikɛkɛ akapale oko na bokɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Iboa abala na mwali bo: «Pekato dji wɛ djikutubani.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bato badaaka na nde ta mesa basabalea ta tei e milema mi bobo bo: «Moto omina nda iyoyo obwani bokutubanedja pekato?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Endelo Yesu abala na mwali bo: «Edhimeli e wɛ eoheledji: kɛɛ na bogo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bali bakimanaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu asombaka ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ na djikɛkɛkɛkɛ alehaka ko adjebedjaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Batingami doomi na ba babae badaaka na nde, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />iboa badaaka pongono engbanga emɔti na bali bamɔti batingoa iyo na membo mibe ko na ibia baheledja iyo na bego dji bobo: Malia o ngando e Magadala, iyona obengana Yesu membo mibe sambo; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana, mwali o Kudja, moto omɔti iyoyo odaaka abanea leka lo Elode; Susani, na bali bakina banɛnɛ ibibi bakɔmedjaka Yesu na batingami ba nde na leka lo bobo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e moaneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mal 4, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Emumu e bato ibia baputoanaka ko bato badonga ta ngando djinɛnɛnɛnɛ badoaka ta dii Yesu. Abatɔndea ekuanedji emɔti bo: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Moaneli omɔti akɛɛkɛ amɛsɛ mbuma ta gbie e nde. Enakoboa ta ehole eanaka iyo mbuma, djikina djikwaka ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea, bato baidalakaka ko mbulu ba diko badoa ko badjikomakaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Mbuma ikina ikwa ta diko di ndeke: Itɔɔkɔ ko ikakana modjɔ mo itakaka botititi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Djikina djikwaka ta tei e ndjubɛ, djibangaka botɔɔ, ndjubɛ djitɔɔ na dju engbanga emɔti ko djimbambamedja mbuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Endelo, mbuma djikina djikwaka ta kpɔtɔ djipele; ko kona djitɔɔ: engi kona eboti mbuma mokama.» Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abala naikina bo: «Yɛɛ bo iyona odii na matoi ma booka, aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ndani Yesu akabale na bikuanedji!</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mal 4, 10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Batingami ba Yesu bamowadja bo abatingodje tina e ekuanedji emina. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Inoni obolodjini kɔndjɔ e bodjeba midjɔ mi mbombi mi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba; ekahia adii ibia bakina, nabalaka na bu na bikuanedji ko iboa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“nongo bakaindja badae pɛpɛ boɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">nongo bakaoka badae pɛpɛ bodjeba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6.9, elangama ngɔngɔ dji mokongo moyou mo Bagɛlɛke.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodji ekuanedji e moaneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mal 4, 13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Indjani tina e ekuanedji e mina: kona edii Mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ta mokpɛngɔ mo ndjea, edii wɛtoko bato ibia baokakadea Mobalo mo Ndjakomba, ekahia djabulu adoi abakatoa mobalo momina ta milema mi bobo ko bobasia bo badae pɛpɛ bodhima bɛngi badae pɛpɛ bohela. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Bakina badii ondingo mokpɔtɔ mo ndeke: baoki Mobalo ko bamoasɔi na mongandi. Endelo Mobalo momina moditi mobokamake ta dii bo, ko bakadhime na mo ehole mokɛkɛ, ko ndelo edoi mameko basundoli. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Kona ekwa ta ndanda e ndjubɛ edii bato ibibi baoki Mobalo mo Ndjakomba; endelo bambambami ta mɔndɔ mo bobo ta tina e bokɛsɛdji, bodieli ko na mapele ma mohelo, ko ta tina emina ebotiti mbuma ipingake. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Kona ekwa ta kpɔtɔ djipele ebwani na bato ibibi baoki Mobalo ko bamobanei bopele ta milema, bamopei na ingbangba ko baboti mbuma.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e molinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mal 4, 21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Moto tabwanedje molinda bɛngi amokunde na poke kaoko bomobomba ta tina i bwako. Endelo bakamobakee ta ebakeli e molinda bɛngi bato ibia bakweaka ta ndako baɛnɛ bohu. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Modjɔ mo midjɔ misusu mibolama miɛnɛmɛbi ta bohu, midjɔ misusu mi mbombi mihuodjamabi. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Iboa, kebani na mondumba mookakadea ino! Modjɔ mo moto iyoo odii na eka, bamopabi lokina; ekahia ta dii iyona odii pɛpɛ eka emɔti bamotinoadedea nongo eka elɛdjɛki iyo bodia.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nange e Yesu ko na bana ba nango</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mal 3, 31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nange e Yesu ko bana ba nango badoa amohomba, endelo baihɔnɔ boimea ta polo edaaka iyo tina e emumu e bato. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Bato bakina bamotɔndea bo: «Ngwao na bana ba ngwao ba baami badii sokolu ko bakambakadea baoɛnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu asɔmbedja bato bamina bo: «Nange e mbi ko bange i mbi, edii bato ibibi badii baoka mobalo mo Ndjakomba ko bamoisakadea ta mosala.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asii lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mal 4, 35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu atitea ta bwato na batingami ba nde, ko abala na bu bo: «Lokɛeni ta ngunda ekina e ibeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epali bobala tina e ibeke di Galileya. Telitoale edii ta ngunda ekina ehelamaka bato badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha.</char></note>.» Ko baso bakɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ta ehole edaaka bo baluka bwato, Yesu awɛkɛ hiɔ. Na mbala emɔti lungu ebatanea ta ibeke; madiba mabangaka bokwea ta bwato ko badaaka ta tei e ikama. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Iboa batingami basalindaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamosisodja ko babala na nde bo: «Molehi, molehi, lohombakadea logwɛ!» Yesu asisoa, ko agamea mopɛpɛ na mbonge djipɔpɔni, ko bogo bokwei. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Iboa, Yesu awadja batingami ba nde bo: «Edhimeli e bino edii djɔ?» Baimea na bɔɔ ko baluma na bokamoa, ko basawadjanaka bo: «Imumu mondumba mo moto nda? Edae mipɛpɛ na bibuku bi mbonge lomosumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Ndj 65.5;89.10; 107.23-32.</char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moomi omɔti odaaka na membo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mal 5, 1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Baimeaka ta dɔɔngɔ dikina di ibeke ta ekenge e mokili e Bagadaliɛniɛ ta ngunda e Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ko ta ehole eduboaka iyo ta ibongu, asonganaka na moto omɔti o ngando enɛnɛ emina iyo adaaka na membo mibe; masu mayai aidaka alwa bisendja ko aidaaka awɛɛ ta ndako, endelo adaaka awɛɛ oko ta makila. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Aɛnɛ iyo Yesu, agama na ngulu, akwa na magbunda ta mako ma nde ko abanga bobala na moholi modiko bo: «Opalakadea okɔe na mbi bo, Yesu, Mwana o Ndjakomba Onɔi Diko? Nasɛngɛi ta dii wɛ, pɛpɛ bokɔɔni oko bobe!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Modjɔ mo Yesu atɔndɔkɔ mwembo mo pita bɛngi moimane ta dii moto omina. Mwembo momina momokondjaka mbala na mbala; bamonangaka mbɔti ta mabɔ ko bamoisaka mosɔngɔ ta mako bɛngi bamoosee, endelo adaaka oko adjitswakaka ko mwembo mobe modaaka moamotomba seko ta etengelenge. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu amowadjaka bo: «Kombe e wɛ nda?» Yo amosɔmbedja bo: «Ebole.» Modjɔ mo membo mibe minɛnɛ mikweya na nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ko membo mibe mimina miangɔnɔ Yesu bo adae pɛpɛ bomiloma ta mombɔndɔ mo pɛpɛ suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mombɔndɔ mo pɛpɛ suka: edii esika ekadikame ngulu dji membo mibe ta bɔlɔkɔ boindja ta mokanda mo Ndje 9.1;11.7</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Bwela bonɛnɛ bo ngulu bodaaka boayaka ta ngomba. Membo mibe miangɔnɔ Yesu amipɛ ndjea ebokwea adii ibo. Aso amipa ndjea. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Iboa membo mibe mimana adii moto omina ko mikwea adii ngulu. Na mbala emɔti bwela bo ngulu bodonga diko di ngomba ko bosadumba ta ibeke ko badinda basusu. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ndelo eɛnɛ babanei ba ngulu modjɔ momina, baso batia ko bakɛɛ atɔndɔ modjɔ momina ta ngando enɛnɛ ko ta miako. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bato badoaka bɛngi bo baɛnɛ modjɔ momina. Baimea mbuti na Yesu ko batanea moto yo odaaka na membo mibe, ta dii na mobondo ta mako ma Yesu: moto omina, adaaka alwali bisendja ko aimeaka na iyɔngi mɛnɛ, ko bato basusu baso baluma na bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bato ibia baɛnɛ modjɔ momina batɔndea binabu mondumba motingoama moto iyoyo odaaka na membo mibe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Iboa, bato basusu ba ekenge e mokili mo Bagadaliɛniɛ bawadja Yesu bo ayane ta dii bo, modjɔ mo baimiaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. Ko Yesu atitea ta bwato bɛngi ayane. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Moto iyoyo otingoama na membo mibe aɔngɔnɔkɔ Yesu bo akɛe na nde engbanga emɔti. Endelo Yesu amoyanedja ko abala na nde bo: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Yana ta ndako e wɛ, ko djebedja bato midjɔ misusu miokɔi Ndjakomba.» Ko moto omina akɛɛ, abanga botɔndea ngando enɛnɛ esusu mɛko misusu mimokɔɔ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana mwali o Yailo ko na mwali o itanga di makia</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mal 5, 21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ndelo ehula Yesu, atanea emumu e bato emoasɔ ko edaaka emoamba. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ko moto omɔti kombe e nde Yailo aimea. Adaaka mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha. Asadumba ta mako ma Yesu, amoɔngɔnɔ bo akɛe ta ndako e nde, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />modjɔ mo adaaka na mwana o nde o mwali omɔti, mbuti na mbua doomi na babae, iyo adaaka mbuti na bogwa. Ehole edaaka Yesu akakɛe iho, emumu e bato bamombambamedjaka pamba djisusu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Enakoboa, edaaka ena, mwali omɔti o yogo e botanga makiya ekɔɔ bianga doomi na bibae. Ko abedja palanga dji nde ta dii minganga, ko pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti o moheledja. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Abatama sangɔngɔ dji Yesu, apea mosenge mo sɔngɔ esendja e nde. Ko ta ehole emina, makiya ma nde makina boimana. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu awadjaka bo: «Moto osapeani nda?» Ibo basusu baingani, ko Petelo abala bo: «Molehi, bato banɛnɛ baohiki ko baombambamedjakadea pamba djisusu!» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Moto omɔti apeini, modjɔ mo naoki ngulu emɔti eimani na mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mwali omina amaka iyo ɛnɛ bo modjɔ mo nde modjebami. Adoa na mongongoma, ko asadumba ta mako ma Yesu; ko adjebedja ta boso bo bato basusu tina emopea na nde ko na ndenge ehela na nde ta mbuku. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Mwana o mwali, edhimeli e wɛ eoheledji. Kɛɛ na bogo!»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ehole edaaka Yesu abala iboa, moto omɔti adongi ta ndako e mobanei o ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko abala na nde bo: «Mwana mwali o wɛ agwi. Kina botungea molehi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Endelo Yesu, amaka iyo oka iboa, abala na Yailo bo: «Pɛpɛ bobanga, dhima oko bodhima, ko mwana aheladea.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ehole eimea iyo ta ndako, aidhima moto omɔti akwee na nde, dongedja oko Petelo, Yoane, Djake, ko na sange mwana na nange mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bato basusu bayeaka ko basatungeaka bobuke tina e nde. Yesu abala na bu bo: «Kinani boyea. Modjɔ mo mwana iyoyo agwiti: awɛli hiɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ko bato badaaka bamosɛkɛ, modjɔ mo badjebaka ibo mwana asi bogwa ehele. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ko Yesu, amopea ta ebɔ, abalaka na ngulu bo: «Mwana o mbi, angɔɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mwana omina asisoa ko asɔmbɔ ta bomɔ ko na mbala emɔti aangɔi, Yesu aloma baboti ba nde bamopɛ mia ma boyaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Baboti ba nde bakamwa ko Yesu abasia badae pɛpɛ botɔndea bato modjɔ momina.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Elomu e batingami doomi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mal 6, 7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu aputwanedja <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bato ba elomu iya edii bapɔsɔlu.</char></note>batingami ba nde doomi na babae ko abapa ngulu ko na kpati e bobengana membo mibe misusu ko boheledja bato ba bego. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />ko, abaloma atɔndea bato Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko na boheledja bato ba bego. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Abatɔndea bo: «Pɛpɛ botombani nongo eka emɔti ta mɔɔngɔ: edae pango, tɔmbi, mwɛmbɛ, palanga, moto omɔti pɛpɛ botomba bisendja bibae. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Okakweani ta ndako emɔti, dikamani oko ena tee mbunoko okakinani esika emina. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />A pamba djisusu bato bamiti pala boasɔni, dongani ta ngando emina ko bhubholani bigbota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mal 6.11 ko nase.</char></note> bi bino: edaabi embete e tati tina e bobo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Batingami bakɛɛ, banɔɔkɔ ta ngando na ngando, batɔndɔkɔ Bwɛndi Bopele ko baheledjaka pamba djisusu bato ba bego.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokɛi bo Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mal 6, 14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Elode okondjaka ena, aoka midjɔ misusu minɔɔko. Ko asayekea bobuke mɛɛnɛ, modjɔ mo bato bakina babalaka bo: «Iyona edii Yoane Mobatisi asisoi ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bakina bato babalaka bo: «Edii Eliya iyo asɔmbi na ikina.» Bato bakina koko babalaka bo: «Edii omɔti o batɛli bayou asisoi ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Elode abala bo: «Mbi mɛɛnɛ nalenedja molo mo Yoane. Moto iyoyo okaka mbi gala dji nde adii nda?» Ko ahombaka amoɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedji baami koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bapɔsɔlu bahula ko badjebedja Yesu midjɔ misusu mikɔɔkɔ ibo. Abatomba ko asasua na bu ta dɔɔngɔ, di ngando enɛnɛ iyeye ebeaka bo Betesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Emumu e bato badjeba ko bamokimana. Yesu aba asɔɔ , ko abalaka na bu tina e Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko aheledjaka ibibi badaaka na posa e mohelo. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Busa boimei mɔkɔmɔkɔ, bapɔsɔlu doomi na babae babatama mbuti na Yesu ko babala na nde bo: «Yanedja emumu iyeye e bato, ta ngando ko ta miyako imimi madii mbuti mbuti bɛngi badie mia ma boyaka, modjɔ mo lodii ta etengelenge.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Endelo Yesu abala na bu bo: «Ino bɛɛnɛ bapani mia ma boyaka!» Basɔmbedja bo: «Lodii oto na mapa matano ko na swi babae. Emekande iso bɛnɛ bokɛɛ asomba mia tina e boyedja bato ibibi basusu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Modjɔ mo bato baami badaaka ena mbuti na koto itano. Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Badedjani na mbondo bato mbuti na tuku itano tuku itano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Batingami basumia ko badedja bato basusu na mbondo. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu atomba miɛmbɛ mitano ko swi babae, angɔdjɔ miso ta busa ko asakoa Ndjakomba tina e miya mamina. Alobukaka ko alopa ta dii batingami bɛngi bakabane na emumu e bato. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Moto na moto ayaka ko agola. Ko baandoana bikenge idjia djidika ko balumedja mitinga doomi na mibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2 Bak 4.42-44.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo atɔndi bo Yesu adii Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mal 8, 27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu angɔnɔkɔ tɔtɔkɔ ko batingami badaaka mbuti na nde. Iyo abawadja bo: «Emumu e bato bakabale bo mbi nadii nda?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Bato bakina bakabale bo wɛ odii Yoane Mobatisi; bakina bo wɛ Eliya, ko bakina pongono bo odii omɔti o batɛli bayou iyoyo osisoi ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Ko ino bɛɛnɛ, okabaleni bo mbi nadii nda?» Petelo amosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ odii Masiya o Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedji bogwa ko na bosisoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16, 20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mal 8, 30-9, 1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu abasia na bobuke mɛɛnɛ bo badae pɛpɛ botɔndea moto, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />ko Yesu abala naikina bo: «Etungi na Mwana o moto aoke saya enɛnɛ; basuku, banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko balehi ba mobeko bamodumbadea, bɛngi agwɛ ko ta disu di basato, asisoadea ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yesu abala na ibo basusu bo: «Moto akapala bokimanani, asalone iyo mɛɛnɛ, ko atombe ekulusu e nde busa na busa, ko akimaneni. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Modjɔ mo, moto iyona opaladea boheledja bomɔ bo nde abobungedjadea; endelo iyo obungedjadea bomɔ bo nde tina e mbi aboheledjadea. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ebwani bokɔɔmɔ na moto nde akatomba ngondo esusu, ko abungedji bomɔ bo nde ko asabedji iyo mɛnɛ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Modjɔ mo, moto iyona ookeabini sɔni ko mobalo mo mbi, Mwana o moto pongono amokeabi sɔni, ehole edowabi iyo ta ekumu ende ko na ekumu e Sange e nde ko e babwɛndi basɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Naotɔndɔkɔni, sooti bo: bakina bato ta tei e ibibi badii iyaya, bagwɛtebi boso pɛpɛ boɛnɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mal 9, 2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu bomwambe asidja iyo bobala iboa, Yesu atomba Petelo, Yoane ko na Djake, ko aso aiwei ta moono tina e boangɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ehole edaaka iyo aangɔnɔ, boso bo nde bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ na mondumba mokina ko esendja e nde eimea epu ipɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ko na mbala emɔti edaaka ena na baami babae basolaka na nde: edaaka Mose na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />baimanaka na ekumu, babalaka ta tina e bokɛɛ bo nde ibubu bokokedjamadea ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelo na binande bawɛɛ hiɔ ipipo; ehole esisoa bo baɛnɛ ekumu e Yesu ko na baami babae ibia baemaka na nde esika emɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2 Pi 1.16-18.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ehole ebɔtɔkɔ bo na Yesu, Petelo abala bo: «Molehi, edii bopele lodae iyaya. Lopike bikpangba isato, emɔti tina e wɛ, emɔti tina e Mose, ko emɔti tina e Eliya.» Endelo aidjebaka mɛko mibalaka iyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ehole edaaka iyo abala boa, itute imɔti idoa abadipa na esii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe emina ebwani bobeama pongono etitimo </char></note> edu. Batingami baluma na bɔɔ ndelo ebahuaka itute imina. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ko ta tei e itute kɔpi emɔti, ebala bo: «Iyo adii Mwana o mbi, iyoyo ohɔɔ mbi. Mookeani!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ehole eokama kɔpi emina baɛnɛ oto Yesu iyo mɛnɛ. Batingami badikama bogoo, ko andelo emina, baitɔndea nongo moto omɔti midjɔ miɛnɛ bo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingoi mwana omɔti otungeamaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mal 9, 14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Amaka yaa busa, batita ta moono ko emumu e bato edoasongana na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ta ndanda e emumu e bato bamina, moto omɔti agama bo: «Molehi, naoangɔnɔkɔdea, indjeani mwana iyoyo o mbi, adii mwana o mbi moomi omɔti! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mwembo mobe mokamopee, akalɛbe, mokamosendjodje ko na mbala emɔti akaimedje mapuli ta monɔkɔ, ko te momokine pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nangɔnɔki batingami ba wɛ bɛngi babengane mwembo momina, endelo bahɔniti bomobengana.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu abala bo: «Mbota ebe ko badiiti na bodhima! mbunoko ndelo ndani ediikamabi mbi na nu? Ko mbunoko ndelo ndani ebwanimbi boita midjɔ mi bino? Dowa na mwana owɛ iya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ndelo eimea mwana mbuti na Yesu, mwembo mobe mo modumba a kpɔtɔ ko mo modjongedja na ngulu mɛnɛ. Endelo Yesu agamei mwembo mo pita, ko aheledja mwana ko aso amopa a di sange ende. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ko bato basusu bakamoa na ngulu enɛnɛ e Ndjakomba.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu atɔndei naikina bogwa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mal 9, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Abo moto mosusu akamoaka na midjɔ misusu mikɔkɔ Yesu, abala na batingami bande bo: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Okani bopele mɛko mipalaka mbi naotɔndeni edɛdiyeye: Mwana o moto akabamadea a mabɔ ma bato.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Endelo batingami baisipoaka tina e mɛko mimina: midika adi bo mobombamo bɛngi badae pɛ bosipoa tina; ko badaaka na bɔɔ bo bowadja Yesu modjɔ momina.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omina odii mosuku nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9, 33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Batingami basatubanaka bɛngi badjebe moto ndani onɔi monɛnɛ a ndanda e bobo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu adjebaka midjɔ midaka bo balɛnɛ. Atomba mwana omɔti, amoemea mbuti na nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ko abala na bu bo: «Moto iyo oasɔi mwana yo a kombe e mbi, asɔi mbi mɛnɛ; ko iyona oasɔini, asɔi pongono Iyona olomani. Modjɔ mo moto onɔi bokɛkɛ ta tei e bino, iyo anɔi monɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto odii pɛpɛ boolonani adii moto o bino</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mal 9, 33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoane atombi kɔpi, abala: «Molehi, loɛnɛki moto omɔti adaki abengana membo mibe na kombe ewɛ ko lohombaki lomosie, modjɔ mo adiiti na su engbanga emɔti.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Endelo Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Pɛpɛ bomosiani, modjɔ mo moto odaaka pɛ boolonani adi moto obino.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando emɔti e Samalia eloni boasɔ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ndelo ebatama masu ma Yesu bɛngi aiwee ta busa, akana bo akɛe a Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Alomaka bato ba elomu ta boso bo nde. Bato bamina bakɛɛ ko bakwea a ngando emɔti e Samalia bɛngi bo basɛlingoe bodoa bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Endelo bato ba ngando emina balona bomoasɔ modjo mo akɛɛkɛ a Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ehole eoka batingami Djake na Yoane iboa, baso babala: «Kumu, opalaka bo lobee mosa modonge a diko tina ebotumba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2 Bak 1.10-12 ngɔngɔ dji bobatumba mikanda mikina mokoma bo na mɔmɔ mibakea ondingo ndenge ekɔɔmɔ na Eliya. </char></note> bato bamina?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Endelo Yesu ahekoa adi bo ko aba dosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ko bakɛɛ ta ngando ekina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibia bapali bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8, 19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ehole edaka bo bakɛɛkɛ akɛe a ndjea, moto omɔti abali na Yesu bo: «Mbi naokimanadea a bisika bisusu bikɛɛkɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Bibanga badi na mabikoa ko mbulu ba diko badi na moopo, endelo Mwana o moto aditi na esika e bosama kona bosamehedja.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Abali na moto okina bo: «Kimanani.» Endelo moto omina amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu kinani napetekɛɛ apusea sange embi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Yɛɛ bo bato bago bapuseane ibo na ibo; endelo wɛ, kɛɛ atɔndee Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Okina moto omɔti pongono abali na nde bo: «Kumu, naokimanadea, endelo kinani nongo nakɛe aiseana na denga di mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu amosɔmbendja bo: «Moto yo opeli kongo bɛngi aone dona ko aindji ngɔngɔ, abwaniti na Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Elomu e batingami tuku sambo na babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Kumu ahɔɔ batingami bakina tuku sambo na babae ko abaloma babae babae bakɛɛ boso bo nde ta ngando inɛnɛnɛ djisusu, ko ta bisika bisusu bikanaka iyo bokɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Abala na bu bo: «Mbuma ikpeti inɛnɛ ta gbie, endelo basali badii bakɛɛkɛ. Angɔnɔni moswa gbie alome basali ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Kɛɛni! Naolomini ondingo bana ba bhata ta ndanda e swa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Pɛpɛ botombani mosenge, tɔmbi, kaoko sapato; pɛpɛ bobedjani ngonga na ndjea aiseakake bato. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Okakweani ta ndako emɔti, balani boso bo: “Bogo bodae ta ndako iyeye.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ekadaa bo moto o bogo akadaa ena, bogo bo bino bodae ta tei e nde; emitidaa iboa, bogo bomina bosɔmbe ta dii ino. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Dikamani ta ndako emina, yakani ko mwakani eka esusu eopadeani ibo, modjɔ mo mosali abɔngi bodia iputi di nde. Pɛpɛ bokweanani ta ndako na ndako. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ta ngando enɛnɛ esusu ekweabi ino ko bakaoasɔni, yakani eka esusu eopabini ibo; <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />heledjani bato ba bego badii iyana ko batɔndeani bo: “Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei mbuti na nu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Endelo ta ngando enɛnɛ esusu ekweadea ino ko bamiti oasɔni, djumani na ndjea ko batɔndeani bo: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Lohakoakadea nongo idutu di ngando enɛnɛ e bino idii dikalimeaki ta bigbota bi biso. Endelo, djebani bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobatami.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nabalakadea na nu bo: ta busa bo Sambi, etumbu e bato ba ngando enɛnɛ emina enɔɔbi e bato ba Sɔdɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mba 19.24-28.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando dji inɛnɛ iloni bodimea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Ndjokwa e wɛ, Koladjini! Ndjokwa e wɛ, Betesaida! Modjɔ mo bingengo bikɔmɔ ta ndanda e bino biso bikɔmɔ ta Tile na Sidona, ka bato ba dju bahombedja milema mi bobo ehele, ka bainedja ndjokwa e bobo na bolwa bisendja bi pili na bosama ta mihulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ta tina emina, ta busa bo Sambi, Tile ko na Sidona badiadea etumbu ekɛɛkɛ bonɔ ino. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ko wɛ, Kapalanaume, oiweadea ta busa? Otitedjamadea ta ngondo e bato bago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 14.13-15.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />«Moto iyoyo okeabini, aokei ni; ko iyoyo o odumbini, adumbini; iyo odumbini, adumbi Iyoyo olomani.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule di batingami tuku sambo na babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Batingami tuku sambo na babae bahula na sepi enɛnɛ babala bo: «Kumu, nongo membo mibe mi losumi ta kombe e wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Naɛnɛki Satana bodonga ta o diko bokwa ta kpɔtɔ ondingo mo mokalikali. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Okani: naopabini bokondji bo bodalakaka ndjɔ na koolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koolo adii mo mbowa omɔti mokɛkɛ kona mokɔmbɔ moyai ko ta suka suka emu edii na diino dimɔti idii na moselo. Ibwani bibenedja pola dji saya ko ndelo ekina abwani boowa.</char></note>, ko bobedja ngulu djisusu dji mobedji, ko pɛpɛ eka emɔti ebwani bookɔɔni bobe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Pɛpɛ bosepani oko tina e bo membo mibe miosumini; endelo sepani modjɔ mo kombe dji bino djikomami ta busa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sepi e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11, 25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13, 16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ko ta ehole emina, Yesu aluma na sepi ta tei e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko abala na ngulu bo: «Oo Sesa, naosakoakadea, Kumu o busa na kpɔtɔ, modjɔ mo obomba mɛko imimi ta dii bato ba ndjebi ko na bato ba bowɛi ko omiinedji ta dii bɛngɛ. Sesa edii oko boa, modjɔ mo opala ekɔme oko boa.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />«Sesa apani midjɔɔ misusu. Moto omɔti abwaniti bodjeba Mwana dongedja o ko Sange o moto, moto omɔti atadjeba Sange o moto dongedja oko Mwana, ko na iyona opali Mwana bomoinedja.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ko Yesu ahokoa ta dii batingami ba nde ko abala na ibo bɛɛnɛ bo: «Mongandi ta miso imia maenɛkɛdea midjɔ imimi miɛnɛkɛɛdea ino! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Modjɔ mo, naotɔndeini bo, batɛli na bakondji banɛnɛ bapala baɛnɛ ko baoke midjɔ imi mienɛkɛɛdea ino ko miokakadea ino, endelo baimienɛ ko baimioka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 1Pi 1.10612.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e Mosamalia mopele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Molehi o mɔti o mobeko adoa ko awadja Yesu bɛngi amomeke. Abala na nde bo: «Molehi, ebwani mbi bokɔɔ nde bɛngi nadie bomɔ bo kɔbili?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Ekoma ibo ta mobeko nde? Ekalange wɛ ena nde?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Amosɔmbedja bo: «“Opaladea Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ, na molema mo wɛ itombo, na dongi di wɛ disusu, na ngulu e wɛ esusu, ko na bowɛi bo wɛ bosusu, okopala mina wɛ moto ondingo wɛ mɛɛnɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Iboa Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Osɔmbedji bopele. Kɔɔ oko iboa ko oheladea.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Endelo molehi o mobeko apalaka bosalongedja. Iboa awadja Yesu bo: «Mina mbi edii nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Moto omɔti adonga ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko atitaka ta Yeliko, asonganaka na bapundji bamokatoa, bamoboma, bakɛɛ ko bamokina ndoko. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nganga o Ndjakomba omɔti anɔɔkɔ ta ndjea emina. Amoɛnɛ, ko amobambaa ta ngunda ekina e ndjea ko anɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mondumba momɔti pongono, molewi aimea ta esika emina, amoɛnɛ, ko amobamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Endelo Mosamalia omɔti, anɔɔkɔ ta ndjea emina, aimea mbuti na moto omina. Amoɛnɛ, ko amookea pɛhɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Abatama mbuti na nde, ko asopea munɛ ko vino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Munɛ na vino: edii salo ekɔkɔ bo a ndelo yena tina e boɛmbɛdjɛ saya (munɛ) ko bosidja mikɔlɔbɛ mi pola (vino). Boindja a Isa 1.6.</char></note> ta pola emina ko aenanga na esendja. Amokondedja ta diko di punda o nde mɛnɛ akɛɛ na nde ta ndako e bakɛndɛli, ko amokɔmedja bopele. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Amakaya busa, aiwa pata dji palanga djibae, abipa ta dii mobanei o ndako e bakɛndɛli ko abala na nde bo: “Saloa moto iyo; okabakeadea palanga djikina diko, ta ihule di mbi naosɔmbedjadea.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />«Moto iyoyo okatoa bapundji, ta tei e bobo basato, odii mɛɛnɛ mina nde nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Molehi o mobeko asɔmbedja bo: «Edii iyoyo omookea pɛhɛ.» Yesu abala na nde bo: «Kɛɛ ko wɛ kɔɔ pongono oko iboa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako e Malata na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />A ehole edaka Yesu na batingami ba nde na ndjea, akwea ta ngando emɔti ko mwali omɔti, kombe e nde Malata, amoasɔ ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Iyo adaaka na mwange ende o mwali omɔti, kombe e nde Malia, ko iyo, adaaka na mobondo ta mako ma Kumu, ko aokaka midjɔ mibalaka iyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Malata asatungea na mosala mo bokalea leka. Adoa ko abala bo: «Kumu, otaenɛkɛdea edii bobe ndenge esakinani mwange mbi na misala misusu mbi mɛnɛ? Bala na nde adoe akamoani.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Kumu amosɔmbedja bo: «Malata, Malata, odii bosatungea ko bosapa saya tina e mɛko minɛnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />endelo modjɔ momɔti pɛ monɔi na tɛtɔ. Malia ahɔi ibondo dipele, ko moto ataikatoadea.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ainedji batingami ba nde boangɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7, 7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu aangɔnɔkɔ ta esika emɔti iboa. Ndelo emadja iyo, motingami o nde omɔti amowadja bo: «Kumu, inedja iso mondumba mobwani iso boangɔnɔ, mondumba moinedjabi Yoane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi tina e Yoane Mobatisi.</char></note> batingami ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Ndelo eangɔnɔkɔdea ino balani bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Sangwasu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">kina bo Kombe e wɛ edae esɛnɔke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">kina bo Bokumu bo wɛ bodoe.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Lopa boyaka bo biso boengi busa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Kutubanedja pekato dji biso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">modjɔ mo iso pongono lokutubanedjakadea ta dii ibia balokɔɔkɔdea bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ko pɛpɛ bolokinako lokwee ta tei e mameko.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu abala na bu na ikina bo: «Moto omɔti o bino akadaa na minande ko akɛi amosisodja ta ndanda e bulu bɛngi amotɔndee bo: “Maninga, bekedjani miɛmbɛ misato. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Modjɔ mo nakondji minambi omɔti ta ndako adii ta mɔɔngɔ, ko napeliti eka emɔti e bomopa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ko ekadaa bo iyona odii ta ndako otei amosɔmbedji bo: “Kina botungeani! Nasi bodipa ndako e mbi ehele edae mbi na bana ba mbi losaami; ko nitahɔnɔ boangɔ bɛngi naopɛ mwɛmbɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Sooti mɛɛnɛ naotɔndeakadeani, nongo amiti angɔ bɛngi amopɛ mwɛmbɛ elɔke adii minande, endelo angɔdea ko amopadea eka esusu ewadjakadea iyo modjɔ mo anɔi bomowadja na ingbangba. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ko mbi, naotɔndeakadeani bo: wadjani ko baopadeani, hombani ko obolodjadeani, bomani modipe mo ndako, bamodipoabi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Modjɔ mo iyoyo owadjakadea bamopabi, iyoyo ohombakadea abolodjabi, ko iyoyo obomakadea modipe mo ndako bamodipoabi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Sangemoto ndani ta tei e bino, obwani bopa mwana o nde epakapengi ta ndelo esɛngɛkɛɛdea mwana moswi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikina mikanda mikomama na mɔmɔ babakea bo: ibanga iboa abwani bomowadja mwɛmbe kaoko ndjɔ...</char></note>? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kaoko akamowadja itɔ adii bomopa koolo? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Inoni bato babe, odjebini bopa bana ba bino leka lopele. Na bonɔɔ, Sesa iyo odii ta busa apabi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta dii ibia badii bomowadja!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbedji ta pundi e mopunda ibo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mal 3, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu abenganaka mwembo mobe moimedjaka moto omɔti emimi. Ndelo eimana mwembo mobe momina, emimi abala, ko emumu e bato eso eluma na bokamoa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Endelo, bato bakina babalaka bo: «Abenganakadea membo mibe imia na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe epama na djabulu ondingo mokondji o membo mibe.</char></note>, mokondji o membo mibe!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bakina, bamowadja embete emɔti e bodonga ta busa: bɛngi bamopikee elambo. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Iboa, iyo adjebaka malɛno ma bobo, aso abala na bu bo: «Bokonji bosusu bokabɔtɔɔ ta tei e bu bɛɛnɛ bodii bobeha ko ndako imina idii bobukeana ikina diko djikina. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Obalakani bo, mbi nabenganakadea membo mibe na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbule. Ko Satana aka sanedja iyo mɛɛnɛ, Bokumu bo nde bodii bombimbima ndenge nda? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Endelo ekadaa bo mbi nabenganakadea membo mibe na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbule, ko batingami ba bino babenganakabi na ngulu e nda? Ta tina emina ibo bɛɛnɛ badaabi ba djudji ba bino! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Endelo ekadaa bo, mbi nabenganakadea membo mibe na ngulu e Ndjakomba, etingodjakadea bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bosi boimea ta dii ino.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Ndelo epeli moto o ngulu bipeko bi nde bi bila tina e bobanea ndako e nde, leka lo nde losusu lodii bobaneama bopele. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Endelo ekadaa bo moto iyo omonɔi na ngulu akadoa ko amolongei, amokatoi bipeko bi bila bisusu ibia bisaki iyo molema ko akabanadea eka esusu epeaki iyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Moto odii pɛpɛ bodaa engbanga emɔti na mbi adii moloni o mbi; ko moto odaaka pɛpɛ boputoanedja bato aka babengane.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosɔmbɔ bo mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Ta ehole eimani mwembo mo pita ta dii moto, mokakɛe alebalebe ta bitengelenge ahombe esika e iheme. Endelo te mobolodjake, naboa akasabalee bo: “Nasɔmbe ta ndako e mbi, iyena ekinakabi mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ta ehole eimeadea iyo ko aetanei pɛpɛ eka otei, baambɔ, ko ebɔngedjami bopele. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Iboa akɛɛdea atomba membo mibe mikina sambo mimonɔi na bobe; bakweadea ena ko badikamadea. Mondumba mo moto iyona moimeadea mobe bonɔ mondumba modaki iyo boso.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mongandi mo sooti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ehole ebalaka Yesu boa, mwali omɔti abala na ngulu ta ndanda e emumu e bato bo: «Mongandi ta dii mwali iyona olwa deemi di wɛ ko oonungea!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Endelo iyo, asɔmbedja bo: «Mongandi ta dii bato ibibi baokakadea mobalo mo Ndjakomba ko bamosumakadea!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngi e embete e bokamodja</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Ehole eluma emumu e bato mbuti na nde, Yesu aso abala bo: «Mbota iyee edii ebe; ehombakadea embete! Endelo embete ekina ebuki etapamabi oko embete e Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Modjɔ mo, ndenge emɔti edaaka Yona embete tina e bato ba Niniwe, oko mondumba momina Mwana o moto adaadea embete emɔti tina e mbota iyeye. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ta busa bo Sambi, mokondji mwali o Satina aemabi ko apabi bato ba mbota iyeye etumbu, modjɔ mo iyo adonga ta suka e ngondo ta tina e bohokamedja konga e Sɔlɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1 Bak 10.1-10. </char></note>. Enakoboa, iyaya edii na Iyona onɔi Sɔlɔmɔ! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ta busa bo Sambi, bato ba Niniwe basangɔdjɔbi boso bo bato ba mbota iyeye ko babapabi etumbu, modjɔ mo basɔmbɔtɔnɔ milema ta ehole eoka ibo eleho e Yona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Yna 3.5,8,10.</char></note>. Enakoboa, iyaya edii na Iyona onɔi Yona!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Molinda mo mokuku</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="LUK 5:15">5, 15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:22-23">6, 22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Moto ta bwanedje molinda tina e bomobomba kaoko bomokunda na poke; endelo baka mobakee ta ebakeli emu, bɛngi bo bato ibia badii bokwea ta ndako baɛnɛ bohu. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Diiso di dii molinda mo mokuku: ehole edii diiso di wɛ bopele, mokuku mosusu mo wɛ modii ta tei e bohu; endelo diiso dikadaa dibe, mokuku mo wɛ modii pongono ta tei e modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Keba bo molinda modii ta di wɛ modae pɛpɛ bodaa modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ekadaa ibo mokuku mo wɛ mosusu modii ta bohu, ko ekenge emɔti emitidaa ta modidi, mokuku mosusu mo wɛ modadea ta tei e bohu, ondingo ndelo ebwanakadea molinda na bohu bo mu.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akotoi bapalisai na balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ehole ebalaka Yesu, mopalisai omɔti amobea ayaka ta ndako e nde. Akwea ta ndako ko adaa ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mopalisai akamwa iyana aenɛ iyo Yesu pɛpɛ bosasosa boso bo boyaka mia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edaka momɛsɛno mo Bayudha bosasosa boso bo boyaka.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kumu abala na nde bo: «Ino Bapalisai, okasɛnodjeni kɔbɔ ko na saani ta sokolu, endelo ta milema mi bino olumani na posa e iba ko na mɛko mibe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ino bindanga! iyona okɔɔ sokulu, aikɔɔ pongono otei? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Iboa pani ndelo ba bakwali ilulu lodii ta otei ondingo ibondja di pɛhɛ, ko losusu lodaadea losɛnɔɔke tina e bino.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Endelo ndjokwa ta dii ino, Bapalisai! ino okaputeni ekenge emɔti e doomi e kona, ondingo matungulu ko na ndjua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 27.30, Dit 14.22.</char></note> mindumba na mindumba djikakandoe ta gbie e ndjua, endelo okaenɛni bodju ko bwela bo Ndjakomba ngasa. Iyena edii eka etungi no bokɔɔ, pɛpɛ bobosani ko boputa ekenge e doomi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Ndjokwa ta dii ino, Bapalisai! Ino bato bakapale bodaa boso ta kiti dji boso ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko baoiseakeni bwanda ta bisika bikabolame bato. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ndjokwa ta dii ino! Modjɔ mo odiini ondingo makila imia madii pɛ bimbete, ko baka madalakake na pɛpɛ bodjeba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Iboa okina molehi Omɔti o mobeko abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, abalakadea wɛ iboa, olosingakadea pongono!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Ndjokwa ta dii ino pongono, balehi ba mobeko! Ino ibibi bakaloadje bato mina mi mandi, ko ino bɛnɛ to mi bɛndjɛeni nongo na mosapi momɔti bɛngi o baiwedjeni. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ndjokwa ta dii ino! modjɔ mo okatongeni makila ma batɛli, iboa edii wɛteko bakɔkɔ bato baowa batɛli ba mina! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Odiini ba temo oinedjakani ihu mɛɛnɛ bimbete bikɔɔkɔ bakɔkɔ ba bino, modjɔ mo baowa batɛli, ko ino, otongakadeani makila ma bobo! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Na tina emina Ndjakomba, na konga e nde, abala bo: “Nabalomeabi batɛli ko na balomami; baowabi bakina ko banɔngedjabi bakina.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ta tina emina, bato ba mbota iyeye balwabi lindo e makiya ma batɛli basusu imiimi masopeama banga mbangi e ngondo, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />donga bosopea bo makiya ma Abɛlɛ mbunoko makiya ma Djakalia, iyoyo oowa ibo ta pakasa e etumbelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mba 4.8; 2 Kolnk24.20622.</char></note> ko na Esika Esɛnɔke. Sooti, naotɔndeini bo, etumbu epamabi na bato ba mbota iyeye tina e mabe ma mina!»<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Ndjokwa ta dii ino, balehi ba mobeko! Ino odongedjani pongola e bowɛi: ino bɛnɛ tokweeni ko osiakani ibia bapalaka bokwea.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ehole eimana Yesu iyana, balehi ba mobeko ko Bapalisai balemoa na nde bobuke mɛnɛ ko babanga bomowadja midjɔ mindumba na mindumba: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />baamopikeaka bilambo abohomba bo bamodie na modjɔ mobe na ndjea e mibalo mi nde.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ekebedjeli tina e ndango e mongi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ta ndelo emina, bato baputoana ena koto na koto, na mondumba mo badaaka basadalakaka ta mako ma bobo. Yesu abanga bobala boso mɛɛnɛ ta dii batingami ba nde bo: «Kebani, na bole bo mapa ibubu bokabee ibo levile bo Bapalisai, ibubu bodii ndango e mongi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Midjɔ misusu mibolama mimanabi ta bohu, ko midjɔ misusu mi mbombi mihuodjamabi. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Na tina e mina misusu mibalabi ino ta modidi mibalamabi ta busa boyake, ko misusu mibalabi ino na popoli ta itoi ta ekenge e ndako ediipamake midumbeamabi ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto obwani na bomobanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Naotɔndeini, baningani: pɛpɛ bobangani ibia babwani boowa mokuku ko, ngɔngɔ djimina, babwaniti bokɔɔ mokina modjɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Napalakadea nainedjeni iyoyo obwani ino bobanga: bangani Iyo, ngɔngɔ dji bogwa, moto odii na kpati e bodumba ta ipelu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mat 10.28.</char></note>. Sooti, nabalakadea na nu, edii Iyo moto obwani ino bobanga! <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Te batɛke midengudengu batano na motswiya mokɛkɛ? Endelo, Ndjakomba ta bose nongo omɔti ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Nongo swe dji bino dji molo djisusu djidii djilangamake. Pɛpɛ bobangani: modjɔ mo ino onɔini midengudengu banɛnɛ na motswiya!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bohuodja ko boinganea Yesu Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10, 32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12, 32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10, 19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Nabali na nu: moto iyona osahuodjabi ta boso bo bato ta tina e mbi, Mwana o moto pongono asahuodjabi tina e nde ta boso bo babwɛndi ba Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Endelo moto oinganeabini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2 Tim 2.12.</char></note> ta boso bo bato, mbi na moinganeabi pongono ta boso bo babwɛndi ba Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ko moto iyoyo obalabi mɛko mibe na Mwana o moto, akutubanedjamabi; endelo, iyoyo osingabi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, atakutubanedjamabi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Ehole eopundabini bo ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ ko ta boso bo babanei ko bo bakondji, pɛpɛ bosatungeani na mondumba mosambabi ino ko mondumba mobalabi ino, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Modjɔ mo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke aonedjadeani ta ehole emina mɛko mibwani ino bobala.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e modieli o bondanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Moto omɔti ta emumu e bato abala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, tɔndea mwange e mbi akabane leka lokina sange o biso.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Omina ohɔini bɛngi nadae djudji o bino tina e bokabana leka lo bino nda?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ko abala na bu: «Keba! Pɛpɛ bodaani na bokoso bo bodieli, modjɔ mo bomɔ bo moto bodiiti tina e bodieli bodii na nde, nongo akadaa na bodieli bonɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ko abatɔndea ekuanedji emɔti bo: «Kpɔtɔ dji moto omɔti modieli djibotaka mbuma djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Aikoaka ko asawadja bo: “Nakɔe bo? Modjɔ mo nadiiti mɛnɛ na esika e boputoanedja mbuma dji mbi djisusu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />ko asabalea bo: “Indja nakɔdea bo: na bukadea ndako djikabombe mbi mbuma, ko napike ndako djikina inɛnɛnɛ, ko nabukadea mbuma dji mbi dji ble ko na bodieli bo mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Edɛdiyeye nasabaleadea bo: Odii na leka lonɛnɛ lodedjami tina e bianga binɛnɛ; sahemedja, yaka, mwaka ko sepa.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Endelo Ndjakomba abala na nde bo: “Endanga e moto! Na bulu ibubu ogwadea. Ko leka ilulu lodedji wɛ, lodikadea na nda?” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Indja ndenge ekakɔɔme ta dii moto iyoyo okadedje leka tinae e nde mɛnɛ, ko adiiti modieli ta miso ma Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mat 6.20.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boisa molema ta dii Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6, 25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ko Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Indjani tina e mina naotɔndeini bo: pɛpɛ bosatungeani oko tina e bomɔ bo bino ta modjɔ mo boya, nongo ta tina e mokuku mo bino na bisendja bi bolwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Modjɔ mo bomɔ bonɔi leka lo boya ko mokuku monɔi bisendja. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Indjani gɔgɔ: te baone leka ta gbie ko te bandoane leka, badiiti na ebombelo e mbuma ko na ediika, endelo Ndjakomba akabayedje! Iboa ino onɔini mbulu na tɛtɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nongo okasatungeani ta tei e bino moto obwani bobakea nongo moo ehole mokɛkɛ ta bomɔ bo nde nda? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ko omiti hɔnɔni bokɔɔ midjɔ imimi mikɛkɛ, tina ndani odiini bosatungea na midjɔ mikina? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Indjani mondumba mokatɔe pulɛlɛ dji bisika: te djikɔe mikɔ ko te batonge bisendja. Naotɔndeini bo nongo Sɔlɔmɔ iyo mɛɛnɛ, ta tei e bokumu bo nde, aidiaka bisendja bipele bobwana na pulɛlɛ djimina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja ta 1 Bak 10</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Iboa ko Ndjakomba akaloadja ndjani dji gbie idjidji djidii busɛbubu ko puma badjidumbi ta mosa, ko akɔɔdea boni tina e bino, bato ba bodhima bokɛkɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ko ino pɛpɛ bohombani eka eyadea ino ko na eka emwakadea ino pɛpɛ bosatungeani. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Edii bato ba bikomi bisusu bi ngondo ibibi bahombakadea na mindumba misusu leka lomina. Endelo ino, Sesa adjebakadea bo odiini na posa e lu. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Hombani boso Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko leka lokina aopadeani.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madieli mapele</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Pɛpɛ bobangani, moo bwela o bingbɛndɛ! modjɔ mo Sange e bino asepi bopani Bokumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Tɛkɛni leka lo bino ko pani palanga ta dii bakwali. Kɔɔni tina e bino misenge mi palanga imimi mibwani bodaa pɛpɛ bobeha bombani bodieli bo bino ta busa, ko iho botabungabi. Iho moibi adiiti ko sɛɛ batalobedjabi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Modjɔ mo ta polo edii bodieli bo wɛ molema mo wɛ modaadea oko iyana.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basali badii ta yambo e Kumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Daani na keba, ko lwani mosenge ta bongo bwanedjani milinda mi bino. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Ino pongono daani olongo basali ibibi baambaka moswa bu iyoyo okɛkɛdea ahule ta tɛkɛ e moki, akaimea ko akaboma modipe mo ndako gbundumo badii bomodipoa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Mongandi ta dii basali ibibi ndelo eimeadea moswa bu, ko akatanea ba moamba! Naotɔndeini, edii sooti bo: alwabi bisendja bi mosala mo nde, abadedjabi ta mesa ko adoabi abakɔmedja. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Akadoa ta ndanda e bulu kaoko ta kɔkɔ o boso ko akabatanea ta yambo, badaabi na mongandi!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Djebani bopele bo: moswa ndako aso adjeba ehole ndani ebwani moibi bodowa, akwea ta ndako abwaniti bomokina akwee ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ino pongono, sɛlingoani, modjɔ mo Mwana o moto aduabi ta ndelo iyeye edaabi ino pɛpɛ bolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali o iyɔngi ko na mosali o taka e iyɔngi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24, 45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Iboa Petelo amowadja bo: «Kumu, obali ekuanedji emina oto tina e biso kaoko tina e bato basusu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kumu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mosali o iyɔngi ko o bowɛi edii nda? Indja edii iyoyo obo moswa nde amopi mosala mo bobaneaka ndako ko bokabana leka loboyaka na bina nde ta ehole emina. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Mongandi ta dii mosali iyoyo otaneabi moswa nde, ta mosala momina ndelo e hulabi iyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Sooti, nabali na nu bo: moswa nde amoisabi kapita o leka lo nde losusu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Endelo mosali omina akalɛdjɛ akasabalea bo: “Moswa mbi ata huladea pɛpɛlɛ”, ko akaimea boboma basali bakina ba baami ko ba bali, boyaka, bomwa ko bolangoa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />iboa moswa nde ahulabi ta busa bodaabi mosali o nde pɛpɛ bodaa na elɛndɛ ko ta ndelo edaabi iyo pɛpɛ bodjeba; abenganabi mosali omina ko amopabi etumbu enɛnɛ bobwana na bato ba taka e isuma. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mosali iyoyo odjebi mɛko mikapale moswa nde, endelo amiti mikokedja, bamobomabi mbalake djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Endelo, mosali iyoyo odai pɛpɛ bodjeba mɛko mikapale moswa nde ko akakɔɔ bobe, bamobomabi na bokɛkɛ. Moto iyoyo odii na bobuke, bamowadjabi oko na bobuke; moto iyoyo opi ibo mɛko minɛnɛ bamosɛngɛbi mɛko minɛnɛ bonɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bobɔtodja</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Mbi nadoa aisa mosa ta ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 66.15-16.</char></note> ko napalakadea mosa momina mobwane mɛɛnɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Natungi botomba batisimo ko nadii na molema diko mbunoko mɛko misusu mikokedjame! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Olɛdjɛkɛdeani bo nadoi aisa bogo ta kpɔtɔ? Ngasa, nabali nanu, endelo nadoi abɔtodja. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Modjɔ mo banga busa ibubu, denga idii na bato batano ta ndako emɔti dibɔtɔɔbi, ekina pamba babae, ekina basato. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Sange e moto abɔtɔɔbi na mwana o nde ko mwana abɔtɔɔbi na sango, nange e moto abɔtɔɔbi na mwana o nde o mwali ko mwana mwali abɔtɔɔbi na nango, bokiyo bo mwali, abɔtɔɔbi na mwali o mwana o nde o moomi, ko mwali o mwana o nde abɔtɔɔbi na bokiyo bo nde bo mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mik 7.6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosipoa botikoanedja bihole</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu abala na emumu e bato na ikina bo: «Ndelo ekaɛnɛ ino itute dimɔti diangɔi ta pamba ekasaame modaakabusa, okabaleni ta ndelo emina bo: “Mbuwa ahombakadea akwɛɛ”, ko ekakɔɔme oko boa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ko ndelo ekaɛnɛ ino mopɛpɛ moodongi satina, okabaleni bo: “Busa ibubu moi modadea mopipo”, ko ekakɔɔme oko boa. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Bato ba ndango e mongi! Odjebini botingodja bimbete bi kpɔtɔ ko na bi busa, iboa, tina ndani odaini pɛpɛ bodjeba botingodja bimbete bi masu imimi?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bookana na moloni o wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5, 25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Tina ndani ino bɛnɛ obwanitini bosipoa midjɔ imimi mitungi nanu bokɔɔ na bosooti? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ndelo edii wɛ bokɛɛ na moloni o wɛ engbanga emɔti ta sambi, meka bobɔngedja modjɔ mo bino oko na ndjea. Omiti kɔɔ iboa aoimedjadea ta boso bo djudji, ko djudji aopadea ta mabɔ ma mbulu bahindo ko baoisadea ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nabali na wɛ bo: omitisiedja nyongo e wɛ, otaimanabi ta bɔlɔkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ moda kaoko bogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ta ndelo emina iyena, bato bakina badoa atɔndea Yesu mondumba ndani mosopa iyo makiya Pilato bato ba Galileya ta ndelo edaaka bo bapa mbeka. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Olɛdjɛkɛɛdeani bo bato ba Galileya ibia bagwa mondumba imua, bakɔɔ pekato djinɛnɛ bonɔ bato bakina ba Galileya? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Naotɔndeini bo ediiti boa; endelo omiti sɔmbɔtɔnɔni, midaa ogwadeani ino basusu oko mondumba momina momɔti. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ko bato doomi na bomwambe ibia bagwa ndelo ebukea ndako ekpalaka e Siloe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siloe: ekpalaka emina ekɔkɔ pongono ekenge e ekuka ehikaka Yelusalɛmɛ. Edaka ndako omɔti e diko bapetaka etonga na mabanga, ko ndenge ekwa iyo tedjebame. Edaka pongono na mombonda mo madiba (Yoa 9.7).</char></note>, olɛdjɛkɛɛdeani bo bobe bo bobo bonɔi bo bato bakina ba Yelusalɛmɛ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Te boa, ekahia naotɔndeakadeani bo: omiti sɔmbɔtɔnɔni midaa mi bino, ogwadeani ino basusu oko mondumba momina momɔti.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mole mo pigi mo pɛpɛ mbuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yesu abala ekuanedji emɔti: «Moto omɔti aanaka mole mo pigi ta gbie e nde e mele mi vino. Adoaka ahomba mbuma, ekahia aidia mbuma imina. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Iboa abala na mosali o gbie bo: “Indja: bianga bisato itombo, nadii bodoa iyaya ehole esusu ahomba mbuma dji pigi ta mole imumu, ko tenadie eka emɔti. Mokwɛlɛ! Tina ndani mobedjakadea kpɔtɔ oko ngasa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Endelo moaneli o gbie amosɔmbedja bo: “Moswa mba, petemokina nongo ta yanga iyeye; nalongadea kpɔtɔ mbuti mbuti ko ta tei emina naiseadea bipɔlu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ehole ekina mole momina mobwani bobota mbuma ta yanga engɔngɔ, momitabota mbuma, oso omokwɛlebi.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledja mwali omɔti ta busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ta busa bomɔti bo sabata Yesu adaaka aleha ta ndako emɔti e miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mwali omɔti odaaka ena: adaaka na mwembo mobe bianga doomi na bomwambe, mwembo mobe mo moimedja na yɛɛmɛ aimbama mokɔngɔ ko aihonɔkɔ bosaninodja bopele. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ehole eenɛ Yesu mwali omina, amobea ko abala na nde bo: «Mwali, otingoami na yɛɛmɛ e wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Abakea mɔmɔ ma nde diko di nde ko, na mbala emɔti, mwali asaninodja ko abanga bokumedja Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Endelo mobanei o Ndako e miɔngɔnɔ aoka kɛlɛ modjɔ mo Yesu aheledja moto ta busa bo sabata. Ko abala na emumu e bato bo: «Lodii na masu masamano ma mosala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 20.9</char></note>; ta tina emina doani asaheledjeni ta masu mamina ma mosala endelo te ta busa bo sabata!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kumu amosɔmbedja bo: «Bato ba ndango e mongi! Busa bo sabata, moto na moto tadipoe ikutu bɛngi ngɔmbɔ o nde kaoko tito okabee ibo ane bakɛe amwaka madiba? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ko mwali iyoyo, adii motitani o Abalayama, Satana amonanga bianga doomi na bomwambe, ebwanakiti bomolodja mbɔti imina ta busa bo sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ndelo esɔmbedja Yesu iboa baloni ba nde basusu baluma na sɔni enɛnɛ, ekahia emumu e bato basepaka na midjɔ mipele imimi midaaka Yesu akɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mbuma e mutalade</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mal 4, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu awadja naikina bo: «Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobwani na ye? Nabwani boboɛngɛ na eka nda? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Indja eka ebwani na bu: mombuma imumu mokabee ibo mutalade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta dii Bayudha mombuma mo mutalade modaaka ondingo embete e eka emɔti enɔi bokɛkɛ, ko edii kona emɔti ekandoaka mbunoko mɛtɛlɛ djisato ta diko. </char></note>, moto omɔti amotomba ko amoana ta gbie e nde e ngando: motɔɔ, ko moimea mole ko mbulu ba diko bakɔɔkɔ moopo ma bobo ta tape dji mole momina.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e levile</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13, 33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu abala na ikina bo: «Na bwani boɛngɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na ye? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Indja eka ebwani na bu: bole bo mapa ibubu bokabee ibo levile, bokatombe mwali omɔti ko aisi ta kilo dji paline tuku djibae na itano, mbunoko anila o mapa mosusu ahaloe.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modipe mo embamba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu adalaka ta ngando dji nɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na dji kɛkɛkɛkɛ ko alehaka ndelo edaaka iyo akɛɛkɛ akɛe ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Moto omɔti amowadja bo: «Kumu, edii bo bato bahelabi bakɛkɛ?» Amosɔmbedja bo: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Sapingedjani bɛngi okweni ta modipe mo embamba; modjɔ mo naotɔndeakadeani bo, bato banɛnɛ bamekabi bokwea ena, ekahia batahɔnɔbi.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Ndelo eangɔbi moswa ndako adipabi ndako ino odikabini sokolu ko obomabini modipe mo ndako ko obalabini bo: “Moswa su lodipoa ndako.” Ko iyo aosɔmbedjabini bo: “Nitaodjebakadeani!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Iboa, obalabini na nde bo: “Iso loyakaka ko lomwaka ta boso bo wɛ, odaaka oaleha ta ndjea dji biso.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Endelo abasɔmbedjabi na ikina bo: “Nataodjebakadeani ko natadjebakadea esika edongi ino! Dongani mbuti na mbi. Ino bato basusu ibibi bakakɔe midjɔ mibe.” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Iho oyeabini bio ko na bokpɛkɛnɛ mino, ndelo eɛnɛbi ino Abalayama, Isaka, Yakobo ko na batɛli basusu ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko ino odumbamabini sokolu! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bato badongabi ta pamba ekaangɔe modaakabusa, ko ta pamba ekasame mo, ta sadiko ko na satina ko badiabi esika ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Iboa, bato bangɔngɔ baimeabi bato ba boso, bato ba boso ko, basɔmbɔbi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tina e Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23, 37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ko ta ehole emina, ndambo e Bapalisai badoa ta dii Yesu ko babala na nde bo: «Donga iyaya, kɛɛ ta esika ebuki, modjɔ mo Elode apalakadea aowoe.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɛɛ atɔndeeni ebanga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebanga abwani na gambala.</char></note>omina bo: “Nabenganakadea membo mibe ko na heledjakadea bato ba bego busa ibubu na puma, ko ta disu di basato namadjadea mosala mo mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Endelo etungi na mbi bodaledja naikina mosala mo mbi busa ibubu, puma mbunoko puma sɛɛnɛ, modjɔ mo ebɔngiti na motɛli bogwa sokolu e Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, wɛ okaowoe batɛli ko okaowoe bato bakaolomee ibo na mabɔkɔ! Mbala djeka dji palaka mbi boputoanedja bato ba wɛ mbuti na mbi mondumba mokaputoanedje kɔkɔ o mwali baana ba nde nase dji mapapu ma nde, ekahia ino oipalani! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Oko boa, ndako ewɛ ediika dea mopɔtu. Naotɔndɔkɔdea sooti bo: otaɛnɛbini na ikina mbunoko ehole ebalabino bo: “Adjongoame iyona okɛɛkɛdea adoe a kombe e Kumu!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto epeko ta sabata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Busa bo sabata, Yesu akɛɛkɛ ta dii mobanei omɔti o Bapalisai tina e boyaka. Ibibi badaaka na nde ba mokokoledja. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Moto omɔti o mokuku mohaloake adoa aema ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu awadja balehi ba mobeko ko Bapalisai bo: «Edii ediimamake boheledja moto ta busa bo sabata kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Endelo badaa bogo. Iboa Yesu apea moto omina, amoheledja ko amoyanedja. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abala na bu bo: «Omɔti o bino akadaa na mwana moomi omɔti kaoko ngɔmbɔ omɔti akwi ta mombɔndɔ, abwaniti bomoimanedja pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ, ta busa bo sabata?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enɔi epele epama a mobeko mo sabata (Boindja pongono a Mat 12.11)</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Endelo baihɔnɔ bomosɔmbendja eka emɔti ta modjɔ momina.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bohɔɔ polo e suka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu aɛnɛ mondumba ndani modaaka bato basweana bisika bi boso. Mbunoko abala na bu ekuanedji iyeye bo: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ehole ebeami wɛ ta tɛkɛ e moki, pɛpɛ bokɛɛ adaa ta esika e boso. Ebwani boda bo moto okina oonɔi wɛ na gala abwani bodoa koko ena ko baoangɔdji tina e bomopa esika edaaki wɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />ko iyoyo oobeakini ta tɛkɛ ino basusu babae abwani bodoa aotɔndea bo: “Kinea moto iyoyo esika iyeye.” Iboa wɛ odii bokɛɛ, na sɔni enɛnɛ, bokadaa ta edie e suka. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Endelo, bakaobea, kɛɛ adae ta esika esuka, ehole edoadea moswa tɛkɛ abaladea na wɛ bo: “Maninga, doa odae ta esika iyeye e gala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a milɔngɔ 8-8 ko Mas 25.5-7.</char></note>.” Na mondumba momina, edaabi ta dii wɛ ekumu ta boso bo bato basusu badii na wɛ ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Modjɔ mo, moto iyoyo odii bosangɔdjɔ bamotitidjadea, ko iyo odii bosatitedja bamoangɔdjɔdea.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu abala naikina na moto iyoyo omobeaka bo: «Ndelo ebɔngedji wɛ mia ma ehuma isa ma midi, pɛpɛ bobeya oto bina wɛ, bangi wɛ, bato ba ibota di wɛ, badieli kaoko mituteano mi wɛ, te ngasa babwani koko bobeya wɛ bɛngi baosɔmbedje leka lo bapa wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Endelo okabɔngedja miya ma tɛkɛ, beya bakwali, bitumbɛ, bato ba biɛmɛ, ko na bato ba miso mago. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Odadea na mongandi, modjɔ mo bato bamina badiiti na eka e boosɔmbedja. Modjɔ mo baosɔmbedjabi leka ehole esisoabi bato ba bodju ta bogwa.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e miya manɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka bo modjɔ momina, omɔti ta ndanda e babeami abala na Yesu bo: «Mongandi ta dii iyona oyakabi miya ma nde ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Moto omɔti abɔngedja miya ma manɛnɛ ma midi ko aso abea bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Aimea ehole e boyaka mia ma midi, alomaka mosali o nde atɔndea bato babea iyo bo: “Doani, modjɔ mo edɛdiyeye leka losusu lobwani.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Endelo ibo basusu, moto na moto, asayeana. Iyona o boso abala bo: “Mbi nasombi gbie ko etungi na mbi nakɛe aeindja; naɔngɔni oyɛeni.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Iyoyo okina abala na nde bo: “Mbi nasombi ngɔmbɔ doomi ko nakɛɛkɛdea abakokoledja; nasangɔni nawɛ oyɛeni.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Iyona okina abala bo: “Nakɛɛkɛdea ahule aasɔ mwali edɛdiyeye, na tina emina, nitahɔnɔ bodoa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ahula mosali ta dii moswa nde amotɔndea misɔmbedja mimina. Moswa ndako alemoa bobuke ko abala na mosali o nde bo: “Kɛɛ ebango ta ndjea dji ngando enɛnɛ, kona idjidji djikɛkɛkɛkɛ ko doa na bakwali iyaya, bitumbɛ, bato ba miso mago ko na bato ba biɛmɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ngɔngɔ djimina mosali akɛɛ abala na moswa nde bo: “Moswa mbi nakɔi eka esusu elomakini wɛ, endelo bisika bikina bidii oko bwase.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Iboa moswa ndako abala na mosali bo: “Kɛɛ ta mokenge ko ta ndjea dji gbie. Ko pingedja naikina bato badoe banɛnɛ bɛngi balume ta ndako e mbi botɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Modjɔ mo naotɔndeakani bo: pɛ nongo moto omɔti a bato ibibi babeaki mbi boso oyakadea mia ma mbi!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10, 37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Bimumu bi bato bidalaka na Yesu ta ndjea. Ahokoa ko aso abala na bu bo: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«moto opalakadea bodoa ta dii mbi atungi bopalani bonɔ sango, nango, mwali o nde, baana ba nde, baana ba nango, ngɛnɛ dji nde, na bomɔ bo nde mɛnɛ. Emitidaa iboa, moto omina abwaniti boimea motingami o mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Moto odaaka pɛpɛ botomba ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni abwaniti bodaa motingami o mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Modjɔ mo moto omɔti ta tei e bino aka kana bo apike ndako e ekpalaka, abwaniti bodaa na mobondo bɛngi alange palanga djidii na nde isa ibwani bomadja mosala. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ta bobanga bo akangɔdjɔ ndako, ko amitidaa na mwɛngi mo bomadja ndako emina bato bakaɛnɛ badaabi bamosɛkɛ ko babalabi bo: <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />“Indja moto iyoyo abangaka boangɔdjɔ ndako, endelo ahɔniti boesiedja!” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Kaoko mokondji ndani, opalaka bokɛɛ ana etumba na mina nde mokondji, adaadea na mobondo ko aindjadea basodha badii na nde koto doomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Einedjakadea bo: 10.000</char></note>, abwani bokɛɛ ana na minande mokondji iyona odii na basodha koto tuku ibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Einedjakadea bo: 20.000 </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Akaɛnɛ bo ahɔniti, alomadea bwɛndi ta dii mokondji iyona okina, ndelo edii iyo bohali, bɛngi baokane tina e boisa bogo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Iboa, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti ta ndanda e bino obwani boimea motingami o mbi amiti lona bodieli bo nde bosusu.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Monana mopɛ edjɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mal 9, 50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Monana modii eka epele. Endelo mokataka edjɛ, mondumba ndani mobwani bo bosɔmbedja edjɛ emina? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Modiiti nongo na mosala momɔti ta kpɔtɔ, kaoko ta bipɔlu; endelo baka modumbe sokolu. Yɛɛ bo iyona odii na matoi aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Bhata obungaka ko aboloi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Baputedji ba puti basusu ko na bato ba pekato badoa ibo basusu ta dii Yesu bɛngi bamohokamedje. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Endelo Bapalisai ko na balehi ba mobeko banungunaka, ko babalaka bo: «Moto iyoyo adii boasɔ bato ba pekato ko boyaka na bu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mibeko mi balehi ba Bayudha, basaisaka a mwɛngi mo pekato bokabana mia na moto o mbindo ohuodjama.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Iboa Yesu abatɔndea ekuanedji iyeye: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Ekadaa bo moto omɔti ta tei e bino akadaa na bhata mokama ko bhata omɔti akabunga na nde, abwaniti bokina bhata tuku ibua na ibua ta eyakea e bobo tina e bokɛɛ ahomba bhata iyona obungi teee mbunoko ehole emobolodjadea iyo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ndelo e mobolodjadea iyo, adaadea na sepi enɛnɛ: ko amobakeadea ta malokuloku. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Akayana ta ndako, abeadea binande na bato badii mbuti mbuti na nde, ko abatɔndeadea bo: “Sepani engbanga emɔti na mbi, modjɔ mo nabolodji bhata o mbi iyona obungaka!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ndenge emɔti, mbi naotɔndɔkɔni ibo, sepi edaabi enɛnɛ ta busa tina e moto o pekato omɔti ohombedji molema bonɔɔ bato tuku ibua na ibua ba bosooti ibibi badii pɛpɛ bodaa na posa e bohombedja milema mi bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pata e palanga ebungaka ko eboloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Kaoko, mwali omɔti akaada na palanga pata doomi ko akabungedja pata emɔti, akɛɛdea abwanedja molinda, ko aambɔdea ekenge e ndako bɛngi aehobe bopele mɛɛnɛ mbunoko aebolodje? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ko akaebolodja, adii bobea binande ko bali ibibi badii mbuti mbuti na nde, ko abaladea na bu bo: “Sepani na mbi engbanga emɔti, modjɔ mo nabolodji pata e mbi iyena ebungaki!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mondumba momina momɔti, naotɔndeakadeani bo, sepi edii ta tei e babwɛndi ba Ndjakomba tina e moto omɔti o pekato iyona ohombedji molema mo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana obungaka ko aboloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu abala na ikina bo: «Okina moomi adaaka na bana baami babae. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Mwana o ngɔngɔ abala na sango bo: “Sesa, paani ibondo ibwani mbi bosangoa.” Iboa sange e bobo akabanaka leka lo nde losusu na bana ba nde ba baami babae.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adi Bayudha, mwana o boso asangoaka bodieli botomba bangi nde bakina mbala djibae. Ko iya a isolo idi, edaka oko bana babae pɛ mwana o suka abolodjaka oto eka emɔti a tei e leka losato. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu, mwana o ngɔngɔ atomba ibondo di nde disusu di leka ko akɛɛ ta ekomi ekina bohali mɛɛnɛ. Iho, abedja leka lo nde losusu na wusuwusu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ndelo emadja iyo bobedja leka losusu, ndja enɛnɛ ekwa ta ekomi emina, ko iyo abangaka botaka leka lo tina. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ko iboa akɛɛ akwea ta mosala ta dii moto omɔti o ekomi emina, ko moto omina amoloma ayedja ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Mal 5.11 ka nase.</char></note> ta gbie. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Iyoyo adaaka na posa e bosagoledja na miya mayakaka ngulu, endelo moto omɔti aimopaka nongo leka lomina. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Iboa, abanga bolɛɛdjɛ ta molema mo nde ko aso abala bo: “Basali basusu ba sange o mbi badii boyaka miya ndenge epalaka ibo, ko mbi, iyaya, nagwakadea na ndja! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nasɔmbɔdea ta dii sesa ko namotɔndeadea bo: Sesa, nakɔɔ bobe boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo wɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />nabwaniti bobeama naikina mwana o wɛ, tombani ondingo mosali omɔti o wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Aso akɛɛ bɛngi ayane ta dii sango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Ko ndelo emoɛnɛ sango bohali aso aoka pɛhɛ: apota ebango, amobhimba ta dɔli ko aso amogbalimea. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana abala na nde bo: “Sesa, nakɔɔ bobe boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo wɛ, nabwaniti bobeama naikina mwana o wɛ...” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Endelo sango abala na basali ba nde bo: “Doani pɛpɛlɛ na mokoto monɔi na bopele, ko molwadjani mokoto momina; molwadjani mopɛtɛ ta mosapi ko na sapato ta mako. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Doani na mwana o ngɔmbɔ o muta, moowani lomoyake ko lokɔe tɛkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />modjɔ mo mwana iyoyo o mbi adaaki mogo endelo edɛdiyeye adii na bomɔ, abungaka ko aboloi.” Ko baso babanga bokɔɔ tɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Iboa, mwana o nde, o sɔmi adaaka ta gbie. Ta ihule di nde ta gbie ndelo eimea iyo mbuti na ndako, aoka baboma ndundu ko na babua ngɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Abea omɔti o basali bɛngi amowadje modjɔ ndani moboloaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mosali amosɔmbedja bo: “Mwangwao ahuli, sangwao amoowei mwana o ngɔmbɔ o muta, modjɔ mo abolodji mwana o nde na mokuku mopele.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Iboa mwana o sɔmi alemoa bobuke ko alonaka bokwea. Sango aimana ta ndako aso amoɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Iboa mwana o sɔmi asɔmbedja sango bo: “Mbi naosalei bianga binɛnɛ; naitaka isuma ta mibeko mi wɛ nongo busa bomɔti. Endelo wɛ oipani nongo mwana o kambeli bɛngi nasepe na bina mbi. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Endelo iyaya asahula mwana o wɛ, iyoyo okɛɛ abedja leka lo wɛ na nduke bali ba ndumba, omowei mwana o ngɔmbɛ o muta!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Sango amosɔmbedja bo: “Mwana o mbi, odii na mbi masu masusu iyaya, ko leka lo mbi losusu lodii lo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Endelo lotungi bokɔ tɛkɛ ko bosepa tina ngɔngɔ e wɛ agwaka, endelo edɛdiyeye adii na bomɔ, abungaka ko aboloi!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kapita o bowɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu abala pongono na batingami ba nde bo: «Modieli o omɔti adaaka na kapita o leka lo nde ko bato badoaka amotɔndea bo kapita omina abedjakakadea leka lo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Moswa ndako amobea ko abala na nde bo: “Eokakadea mbi ta tina e wɛ nde? Inedjani mondumba mokabanee wɛ loka lo mbi, modjɔ mo obwaniti bodaa naikina kapita o leka lo mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Kapita iyo mɛɛnɛ asabalea bo: “Nabwani nakɔe edɛdiyeye bo? Moswa mbi adongedjakadeani ta mosala mo kapita. Nadiiti na ngulu enɛnɛ e mosala mo gbie nadii na sɔni tina e asɛngɛkɛke. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nadjebi eka ebwani mbi bokɔɔ! Ndelo edongadea mbi kapita, bɛngi bato baasɔedeani ta ndako dji bobo!” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Iboa abea moto omɔti omɔti ta tei e bato badaaka na nyongo dji moswa nde. Abala na moto iyoyo o boso bo: “Nyongo e wɛ ta dii moswa mbi edii motswiya nda?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Amosɔmbedja bo: “Mimbonda mi munɛ mokama.” Kapita abala na nde bo: “Tomba mokanda mo wɛ mo nyongo, daa iyaya, na mobondo ko koma pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ, tuku itano.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abala na iyona okina bo: “Ko wɛ, nyongo e wɛ edii motswiya nda?” – Amosɔmbedja bo: “Saki dji mbuma dji ble mokama.” Kapita amotɔndea bo: “Tomba mokanda mo wɛ mo nyongo; koma saki tuku bomwambe”. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Iboa, moswa ndako akumedja kapita o bowɛi bobe na tina e poloso e nde e bobɔngedja midjɔ. Modjɔ mo bato ba ngondo iyeye badii na mawɛi bonɔ bato ibibi badii ta tei e bohu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi tina e mokondji o kapita o bowɛi ko na Yesu iyo mɛnɛ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />«Ko mbi, naotɔndeakadeani bo: palanga djikakosee bato banɛnɛ, endelo ino djisalelani bɛngi obolodjeni binanu, iboa ndelo esiabi mɛko mi palanga ibo baoasɔbini ta ndako e kɔbili. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Moto akadaa na iyɔngi ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ adii pongono bodaa na iyɔngi ta midjɔ minɛnɛnɛnɛ; moto amiti daa na iyɔngi ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ atadaa pongono na iyɔngi ta midjɔ minɛnɛnɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Iboa bamiti oiseani milema na palanga idjidji ikakosea omina opadeani bodieli bo sooti nda? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ko omiti daani na iyɔngi ta leka lo bato bakina, oopabini ilu lo bino bɛnɛ nda? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Mosali omɔti abwaniti bosalea bakumu babae: modjɔ mo abwani bolona okina; kaoko bopala okina. Ndelo ekina abwani botingama ta dii omɔti ko bolona okina. Ta mbala emɔti obwaniti bosalea Ndjakomba ko na palanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokuanedja a Mat 6.24.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibalo mikina mi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mal 10, 11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bapalisai aoka bo mɛko mimina ko basɛkɛ Yesu, modjɔ mo badaaka na bokoso bo palanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Abala na bu: «Ino okasaenɛni bato ba, bosooti ta miso ma bato, endelo Ndjakomba adjebi milema mi bino. Modjɔ mo eka enɔi na gala ta dii bato ediie eka e djɛti ta miso ma Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«Mbunoko ta ehole e Yoane Mobatisi edaaka ndelo e mobeko mo Mose ko na Batɛli. Donga ta ehole e lehama, Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko bato basusu bakɔɔkɔ na ngulu bɛngi bakwee. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Na tina emina diko na kpɔtɔ bidimoabi pɛpɛlɛ mɛɛnɛ endelo pɛpɛ nongo mo ikomi omɔti o mobeko odimoabi.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Moomi mosusu obwani bodongedja mwali o nde ko asɔi okina akɔi bɔɔli ko moomi iyoyo oasɔi mwali odongedja ibo ta moki akɔi pongono bɔɔli.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modieli na Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Edaaka na moomi omɔti modieli alwaka bisendja djikpetu ngboo ko dji motsuiya monɛnɛ, aengi busa, adaaka akɔɔ tɛkɛ ko ahelaka bopele. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ko mokwali omɔti kombe nde Ladjalo, adaaka asambi ta modipe mo ndako e modieli. Mokuku mo nde molumaka na pola. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Adaka na posa enɛnɛ eboyaka leka lokwaka ta nase dji mesa e modieli. Endelo na bonɔ, mbwa badoaka aimboa pola dji nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Enakoboa, mokwali agwa, ko babwɛndi bamotomba bakɛɛ amodedja ta bupa bo Abalayama. Modieli aso agwa pongono ko baso bamopusea. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Endelo iho ta ngando e bato bago aokaka saya enɛnɛ; ndelo eangɔdjɔ iyo miso o diko aso aɛnɛ na bohali Abalayama ko Ladjalo adaaka ta bupa bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Iboa agama bo: “Sesa Abalayama, okeani ndjokwa, ko loma Ladjalo adubee sɔngɔ e mosapi mo nde ta madiba bɛngi apɔdje yeemi e mbi, modjɔ mo naokaka saya enɛnɛ iyaya ta mosa imumu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Abalayama asɔmbedja bo: “Mwana o mbi, lɛdjɛ ta bomɔ bo wɛ odia ibondo di mongandi, ko Ladjalo adaaka aɛnɛ saya. Edɛdiyeye iyo agɔmbedjami, ko wɛ oimei ta monɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Naikina pongono, ta pakasa e biso na nu mombɔndɔ monɛnɛ modii; na tina emina bato babwaniti bodonga iho ta dii ino bɛngi baimee djɔno ta di iso. Bato babwaniti bodonga pongono djɔɔno ta dii iso bɛngi baimee iho ta dii wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Modieli abala bo: “Sesa, naoagɔnɔkɔdea, olome Ladjalo ta ndako e sange embi. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Modjɔ mo nadii na bangi i mbi baami batano. Ladjalo abakebedje basaka doa ta esika iyeye e monɔngɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ko Abalayama amosɔmbedja bo: “Bangi iwɛ badii iho na Mose ko na batɛli: etungi babaokee!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Iyo abala bo: “Sesa Abalayama, etabɔngɔ iboa. Ekadaa bo moto omɔti mogo akakɛɛ ta dii ibo, babwani bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ midaa mi bobo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Endelo Abalayama amosɔmbedja bo: “Bamitipala booka Mose na batɛli, nongo moto mogo akasisoa batamodimea pongono.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Pɛpɛ botaedja bana ba Ndjakomba mabaku</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18, 6-7</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mal 9, 42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Mabaku mabwaniti botaka. Endelo edii ndjokwa ta dii moto iyona olomakadea bato bakina ta ndjea e pekato! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ebɔngi na nde bamotingee ibanga inɛnɛ ta ekolo ko bamodumbe ta dua enɛnɛ, Asadaa apangoa nongo omɔti o ibibi bakɛkɛkɛkɛ ta pekato. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Kebani na ino bɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Mwangao aka okɔɔ bobe, modosa. Akadhima bobe bo nde, moyɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Akaokɔɔ bobe mbala sambo busa bomɔti ko akasɔmbɔ ta dii wɛ mbala sambo ta tina e bobala bo: “Nasaokei ndjokwa”, moyɛɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopilo bo edhimeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bapɔsɔlu babala na Kumu bo: «Lonɛngedja edhimeli!» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kumu asɔmbedja bo: «Edhimeli e bino ekadaa ondingo mombuma mo mutalade, obwanini bobala na mole imumu bo: bikoa iyaya ko kɛɛ abikame ta dua, ko edii bokɔɔmɔ oko iboa.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lodii basali ba ngasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Moto omɔti ta tei e bino akadaa na mosali iyoyo okaone gbie kao okayakedje bingbɛndɛ. Abwani bobala na nde ndelo esahula iyo ta gbie bo: “Doa ayake edɛdiyeye?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Pɛpɛ, abaladea na nde wɛtoko bo: “Kaleani miya nayake ta midi, ko hangodja bisendja ko doa abakeni miya ta mesa, nakasiedja boyaka ko bomwaka, wɛ oyakadea ko omwakadea e wɛ engbanga.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Asakoadea mosali omina o nde iyaya asa kokedja iyo bokɔɔ elomu e nde? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Edii oko mondumba momɔti na nu pongono: ndelo ekɔi ino eka esusu eolomini ibo, odiini bobalani bo: “Lodii oko basali ngasa; lokɔi oko elomu ebwanaki na su bokɔɔ.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba mabha doomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Iyana akɛɛkɛ Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, alekedja ta pakasa e Samalia na Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ikwea di nde ta ngando emɔti, bato ba mabha doomi badoa asongana na nde. Ko baso baema bohali, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ko baangɔdjɔ miholi ko babalia bo: «Yesu, Molehi, lookea ndjokwa!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">17.13 Molehi lokea ndjokwa. Mat 9,27; 15.22, Luk 18.38 a.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Iyana aɛnɛ Yesu bato bamina ko abala na bu: «Kɛɛ asainedjeni ta dii banganga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Lew 14.2-3.</char></note> ba Ndjakomba.» Amaka ibo kɛɛ, basɛnɔɔ oko na ndjea. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Omɔti o bobo, amaka iyo ɛnɛ bo aheli, asɔmbɔ akumedja Ndjakomba na moholi mo diko! <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Asadumba ta mako ma Yesu, boso bo nde bodaaka ta kpɔtɔ, aso amosakoa. Moto omina iyona adaaka Mosamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Iboa Yesu amowadja bo: «Bato basɛnɔki badakiti doomi? Ko bakina ibuwa badii djɔ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Osa sɔmbɔ oto mokɛndɛli iyoyo bɛngi adoe akumedja Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ko Yesu abala na nde bo: «Angɔɔ ko kɛɛ; bodhima bo wɛ boheledji.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodoa bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24, 23-28</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bapalisai bawadja Yesu ehole ndani edoabi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Abasɔmbedja bo: «Bokumu bo Ndjakomba botadoabi ondingo eka ekaɛnɛ ibo na miso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Batabalabi bo: “Indjani, adii iyaya!” kaoko: “Adii ibobo!” Modjɔ mo, Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodii ta ndanda e bino.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ko abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Ta masu ma ngɔngɔ odaabini na posa e boɛnɛ isu dimɔti di masu ma Mwana o moto, endelo otamoɛnɛbini. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Baotɔndeabini bo: “Adii ibobo!” kaoko bo: “Adii iyaya!” Pɛpɛ bokɛɛni iho, pɛpɛ bobakimanani. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Modjɔ mo, oko mondumba mokadonge mokalikali ta busa mokabwanedje pamba djisusu, busa bo Mwana o moto bodaabi oko boa. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Endelo boso mɛnɛ etungi na nde booka saya enɛnɛ ko bato ba mbota iyeye bamodumbadea. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Busa bo bodoa bo Mwana o moto bodaabi oko ondingo ehole e Noa. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bato bayakaka ko bamwakaka, ko baasɔnɔkɔ bali na baami, mbunoko busa bokwea Noa ta masuwa: ko pela enɛnɛ edoa e baowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tina e milɔngɔ 7-8, boindja a Mba 6.9-7.24.</char></note> ibo basusu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Edaabi pongono boa ondingo ehole e Lɔtɔ: bato bayakaka, bamwakaka, basombaka, batɛkɛkɛ baonaka gbie, bapikaka ndako; <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />endelo busa boimana Lɔtɔ ta Sɔdɔmɔ, mbuwa o mosa ko na mangɛlɔ lodonga diko ko loangodja bato basusu bagwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tina e milɔngɔ 28-29, boindja Mba 18.20-19.25.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Edaabi oko mondumba momina momɔti ta busa boɛnɛmɛbi Mwana o moto. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Busa bomina, moto iyona odaabi ta mbalasani etonga bo diko di ndako atatitabi bɛngi atombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Mat 24.17 ko nase.</char></note> leka lo nde; ko moto iyona odaabi ta gbie asɔmbetebi ta ndako. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lɛdjɛni mondumba mokɔɔmɔ na mwali o Lɔtɔ! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Moto iyona ohombabi bobanea bomɔ bo nde abobungedjabi; ko, iyona obungedjabi bomɔ bo nde abobaneabi. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Naotɔndeeni bo, ta bulu bomina, bato babae basamabi ta esambe emɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bali babae badaabi bainda mbuma ta ekpongbolo emɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Baami babae badaabi basala ta gbie emɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu te modae a mikanda mikina mikomama na mɔmɔ mi ba Gɛlɛki (Boindja pongono a Mat 24.40)</char></note>]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Batingami bamowadja bo: «Kumu, modjɔ momina mokɔɔmobi djɔ?» Ko abasɔmbedjia bo: «Esika edaabi ebembe esambi, bingbondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Yob 39.30.</char></note> balumanabi ena.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mwali o gwedja moomi ko na djudji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu abala naikina na bu ekuanedji emɔti tinae bobainedja bo etungi na bu boangɔnɔ, ehole esusu ko na pɛpɛ boɛmbɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />«Ta ngando emɔti enɛnɛ edaaka na djudji omɔti tasume Ndjakomba ko akaenɛ bato basusu ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ta ngando emina enɛnɛ, edaaka pongono na mwali omɔti ogwedja moomi adoaka abala na djudji bo: “Longedjani boso bo moloni o mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Mbala inɛnɛ, djudji alonaka, ko aso asabalea bo: “Edii sooti, te nabange Ndjakomba ko te naɛnɛ bato na tina. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Endelo mwali iyoyo o bogwaa aembɛdjini, iboa etungi na mbi nakate ikambo di nde, bɛngi, adae pɛpɛ bodoa atungeani naikina.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kumu abala na ikina bo: «Okani bopele mondumba mobala djudji iyoyo mobe! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Iboa Ndjakomba, akinadea bokata ikambo di bato ibia bahɔɔ iyo ibia bamɔangɔnɔdea bulu na moi? Abayeyodjadea? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Naotɔndeini bo: abalongedjadea pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ. Endelo ehole edoabi Mwana o moto, ataneabi edhimeli ta ngondo?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e Mopalisai ko na moputedji o puti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu abala ekuanedji iyeye tina e ibia Balɛnɛkɛ bo badaaka na bosooti ko batsiolaka bakina: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Bato babae bakɛɛ aangɔnɔ ta tepelo; omɔti adaaka Mopalisai, ko okina adaaka moputedji o puti. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mopalisai, angɔ diko, ko aɔngɔnɔkɔ iyo mɛnɛ bo: “Oo Ndjakomba, naosakoakadea modjɔ mo nadiiti o bato ibibi bakina, ibo badi baibi, bato babe bato ba mɔɔli; naosakoi modjɔ mo nadiiti odingo moputedji o puti iyoyo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nakakɔe mongilo masu mabae ta engi eyenga ko nakapute ekenge emɔti e doomi e leka losusu lokadie mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Endelo moputedji o puti, aema bohali ko aipala nongo boangɔdjɔ miso o diko, endelo asaboma ta bupa ko abali bo: “Oo Ndjakomba, okeani ndjokwa, modjɔ mo nadii moto o pekato.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Nabali na nu bo, moto iyoyo ayana ta ndako e nde ngɔngɔ dji Ndjakomba bomoimedja moto o bosooti.» Endelo te Mopalisai modjɔ mo, moto iyoyo osangɔdjɔdea bomotitedjadea, ko moto asatitedjadea bomoangɔdjɔdea.<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana bakɛkɛkɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mal 10, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bato badoaka na bana bakɛkɛlɛkɛ ta dii Yesu bɛngi ababakee mabɔ. Batingami ba nde amaka ibo enɛ iboa, baso babadosa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Endelo Yesu abeaka bana bakɛkɛkɛkɛ ko abala bo: «Kinani bana badoe ta dii mbi! Pɛpɛ bobasiani oko, modjɔ mo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodii tina e bato ibia badii ondingo ibo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: moto amiti asɔ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ondingo mwana mokɛkɛ abwaniti bokwea iho.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na modieli</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mal 10, 17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mobanei omɔti o Bayudha amowadja bo: «Molehi mopele, ebwani mbi bokɔɔ nde bɛngi nadie bomɔ bo kɔbili?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Tina ndani obeakadeani molehi mopele? Moto mopele adiiti dongedja oko Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Odjebi mibeko: “Otakɔɔkɔbi bɔɔli; otaowakabi moto; otaibakabi; otabalakabi tati e okuta na mina wɛ; osumakabi sangwao ko na ngwao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 20.12-16; Dit 5.16-20.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Moto omina amosɔmbedja bo: «Nasuma mibeko imia misusu donga ta bwɛngɛ bo mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ndelo eoka Yesu iboa, aso abala na nde bo: «Odiiki na modjɔ momɔti mo bokɔ: tɛkɛ leka losusu lodii na wɛ ko kabana palanga djimina na bakwali, ko odiadea bodieli ta busa; ngɔngɔ djimina doa ko kimanani.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ehole eoka iyo mɛko mimina, asaokea ndjokwa ta molema mo nde, modjɔ mo adaaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ndelo eɛnɛ Yesu bo moto omina aimei na ndjokwa aso abala bo: «Edii bopipo bɛngi badieli bakwee ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Edii bopipo bɛngi tito okabee bo kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kamela: edii tito omɔti onɔi na bonɛnɛ adi Bayudha a ndelo yena odjebakabo engi ndelo a mohelo mo bobo. Adi tito omɔti o ngando ko na mako manɛi ko mandi ma nde bikimana mikama misamano, ko diko di nde mɛtɛlɛ djibae a ilokukuloku, adaaka tina ebotomba bato kana leka.</char></note> akwee ta ipese di tonga, edii pongono bopipo mɛnɛ na modieli bokwea ta bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bato ibia bamohokamedjaka babala bo: «Iboa, omina obwani boheledjama nda?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Modjɔ mokadaa mopipo ta dii bato modiiti mopipo ta dii Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petelo abala bo: «Iso, lokini leka lo biso losusu tina e bookimana.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu abala na bu: «Oko iboa, nabali na nu: ekadaa moto akini ndako e nde, mwali o nde, bangi nde, baboti kaoko bana ba nde, tina e Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />adiabi bodieli bonɛnɛ bonɔ ta ngondo iyeye. Ko adiabi bomɔ bo kɔbili ta ngondo iyena ekɛɛkɛdea adoe.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndei naikina bogwa ko na bosisoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mal 10, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu atombia batingami doomi na babae mbuti na nde ko abala na bu bo: «Loiweeni ta Yelusalɛmɛ, midjɔ misusu mikomama na batɛli tina e Mwana o moto mikokedjamadea. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bamokabadea ta mabɔ ma bato ba bikomi bikina, bamotaadea , bamonɛdjɛdea saya, ko bamotsweadea masɔi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bamobomadea mbalake bamoowadea. Ko ta isu i basato, asisoadea ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Endelo batingami baisipoa nongo eka emɔti ebalaka iyo; adii ibo mibalo mimina miidaaka bohu ko baidjebaka nongo eka emɔti epalaka iyo bobala.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mɔti o miso mago</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mal 10, 46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu aimea iyo mbuti na Yeliko. Enakoboa moto omɔti o miso mago adaaka ta yɔɔngɔ e ndjea tina e bosɛngɛkɛ leka. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Aoka iyo emumu e bato ekɛɛkɛ anɔe aso awadja bo: iyena iboa nde? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bato bamosɔmbedja bo: «Edii Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ iyoyo okɛɛkɛdea anɔe.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Agama bo: «Yesu, Mwana o Dhapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Bato badalaka boso bo nde bamogamea bɛngi apɔpɔne, endelo agama naikina na ngulu bo: «Mwana o Dhapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu aema ko abaloma bamolwɛe moto omina. Ndelo eimea moto o miso mago mbuti na nde, amowadja bo: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Opalakadea nakɔe na wɛ bo?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, napalakadea naɛnɛ naikina.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ko Yesu abala na nde bo: «Enɛ naikina, edhimeli e wɛ eohelidji.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na mbala emɔti, moto o miso mago aɛnɛ naikina, akimanaka Yesu ko akumedja Ndjakomba. Amakabo enɛ iboa bato basusu baso bakumedja Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Djakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu akwea ta Yeliko, ko aso anɔɔkɔ ta ngando enɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Moomi omɔti adaaka ena kombe e nde Djakayo; adaaka mokondji o baputedji ba puti ko adaaka modieli. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Adaaka na posa e boenɛ Yesu, endelo aihɔnɔ bomoɛnɛ, tina e emumu e bato ko adaaka mokuwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Apotia ebango akɛi boso ko aiwei ta mole mo sikomɔle,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sikomɔle edii mole momɔti mokuana na mole mo pigi e esika.Edi mole momɔti monɛnɛ ko moiwea mopele.</char></note> bɛngi amoɛnɛ modjɔ mo Yesu anɔdea ta ndjea emina. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ndelo eimea Yesu ta esika emina, angɔdjɔ miso o diko ko abala na nde bo: «Djakayo tita pɛpɛlɛ, etungi busa ibubu na yeyoe ta ndako e wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Djakayo atita pɛpɛlɛ ko amoasɔ na mongandi monɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Amaka ɛnɛ bato iboa, ibo basusu banungunaka; babalaka bo: «Indja moto iyoyo akɛi ayeyoa ta ndako e moto o pekato!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Endelo Djakayo, angɔ diko, abala na Kumu bo: «Kumu, nakabanadea bodieli bo mbi ndanda iboa napadea ekenge emɔti ta dii bakwali, ko nakabhubhea moto na eka e nde, namosɔmbedjadea mbala inɛi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobeko mo Bayudha molomaka bosɔmbedja leka loibakakabo mbala djibae.Boindja a buku Boimana 22.3,6 iboa Djakayo anɔdji ndenge eloma mobeko. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu abala bo: «Busa bu, mohelo modoi ta ndako iye, modjɔ mo iyo adii, pongono, motitani o Abalayama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Modjɔ mo Mwana o moto adoa ahomba ko aheledja ibibi babunga ndjea.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e pata dji wolo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25, 14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Iboa aoka bato mɛko mimina Yesu abala naikina ekuanedji emɔti. Modjɔ mo adaaka mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ ko bato Balɛnɛkɛ bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bowani boimea gbundumo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Moto omɔti o ibota di bakulaka akɛɛkɛ a ekomi ekina e bohali ko iho bamohɔdea mokondji; ngɔngɔ djimina aso ahule. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Abea basali ba nde doomi ta tei e basali ba nde, abapa pata doomi dji wolo ko abala na bu bo: “Kɔɔni mombongu na palanga djimina mbunoko ta ihule i mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Endelo bato ba ekomi e nde bamokea swɛ; baloma bato bakina ngɔngɔ dji nde abala bo: “Iso lotapalakadea moto omina adae mokondji o biso.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ta ihule i nde ngɔngɔ i bomopa bokondji. Abea basali ba nde ibia bapa iyo palanga, bɛngi adjebe eka ndani ebakea ibo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mosali o boso adoa ta di iyo ko aso abala bo: “Kumu, nabakei pata doomi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kumu amosɔmbedja bo: “Edii bopele, odii mosali mopele; modjɔ mo odaaki na iyɔngi ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛkɛ, naohɔi okondje ngando inɛnɛnɛnɛ doomi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mosali o babae adoa ko abala bo: “Kumu, nabakei pata i wolo djitano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />amosɔmbedja bo: “Ko wɛ pongono, naohɔi okondje ngando inɛnɛnɛnɛ itano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mosali okina adoa ko abala bo: “Kumu, indja pata e wɛ e wolo iyeye; naenanga na esendja ko naso naebomba.” <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nadaaka na bɔɔ bo wɛ, modjɔ mo odii moto o midjɔ mipipo, okatombe leka ta esika edai wɛ pɛpɛ bosambea, okabuke kona ta esika edai wɛ pɛpɛ boona. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kumu amosɔmbedja bo: “Odii mosali mobe, mbi naosambedjadea bobwana na mibalo mi wɛ. Odjebaka bo nadii moto o midjɔ mipipo, nakatombe leka ta esika edai mbi pɛpɛ bosambea ko nakabuke kona ta esika edai mbi pɛpɛ boona. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Iboa, tina ndani oisabi palanga dji mbi ta ndako e mbombi e palanga?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndako emina kombe eyu bange.</char></note> Ta ihule di mbi, nabwanaki bokɛɛ atomba na mo mweka okina o diko.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abala na bato badaaka ena bo: “Mokatoani pata e wolo emina ko epani na iyona odii na pata doomi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ibo bamotɔndea bo: “Kumu, iyoyo adii boso na pata doomi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />– “Nabalakadea na nu bo: moto odii na eka bamopabi na bonɔ; endelo iyoyo odii pɛpɛ bopea eka bamotinoabi nongo moo eka mokɛkɛ iyeye epeli iyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ta dii baloni ba mbi ibibi balonabi ibo mbi nitabakondja, doani na bato bamina djɔno ko balenani mɔli iyaya ta miso ma mbi.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akɛi ta Yelusalɛmɛ.</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Amaka sidja Yesu bobala boa, anɔɔkɔ boso ko akɛi ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ehole ebatama iyo mbuti na Betepadje ko na Betania, mbuti na ngomba e mele mi Olive, aloma batingami ba nde babae: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />«Abala bo: kɛɛni ta ngando edii iyaya boso, ehole eimeadea ino ena, kweani otaneadeani mwana o tito okabee bo ane atingi na mokɔli, iyo odii moto pɛpɛ bopeta konda. Motingoani ko hulani na nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ko moto akaowadjani bo: “Tina ndani emotingowaka na nu?” Mosɔmbedjani bo: “Kumu akambakadea na nde.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bato baloma iyo bakɛɛ ko batanea oko mondumba mobalaka iyo na bu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ehole etingoaka bo mwana o tito okabee bo ane, baswa punda babala na bu bo: «Otingoakadeani mwana o tito okabee bo ane tina nda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ibo basɔmbedja bo: «Kumu akambakadea na nde.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, badoa na nde ta dii Yesu; babakea bisendja bi bobo diko di mwana o tito okabee bo ane ko bakondedja Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Djkl 9.9. </char></note> diko di nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Abangaka Yesu bodala, bato baandaka bisendja bi bobo na ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a 2Bak 9.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Aimeaka iyo mbuti na botita bo ngomba e mele mi Olive, ndelo emina emumu esusu e batingami ba nde, baluma na mongandi, babanga bokumedja Ndjakomba na miholi mi diko tina e midjɔ mi bokamoa misusu miɛnɛ ibo. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Babalaka bo: «Kina bo adjongoame, mokondji iyoyo okɛɛkɛdea adoe na kombe Kumu! Bogo iho o diko ko ekumu ta bisika binɔi diko!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ndambo e Bapalisai ta ndanda emumu e bato, babala na Yesu bo: «Molehi, gamea batingami ba wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Nabalakadea na nu bo, nongo ibo bakapɔpɔnɔ, mabanga ma gamadea!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tina e Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ehole eimea Yesu mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ ko aeɛniɛ, ko aso ayeia bio tina e yu, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />ko abala bo: «Oso djeba midjɔ mibwani boolwɛ bogo busa ibubu! Endelo edɛdiyeye, midjɔ momina midii mibolamake ta miso ma wɛ, obwaniti bomiɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Modjɔ mo ehole ekɛɛkɛdea adoe tina e wɛ baloni ba wɛ baemeadea ekuka enɛnɛ tina e boanedja, baohikabi ko baolanedjabi na ekuka pamba djisusu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baominakakabi, wɛ na bana ba wɛ, ta tei e wɛ, batakinabi nongo ibanga dimɔti diko di ikina ibanga, modjɔ mo odjebiti ndelo edoaki ekamweli e Ndjakomba!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani batɛki ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mal 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Amaka kweya Yesu ta tepelo abanga bobengana bato ba mimbongu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />abala na bu bo: «Ekomama bo: “Ndako e mbi edaabi ndako e miɔngɔnɔ.” Endelo ino, oehokodjini esabalaka e bapundji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 56.7; Yil 7.11.</char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu alehaka masu masusu ta tepelo. Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, ko na balehi ba mobeko, ko babanei ba Bayudha, bahombaka ndjea ebo moowa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Endelo baidjebaka mondumba ndani mobwani nabu bokɔɔ, modjɔ mo bato basusu babaleaka matoi ta dii iyo.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kpati e Yesu edongakadea djɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mal 11, 27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Busa bomɔti bo masu mia, iyana alehaka iyo bato ta tepelo ko atɔndeaka bato Bwɛndi Bopele. Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku bamoimanea gbundumo, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />ko bawadja Yesu bo: «Lotɔndea kpati ndani ekɔkɔdea na wɛ midjɔ mimina, moto oopa kpati e mina nda?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbi pongono naowadjakadeani iwadja dimɔti. Sɔmbedjanini: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Batisimo ba Yoane <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3.3,7.</char></note>badongaka ta busa kaoko ta dii bato?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Endelo balɛdjɛ modjɔ momina ibo bɛnɛ ko basatɔndeana bo: «Lokamosɔmbedja bo: “Baadonga ta busa”, abaladea nasu ibo: “Tina ndani oibadhimani?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ko lokasɔmbedjadea ibo: “Edii bato”, bato basusu balowadea na mabɔkɔ, modjɔ mo bato basusu badhimi bo Yoane adaaka motɛli.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bamosɔmbedja ibo baidjebaka esika edonga bo. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Iboa, Yesu abala ibo: «Mbi pongono ngasa, nataotɔndeadeani kpati e ndani e kɔkɔɔdea na mbi mɛko mimina.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e baoneli babe ba gbie e vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mal 12, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abanga botɔndea bato ekuanedji iyeye: «Moomi omɔti aana gbie e vino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 5.1.</char></note>. Aepa ta mɔmɔ ma basali ba gbie e vino ko akɛɛ mɔɔngɔ moyai. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ehole ekpeta mbuma, aloma mosali omɔti ta dii baoneli bɛngi bamopɛ i nde ibondo di mbuma dji gbie. Endelo baoneli ba gbie e vino baboma mosali omina ko bamoyanedja mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Moswa gbie aloma okina mosali, endelo baoneli ba gbie bamoboma naikina, bamosinga ko bamoyanedja mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Aloma naikina mosali o basato; ko baoneli ba gbie bamobenedja ko bamobengana pongono. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Iboa moswa gbie asabalea ibo: “Eka ebwani mbi nakɔe nda? Nalomadea mwana moomi o mbi o epaeli, ndelo ekina bamosumadea.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Endelo ndelo eɛnɛ baoneli ba gbie mwana omina, basabalea ibo: “Edii iyo moto odadea mosangoi. Lomowoeni, bɛngi gbie ediikame e biso.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Bamoimanedja sokolu e gbie ko bamoowa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Eka ebwani bobakɔɔ moswa gbie nda? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Akadoabi, aowabi basali bamina, ko apabi gbie emina na bato babuki.» Aoka bo mɛko mimina, bato babala ibo: «Modjɔ imumu motakɔɔmɔbi!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Endelo Yesu abaindja ko abala nabu ibo: «Epalakadea botingodja mobalo imumu mokomama nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Ibanga idumba batongi ba ndako imei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">ikwee di ndonga di boso dipeli ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjembo 118.22.</char></note>”?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Moto mosusu iyoyo okwabi ta diko di ibanga imina abukeanabi ko ibanga imina ikakwa ta diko di moto, imominakakabi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti e Kaisala</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mal 12, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Balehi ba mobeko ko na ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ bahomba ndjea e bopea Yesu oko ta ehole emina, modjɔ mo basipoa bo Yesu abala ekuanedji emina tina e bobo, endelo badaa na bɔɔ tina e bato. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ko ehole emina babanga bomosɛndjɛlɛ. Baloma mbombe ba bobo ta dii Yesu ondingo bato ba bosooti, bɛngi ba mopee na ibunga ko badie enɔli e bomokaba ta dii gupɛlɛnɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bamowadja bo: «Molehi, lodjebakadea bo okabale ko okalehee na bosooti; tobange mbanda dji bato, endelo okalehe na bosooti ndjea e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Lotɔndea: etungi nasu boputa puti e Kaisala kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Endelo Yesu asipoa bo bamopikei elambo ko abala na bu ibo: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Inedjanini pata e palanga. Epoya kaoko kombe edii iyana e nda?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «E Kaisala.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Iboa, Yesu abala na bu bo: «Pani Kaisala mi Kaisala, ko pani Ndjakomba mi Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baimodia na ibunga na midjɔ mibalaka iyo ta boso bo bato. Endelo bakamowa bobuke na misɔmbedja mi nde ko bapɔpɔnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwadja di bosisoa bo bato bago</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mal 12, 18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ndambo e Basadukai babatama ta dii Yesu. Ibo tebadhime bo bato bago bakasisoe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Bik 23.8.</char></note>. Ko bamowadja iwadja idii bo: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Molehi, Mose alokomea mobeko imumu bo: “Moto akasɔɔ mwali ko agwi pɛpɛ bobota na nde etungi mwanango asɔe mwali omina bɛngi abote na nde bana batingi na mwanango iyona ogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Dit 25.5-6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ta ibota dimɔti idaaka na bana baami sambo. Iyona o boso asɔɔ mwali ko agwa pɛ bobota na nde. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />O babae, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Ekɔɔmɔ oko mondumba momina momɔti na mwana o basato mbunoko mwana o sambo ibo basusu sambo bagwa pɛpɛ bokina mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ta ngɔngɔ djimina, mwali omina aso agwa pongono. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ndelo esisoabi bato bago, mwali omina adaabi o nda? Modjɔ mo ibo basusu sambo bamoasɔkɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Iya a ngondo iye baami na bali bakasɔɔne, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />endelo baami na bali ibia balongabi ko basisoabi ta bogwa ko ibia bahelamabi ta ngondo ekɛɛkɛdea adoe batasɔnɔbi. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ibo bagwɛtebi naikina, badaabi piɔ na babwɛndi. Badii bana ba Ndjakomba, modjɔ mo badii ibia basisoi ta bogwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose ainedja na bohu bo bato bagwa basisoabi. Modjɔ mo ndelo eɛnɛ Mose mole moayoa mosa ko pɛ boangoa aso abea Kumu “Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Ndjakomba o Isaka ko Ndjakomba o Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 3.2,6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ndjakomba adiiti Ndjakomba o bato bago, endelo adii Ndjakomba o bato badii na bomɔ, modjɔ mo bato basusu ibia basato badii na bomɔ tina e nde.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ndambo e balehi ba mobeko babala na nde bo: «Molehi, obali bopele.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Modjɔ mo baidia naikina enɔli e bomowadja mawadja makina.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya na Dhapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mal 12, 35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu abala bo: «Ndenge ndani bato badii bobala bo Masiya adii motitani o Dhapiti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Modjɔ mo Dhapiti iyo mɛnɛ abali ta buku e Ndjembo bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Kumu abali na Kumu o mbi bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Doa adae ta ebɔ e mbi e baami,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mbunoko aiemedje baloni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">ba wɛ etunda e wɛ e bobakeaka mako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 110.1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dhapiti abeaka Masiya “Kumu”: ko ndenge ndani Masiya abwani bodaa mwana o nde?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedji balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mal 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ndelo edaaka bato basusu bamohokamedja, abala na batingami ba nde bo: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Kebani na balehi ba mobeko ibia bakapale bodala na mikoto miyai ko bobaisea ndese dji ekumu ta bisika bikabolame bato; bakahɔe bodaa ta bisika dji boso ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ mi Bayudha ko ta melo mi mesa ta ndelo e boyaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bakakatoe leka lo bali ba bogwa, ko, bakangɔne miɔngɔnɔ miyai miyai tina e basainedje bo badii bato bapele. Basambedjamabi na bopipo mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ikabo di mwali mokwali ogwa na moomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mal 12, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu angɔdjɔ miso, ko aɛnɛ badieli ndenge eisaka bo palanga ta etanda e mabondja. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aenɛ mwali omɔti o bogwa mokwali aisaka ta etanda e mabondja palanga pata ibae djikɛkɛkɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Iboa abala bo: «Naotɔndeakani sooti bo: ibondja dipi mokwali mwali iyoo o bogwa inɔi mabondja mapi bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Modjɔ mo mabondja mapa bato basusu maidaaka na tɛtɔ ta dii ibo; endelo iyo, na bopu bo nde, api palanga dji nde djisusu djidaaki na nde tina e bohelama.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abadjebedji bo tepelo ebukeanadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mal 13, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Iboa ndambo e bato basakoa tepelo ko babala bo, edii iyeye enɔi bopele modjɔ mo etongama na mabanga mapele ko edaaka na leka lopele lopama na Ndjakomba tina e bobɔngedja tepelo. Yesu asɔmbedja bo: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Oɛnɛkɛɛdeani midjɔ imia misusu, ta masu ma kɛkɛdea adoe midjɔ imia misusu mibehadea pɛpɛ nongo ibanga imɔti didikabi dibaki diko di mina du.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midjɔ mikɔɔmɔbi boso bo suka e ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mal 13, 3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bamowadja bo: «Molehi, ehole ndani ekɔɔmɔbi modjɔ momina? Embete ndani einedjabi bo midjɔ mimina mimei mbuti?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Kebani, bato basakaopɛngodjani. Modjɔ mo bato banɛnɛ badoabi na kombe e mbi ko babalabi bo: “Mbi nadii Masiya!” Ko “ehole eimei mbuti!” Endelo pɛpɛ bobasusani. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ehole eokabi ino gala dji bitumba ko na wusuwusu, pɛpɛ bobangani midjɔ mimina mitungi bodoa boso, endelo ediiti suka e ngondo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Iboa abala na bu bo: «Ekomi emɔti eanabi bila na ekomi ekina ko bokumu na bokumu boanabi pongono; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Pamba inɛnɛ kpɔtɔ ikumanabi, mɔlɔ ko na ndja; edaabi na midjɔ mi sɔmɔ ko bimbete bibokamoa bienɛnɛbi ta busa. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Endelo boso bo midjɔ misusu imia, baopeabini, baonɔngedjabini, baokababini tina e boosambedjani ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ ko baisabini ta bɔlɔkɔ; bakɛɛbi na nu ta boso bo bakondji ko na bagupɛlɛnɛlɛ tina e kombe e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Modjɔ momina, moopabini enɔli e bobala tati tina e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Djebani bo, pɛpɛ bosayekeani na eka ebwani na nu bosamba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Modjɔ mo mbi naopabini bokongo ko na konga emɔti baloni ba bino bahɔnetebi botɛlɛmelani. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Okabamabini nongo na baboti ba bino, bangi bino baami, denga di bino ko na binanu, bakina bakɛɛbi ngabi ta tei e bino. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Baokeabini swɛ na bato basusu tina e kombe e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Endelo moswe momɔti ta melo mi bino motabungedjamabi. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Na ingbangba di bino, obolodjabini bomɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yelusalɛmɛ ebehadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24, 15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mal 13, 14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Ehole eenɛbi no Yelusalɛmɛ ehikami na mbulu bahindo, iboa djebani bo, bobedjama bo yu boeimei mbuti. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Iboa, ibia badaabi ta Yudhea botiabi ta ngomba; ibia badaabi ta tei e ngando enɛnɛ baetiabi, ibia badaabi ta gbie basɔmbetebi o tei. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Modjɔ mo edaabi masu ma sambi, bɛngi midjɔ misusu mikomama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Ose 9.7.</char></note> mikokedjame. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ndjokwa na bali badaabi na meemi, na bia banungeabi! Modjɔ mo edaabi na saya enɛnɛ ta ngondo, ko gbɛkɛ diko di bato ibibi. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bagwabi na mopata, bapeamabi bɔlɔkɔ ta bikomi bisusu, bikomi badalakakabi Yelusalɛmɛ tee mbunoko ehole e bobo bikomi ekokedjame.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodoa bo Mwana o moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mal 13, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Bimbete bienɛmɛbi ta modakabusa, ko ta songe ko na ndjɔtɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 13.10; Edjek 32.7; Yl 3.3-4.</char></note>. Ta kpɔtɔ, bikomi badaabi na bɔɔ, babangabi ngilimo djinɛnɛ dji dua ko na mbonge. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bato bagwaabi na bɔɔ iyana ta bolɛdjɛ midjɔ mikɔɔmɔbi ta kpɔtɔ isusu, modjɔ mo ngulu djisusu dji diko djikumanabi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Iboa baenɛbi Mwana o moto bodoa ta itute na ngulu esusu ko na ekumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7.13.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ehole ebangabi midjɔ mimina bokɔɔmɔ, sabɔngedjani ko angɔdjɔni molo, tina e bosikoli bo bino boimei mbuti.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho epama tina e mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mal 13, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu abatɔndea ekuanedji emɔti bo: «Indjani mole mo pigi ko mele mikina misusu: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />ehole eɛnɛbi ino kasa dji yeene djitɔi, okadjebeni ino bɛnɛ bo yanga eimei. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ndenge emɔti, ehole eenɛbi ino midjɔ mimina bokɔɔmɔ, djebani bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei mbuti. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Naotɔnndeini sooti bo: bato ba mbota iyeye batasiabi pɛpɛ baenɛ midjɔ mimina misusu bokɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Diko na kpɔtɔ binɔɔbi, endelo mibalo mi mbi mitanɔɔbi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛtɔ ebokeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Tomakebani! Ta mɛti na bo, milema mi bino midae pɛpɛ boluma na bokoso bo boyaka ko na milangoa, na bokɛsɛdji bo bomɔ, busa bua boimaneabini gbundumo, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />ondingo modjanga modjɔ mo busa bomina bodoabi ta dii ibia basusu badii ta tei e kpɔtɔ djisusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Iboa pɛpɛ bowɛɛni, angɔnɔni ehole esusu; iboa, odiadeani ngulu e bolonga midjɔ misusu mibwani boimea ko ohɔnɔdeani boema boso bo Mwana o moto.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Na moi, Yesu alehaka ta tepelo; endelo mɔkɔmɔkɔ, akɛɛkɛ asama ta ngomba ekabee bo ngomba e mele mi Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ehumahuma bato badoaka ta dii iyo ta tepelo tina e bomohokamedja.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Badaledji ba Bayudha bakɔi inginda ta tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />52 Eyenga e mapa imimi ma pɛpɛ levile ekabee ibo Pasika, ebatamaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 12.1-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko balehi ba mobeko bahomba ndjea e boowa Yesu, endelo badaaka na bɔɔ bo bato.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudhasi ahombi ndjea e bokaba Yesu ta dii bakondji</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mal 14, 10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Iboa Satana akwea ta dii Yudhasi, iyoyo obeaka ibo Isikaliote, iyo adaaka ta tei e batingami doomi na babae. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Akɛɛ asola na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko babanei ibia basɛndjɛlɛkɛ tepelo bɛngi adie mwɛngi mo bokaba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ibo basepa ko bamodikanedja bo bamopɛ palanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudhasi adhima ko abanga bohomba ndjea epele ebwanaka na nde bokaba Yesu bɛngi emumu edae pɛpɛ bodjeba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɛlingodji tɛkɛ e pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mal 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Busa bo mapa ma pɛpɛ levile, botungamaka boowa bana ba bhata tina e Pasika, boimea. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu aloma Petelo na Yoane ko abala na bu bo: «Kɛɛni alobɔngedja mia ma Pasika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 12.3-9.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamowadja bo: «Apalakadea wɛ lokɛe aebɔngedja djɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Ndelo eimeadea ino ta ngando enɛnɛ, osonganadeani na moomi omɔti iyoyo apeli mondungulu mo madiba. Mokimanani ta ndako iyeye ekweadea iyo, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ko tɔndeani moswa ndako bo: “Molehi aowadjakadea bo: ekenge e ndako eyakadea mbi Pasika na batingami ba mbi edo?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ko aoinedjadeani ta ndako o diko ekenge e ndako enɛnɛ edii ebɔngedjamake. Iyena edii polo ebɔngedjadea ino mia.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bakɛɛ, ko batanea midjɔ misusu oko mondumba mobalaka Yesu, babɔngedja mia ma Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa e Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mal 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Aimea ehole emina, adaa ta mesa na bapɔsɔlu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Abala na bu ibo: «Mbi nadaakabi na posa enɛnɛ e boyaka na nu mia ta Pasika iyeye boso bo boɛnɛ saya! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Modjɔ mo, naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo nitaeyakebi na nu naikina mbunoko ekokedjame ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Iboa atomba keni, asakoa Ndjakomba ko abala bo: «Tombani keni iyeye ko kabanani ta tei e bino; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nabalakadea na nu sooti bo, banga busa ibubu namwaketebi naikina vino iyeye mbunoko busa bodoabi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ngɔngɔ djimina atomba mapa ko asakoa Ndjakomba, abuka ko apa batingami ba nde, abala bo: «Iyeye edii mokuku mo mbi imumu mokabamadea tina e bino. Kɔɔkɔni boa tina e bolɛdjɛnini.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ta tina e keni akɔɔ oko mondumba momɔti, ngɔngɔ dji boyaka abala bo: «Keni iyeye edii mokongo mo yeene mo makiya ma mbi, masopea tina e bino. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Endelo indjani: moto okabadeani adii na mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Djem 41.10.</char></note> ta mesa emɔti! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Sooti mɛnɛ, Mwana o moto adii bogwa bobwana na mbuno e Ndjakomba; endelo ndjokwa ta dii iyona omokabadea!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Ko babanga bosawadjana bɛngi badjebe moto ndani iyoyo okɔɔdea modjɔ momina.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto onɔi monɛnɛ nda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Batingami basweana bɛngi badjebe moto ndani onɔi na monɛnɛ ta ndanda e bobo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Bakondji ba bikomi ibia bakakondje bato ko ibia bakainedje kpati dji bobo bakapale bobabea bato bapele. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Endelo etabɔngɔ edae iboa ta dii ino. Ta ndanda e bino moto onɔi atungi adae odingo yɛngɛ mokɛkɛ, ko iyona okondjakadea bato atungi adae mosali. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Modjɔ mo moto onɔi monɛnɛ, idii iyona odii ta mesa, kaoko iyona okɔmedjakadea? Editi iyona odii a mesa? Endelo mbi nadii ta ndanda e bino odingo mosali o bino! <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ino odaakini bato kaika milema bihole bisusu bidaaki mbi ta mameko. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ndenge emɔti epani Sesa Bokumu mbi pongono naopini, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />iboa oyakabini ko omwabini na mbi ta mesa e mbi ta Bokumu bo mbi ko odaabini ta kiti dji bokumu tina e bodaledja mabota doomi na mabae ma Isalɛlɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ainganadea Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />«Simona, Simona! Hokamedja: Satana awadji ndjea bɛngi aomeke ondingo mondumba mokanyɔngɛle bo mbuma dji ble. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Endelo mbi, naangɔnɔki tina e wɛ bo edhimeli e wɛ esa kwa. Ko ndelo eangodea wɛ ta edhimeli, oma pingedja bana ba ngwao.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Endelo Petelo abala na nde bo: «Kumu, mbi nadhimi bokwea ta bɔlɔkɔ ko bogwa engbanga emɔti na wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Petelo, naotɔndeakadea bo, boso bo kɔkɔ bobekoa busa ibubu mɛnɛ oinganadeani mbala djisato.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosenge saki ko mopata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu abala na bu naikina bo: «Ehole eolomakani mbi bo, pɛpɛ botombani mosenge, tɔmbi, sapato, eka mɛnɛ ndani etaka ino?» Bamosɔmbedja – «Pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti». <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Iboa abala na bu bo: «Edɛdiyeye edii mondumba mokina, moto odii na palanga, adjitombe, ndenge emɔti na iyona odii na tɔmbi, aetombe, ko iyona otaki mopata, etungi atɛke kasaka e nde bɛngi asombe mopata momɔti. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Modjɔ mo, naotɔndeakani sooti bo, etungi ekokedjame ta dii mbi mobalo mokomama bo: “Bamoisa engbanga emɔti na bato babe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 53.12.</char></note>.” Bɛngi eka esusu ekomama tina e mbi ekokedjame.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Batingami babala bo: «Kumu, indja, mipata mibae imimi.» Iyo abala na bu bo: «Mibwani oko boa!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akɛi angɔnɔ ta ngomba e mele mi Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mal 14, 32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu aimana ko akɛɛ ta ngomba e mele mi Olive ndenge edaaka momɛsɛno mo nde. Batingami ba nde bamokimana. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ehole aimea iyo ta esika emina, abala na bu bo: «Angɔnɔni bɛngi odaeni pɛpɛ bomekama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ngɔngɔ djimina asasua na batingami ba nde ko akwa magbunda, ko aso angɔnɔ bo: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Sesa, okapala, dongedja mbuti na mbi keni iyeye e saya. Pɛpɛ bokɔɔ bolulea bo mbi, yɛɛ bo bolulea bo wɛ bokɔɔme.» [ <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Iboa obwɛndi omɔti adongi ta diko adoa tina e bomopingedja molema. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu aoka manene mɛnɛ, ko angɔnɔkɔ naikina na ingbangba inɛnɛ. Bidjungu bitangaka na nde ondingo makiya ko djiakwa ta kpɔtɔ.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Amaka iyo madja boangɔnɔ, aangɔ ko akɛɛ ta dii batingami ko abatanea bawɛli, modjɔ mo ndjokwa e banɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Abawadja bo: «Ino owɛlini oko hio? Angɔni ko angɔnɔni bɛngi bo adaeni pɛpɛ bomekama.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18, 3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Oko ta ndelo ebalaka iyo emumu e bato emoimanea. Yudhasi, omɔti o batingami doomi na babae, adaaka boso. Abatama mbuti na Yesu bɛngi amopɛ ekɔpi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Endelo Yesu abala na nde bo: «Yudhasi, okabakadea Mwana o moto na bomodinga ekɔpi?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ndelo eɛnɛ bato badaaka na nde midjɔ mimina baso bamowadja bo: «Kumu obwani bopala lobabome na mipata?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ko omɔti o bobo alena mosali o mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba itoi di ebɔ e baami. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Endelo Yesu abala bo: «Kinani, modjɔ mosi.» Apea itoi di moto omina ko itolongana.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yesu abala na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ, bakondji ba babanei ba tepelo ko na basuku ibibi badoaka amopea bo: «Edii mbi mokondji o batɔmbɔki bɛngi odoeni ta dii mbi na mipata ko na pengu? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Nadaaka na nu masu masusu ta tepelo ko oipeakanini endelo ehole iyeye edii e bino ta bokondji bo bulu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ainganei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26, 57-58</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mal 14, 53-54</ref>.<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoa 18, 12-18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Bapea Yesu ko bakɛɛ na nde bamokwedja ta ndako e mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba. Petelo abakimanaka ko adikaka moo bohali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Balanedjaka mosa ta ndanda e ikanga ko Petelo adaa na mobondo ta ndanda e bobo.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mosali mwali omɔti amoɛnɛ adii na mobondo mbuti na mosa; amokokoledja ko abala bo: «Moto iyoyo adaaka pongono na Yesu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Endelo amoinganea ko aso abala bo: «Mwali nitamodjebakadea.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, okina amoɛnɛ ko abala na nde bo: «Wɛ pongono, odii omɔti o bato ba nde!» Endelo Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Ngasa, ediiti mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokimana ngonga emɔti, okina atɛɛ bo: «Edii sooti moto iyoo adaaka na nde, modjɔ mo adii moto o Galileya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Endelo Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Nitadjebakadea eka epalakadea wɛ bobala!» Ko ta ndelo iyena abalaka iyo, kɔkɔ abekoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kumu ahombana ko akokoledja Petelo. Iboa Petelo alɛnɛ mɛko mimotɔndeaka Yesu bo: «Boso bo kɔkɔ bobekoa busa ibubu oinganeadeani mbala isato bo otadjebakani.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Aimana sokolu ko ayea biyo dji ndjokwa mɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basingi Yesu ko bamobomi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26, 67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mal 14, 65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bato basɛndjɛlɛkɛ Yesu ba motaka ko bamobomaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamonangaka esendja ta miso ko bamowadjaka bo: «Inedja bo odii motɛli! Bala osa oboma nda?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ko bamosingaka naikina na mindumba minɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu boso bo Ikita inɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18, 19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ndelo eya busa, inginda di basuku ba Bayudha, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na balehi ba mobeko diputoana. Ko bakɛɛ na Yesu boso bo Ikita dinɛnɛ di bobo, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />ko baso bamowadja bo: «Wɛ odii Masiya? Lotɔndea.» Abasɔmbedja: «Nakaotɔndeadaeni, otadhimeadeanini, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ko nakaowadjadeani, otasɔmbedjadeanini. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Endelo banga busa ibubu Mwana o moto adaabi ta ebɔ e baami e Ndjakomba o ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 110.1. </char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ibo basusu bamowadja bo: «Wɛ odii Mwana o Ndjakomba?» Iyo abasɔmbedja bo: «Ino obalini eka edii mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ibo babala bo: «Tina ebwani nasu bohomba naikina tati nda? Iso bɛnɛ looki ta monɔkɔ mo nde iyo mɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mal 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ibo basusu baangɔ ko bakɛɛ na Yesu ta boso bo Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Babanga bamopunda ko babala bo: «Iso lotanea moto iyoyo apangoa bato ba biso: abasia badae pɛpɛ boputa puti ta dii Kaisala ko iyo mɛnɛ asabaleakadea bo adii Masiya, mokondji.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato amowadja bo: «Wɛ, odii mokondji o Bayudha?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ, mɛnɛ obali.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato abala na ba banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na emumu e bato bo: «Nataɛnɛkɛdea modjɔ mobe mobwani na mbi bodumba moto iyo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Bakongola bobala bo: «Iyo apangoakadea bato na bileho bi nde. Abanga ta Galileya, anɔɔ a Yudhea, mbunoko iyaya.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso bo Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ehole eoka Pilato mɛko mimina awadja bo: «Moto iyoyo adii moto o Galileya?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ko iyana aoka iyo bo Yesu adaaka moto o ekenge e mokili ebaneaka Elode, amoloma ta dii Elode, odaaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta masu mamina imia. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Elode amayo enɛ Yesu adaaka na sepi enɛnɛ. Modjɔ mo, aoka gala e nde donga ehele, ko adaaka na posa e bosongana na nde; alɛndɛkɛ bo Yesu amoinedje moo embete. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />amowadja mawadja manɛnɛ, endelo Yesu aimosɔmbedja nongo eka emɔti. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko balehi ba mobeko badaaka ena ko bamopunda bobe mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elode na basodha ba nde bamota ko bamonyɔkɔlɔ na masinga, ko Bamoloadja esendja epele mɛnɛ ko amosɔmbedja ta dii Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Elode na Pilato baiokanaka boso, ko ta busa bomina, baimea na bwela bopele.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badhimi bowa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mal 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoa 18, 39-19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Iboa Pilato aputoanedja banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ babanei ba Bayudha ko na bato basusu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ko abala na bu bo: «Ino olwɛbinini moto iyoyo obalabini bo apangoakadea bato. Iboa mbi namowadjaki ta boso bo bino ko namobolodjiti na modjɔ momɔti mobe imumu momopundakadea na nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Elode aimobolodjabi na modjɔ mobe modjɔmo amosɔmbedji djɔno ta dii iso. Iboa, moto iyoyo akɔiti modjɔ mobe imumu mobwani na nde bogwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Namobomedje pimbo, ngɔngɔ djimina naso na mokine.» [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Aengi tɛkɛ e Pasika, Pilato abwanaka bobatingoa moto omɔti ta bɔlɔkɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imu te modae a mikanda minɛnɛ miyou mikomama na mɔmɔ. Boindja a Mat 27.15; Mal 15.6</char></note>] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Endelo ibo basusu bagama engbanga emɔti bo: «Owa moto omina! Kinea iso Balabasi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />– Balabasi akwea ta bɔlɔkɔ na tina e wusuwusu ekɔɔmɔ ta ngando enɛnɛ ko aso aowaka moto. – <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato adaaka na posa e bokina Yesu, ko abala na bu na ikina mɛko mimina. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Endelo ibo bagamaka bo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Abala naikina mbala e basato bo: «Bobe bokɔi iyo nda? Mbi naeniti modjɔ mobe mobwani na nde bogwa. Na moimanedjadea ngɔngɔ dji bomoboma.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Endelo bakongola oko bagama na ngulu bo iyo abakame oko ta ekulusu. Ko na migamo mi bobo bopala bo bobo bokokedjama: <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilato adhima akokedje bopala bo bobo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Pilato aimedja moto opalaka bo, iyo odaaka ta bɔlɔkɔ na tina e wusuwusu iyena ekɔɔ ibo ko iyo aowa moto, ko akaba Yesu ta mɔmɔ ma bobo bɛngi bakɔe na nde mondumba mopalaka ibo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaki Yesu ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Iyana akɛɛkɛ ibo na Yesu, basongana na Simona, moto o Silɛne, ahulaka ta gbie. Bamopea ko baamolwaja ekulusu sangɔngɔ dji Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Emumu e bato enɛnɛ badaaka batingi ngɔngɔ dji nde, ko bali babakeaka mɔmɔ ta melo ko bakɛsɛlɛkɛ tina e nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu ahokowa ta dii ibo ko abala na bu bo: «Ino bali ba Yelusalɛmɛ, kina boyeani tinae mbi! Endelo yeani tinae bino bɛnɛ ko tina e bana ba bino! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Modjɔ mo ta masu makɛɛkɛdea adoe, babalabi bo: “Mongandi ta dii bali batete, ibibi badaa pɛpɛ bobota ko na bonungea bana.” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ta ndelo emina bato babalabi na ngomba bo: “Kwani diko di biso!” Ko babalabi na makoli bo: “Lokundani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ose 10.8. </char></note>!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Modjɔ mo bakakɔɔ mole motɔtu iboa, modabi boni na mole mokakanake?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bakɛɛkɛ pongono na bapundji babae bɛngi ba baowoe engbanga emɔti na nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ehole eimea bo ta esika iyeye ebeaka bo «Engɔngɔlɔ e molo», babaka Yesu ta ekulusu ko na bapundji babae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 53.12.</char></note> pongono, omɔti ta ebɔ e nde e baami, okina ta ebɔ e nde e bali. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu abala bo: «Sesa, ba yɛɛ modjɔ mo batadjebakadea eka ekɔkɔɔdea ibo.» Baboma djeke tina e bokabana bisendja bi nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bato basusu ibia badaaka ena baindjaka modjɔ momina. Babanei ba Bayudha bataka Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Ndjem 22.8-9.</char></note> ko babalaka na nde bo: «Aheledja bato bakina, asaheledje iyo mɛnɛ, akadaa sooti mɛnɛ Masiya, iyona ohɔɔ Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Basoda pongono bamotaa, badoaka mbuti na nde ko bamopaka vino e ngai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Ndjem 69.22.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ko babala na nde bo: «Okadaa mokondji o Bayudha, saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ta diko di molo mo nde bakoma ena bo: «Moto iyoyo adii mokondji o Bayudha.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Omɔti o bapundji obaka ibo ta ekulusu amosingaka ko abala bo: «Wɛ te Masiya? Saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ, oko eheledja koko iso!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Endelo mopundji iyoyo okina amogamea ko abala bo: «Wɛ, otabanga Ndjakomba, wɛ iyo odii etumbu emɔti na nde? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Tina e biso edii sooti, modjɔ mo iso lobolodji etumbu edii tina e mikɔ mi biso; ko iyo akɔiti nongo bobe bomɔti.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Iboa abakea bo: «Yesu, tomalɛdjɛni ndelo eimeabi wɛ ta bokondji bo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadea sooti bo: oko busa ibubu mɛnɛ odadea na mbi ta paladiso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 43 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Paladiso </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Einedji bo esika eye e bato bahombedja molema ta pamba e Ndjakomba ko badabi na nde, ko basepabi na nde esika emɔti ngɔngɔ dji.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yogo e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Edaaka mbuti na midi, modidi motita ta kpɔtɔ djisusu ko mbunoko ngonga e basato ngɔngɔ dji midi, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ko modakabusa modimea, esendja enɛnɛ odaaka ta ndanda e Esika Esɛnɔke na ta Esika Enɔi esɛnɔke esɛpɛɛkɛ ibo ta tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a Boi 26.31-33.</char></note> eso ealea bipasa bibae. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu agama na ngulu bo: «Sesa, nasɔmbedji mwembo mo mbi ta mɔmɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 31.6.</char></note> ma wɛ. Asiedja iyo babala iboa, aso atsea molema.» <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Kapita o basodha mokama aenɛ iyo modjɔ momina, akumedja Ndjakomba ko abala bo: «Edii sooti mɛnɛ, moto iyoyo adaaka moto o bosooti!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Emumu e bato badoaka ena aindja modjɔ momina iyana aenɛ bo boa. Bayana mɔmɔ ta melo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bato basusu bamodjebaka ko na bali ibibi bamokimanaka donga ta Galileya, baemaka bohali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Ndjem 38.12.</char></note> enɛ baindja midjɔ misusu imi minɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapusei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Moto omɔti adaaka ena, kombe ende Yosepu moto o Alimatayo, ngando enɛnɛ e Bayudha. Moto omina adaaka mopele ko na bosooti. Ko aambaka bodoa bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Iyo adaaka moto o Ikita dinɛnɛ. Endelo iyo aidhima mɛko miokanaka ibo ko mikɔ ibo ta Ikita dinɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Akɛɛ ta dii Pilato ko amosɛngɛ mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ko atitedja mokuku ta ekulusu, amohua na molangiti ko amoisa ta ikila dilongeama ta ndanda e ibanga inɛnɛ, ko baipaka pusea moto omɔti ena. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Edaaka busa bo Mosɛlingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 27.62 ko na.</char></note> mo sabata, ko sabata ehombaka eimee. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bali ibibi bakimanaka na Yesu donga Galileya, bakimana Yosepu iho, ko baɛnɛ ikila ko baindja mondumba ndani moisa bo ebembe ta ikila. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ngɔngɔ djimina basɔmbɔ ko babɔngedja mosula mo so epele ko na malasi. Bahema ta busa bo sabata tina e bosuma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Menɛ ko na malasi: boindja a Mal 14.8 ko nase. Ndenge lomaka mobeko: boindja a Boi 20.10; Dit 5.14.</char></note> mobeko.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Bosisoa bo Yesu a bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mal 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ta busa bo boso bo eyenga, ehumahuma mɛnɛ bali bamɔti bakɛɛ ta ikila, batomba mosula mo so e malasi mobɔngedjaka Ibo. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Batanea bahilingoanedja ibanga ta monɔkɔ mo ikila. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Bakweya o tei, endelo bainɛ ebembe e Kumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Iboa basatungeaka tina e modjɔ momina, baami babae babaimaneia bisendja bi bobo bingɛsɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Iboa bali balumaka na bɔɔ ko basunea miso ma bobo ta kpɔtɔ, ko baami bamina babae babawadja bo: «Tina ehombakadea na nu moto odii na bomɔ ta ndanda e bato bago nda? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Iyo adiiti iyaya, asisoi ta bogwa. Lɛdjɛni mɛko miotɔndeakani iyo ehole edaaka iyo ta Galileya: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Etungi na Mwana o moto bokabama ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe, bamobake ta ekulusu endelo ta isu di basato, asisoe ta bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a 9.22; 17.25; 18.32-33.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ko bali bamina baso balɛnɛ mibalo mibatɔndeaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ahula ibo ta ikila ko bakɛɛ atɔndea batingami doomi na omɔti mɛko misusu ko na bato bakina basusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Edaaka Malia o ngando e Magadala, Yoana ko Malia, nange Djake. Ko bali bakina ibibi badaaka na bu engbanga emɔti batɔndea bwɛndi bomina ta dii bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Endelo bato Balɛnɛkɛ bo mɛko mibalaka bali bamina midaaka na sɔngi ko baimidhima. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ta ndelo emina Petelo angɔɔ ko apota ebango ta ikila; asunama ko aenɛ oto bipasa bi bisendja. Ko ayana ta ndako e nde, na bokamoa bonɛnɛ bo midjɔ minɔɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta ndjea e Emausu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mal 16, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Oko ta busa bomina, batingami babae badaaka bakakɛe ta ngando emɔti na kombe yu Emausu, ko ngando emina edii bohali bo ngonga djibae bɛngi oimee ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Basabaleanaka midjɔ misusu imimi mikɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ehole esolanaka ko e bomanaka ibo kitɛ, Yesu iyo mɛnɛ abatama mbuti na bu ko adalaka engbanga emɔti na bu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Endelo miso ma bobo maihɔnɔ bomosipoa. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu abawadja bo: «Eka mɛnɛ ebalakadea ino na ndjea nda?» Baema, ko baluma na ndjokwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Omɔti o bobo, kombe e nde Keleopasi, abala na nde bo: «Iyaya ta Yelusalɛmɛ, moto omɔti omaka bungea mɛko imimi minɔkɔdea ta masu imimi oko wɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu abawadja: «Iyena nde?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Oko midjɔ mikɔɔmɔbi na Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ! Adaaka motɛli o ngulu enɛnɛ, na mikɔ ko na mibalo ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko babanei ba biso bamokaba bɛngi bamopɛ etumbu e yogo ko bamobaka ta ekulusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ko iso loalɛndɛ bo iyo asikoadea Isalɛlɛ. Endelo a midjɔ misusu donga akɔmɔbimo ekɔi masu masato. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Edii sooti, ndambo e bali ba engbanga e biso balokamodji bobuke mɛnɛ, bakɛɛki ehumahuma ta ikila, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ko bataneakiti mokuku mo nde bahulaki balotɔndeaki bo babwɛndi babaimaneaki ko babatɔndeaki bo adii na bomɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja a 24.1-11.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ndambo ekina e biso bakɛɛki ta ikila, ko bataneaki midjɔ misusu oko mondumba mobatɔndeaki bali bamina, endelo iyo, bamoɛnɛkiti.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Bato ba milema mipipo, ino todhimeni mɛko misusu miotɔndeani batɛli! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Otadjebakadeani ibo Masiya abwanaki aɛnɛ saya boso bo bokwea ta ekumu e nde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ko iyo abasipodja midjɔ mibalama tina e nde ta tei e Makomi, donga Mose mbunoko batɛli basusu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ehole eimea bo mbuti na ngando iyeye ekɛɛkɛ ibo, Yesu akɔɔkɔ ondingo anɔe pamba ekina. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Endelo ibo bamosiya ko babala na nde bo: «Dikama na su; eimea mɔkɔmɔkɔ ko busa bobanga bodipa.» Iboa akwea ta ndako bɛngi adea na bu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Adaaka engbanga na bu ta mesa, ngɔngɔ atomba mapa ko amadjongoa, ko abuka ko abapa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Iboa, miso ma bobo madipoama, ko bamodjeba; endelo alɛmɔ ta miso ma bobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ko basabaleana bo: «Milema mi biso midaakiti na sepi enɛnɛ ta ehole elotɔndeaki iyo ta ndjea ko elotingodjaka iyo Makomi?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Oko ta ehole emina baangɔɔ ko basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Batanea batingami doomi na omɔti badaaka esika emɔti na bina bu, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />ibo babala na bu bo: «Edii sooti mɛɛnɛ bo, Kumu asisoi! Asaenɛmedji na Simona!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ko ibo bɛɛnɛ babadjebedja midjɔ minɔɔkɔ na ndjea na mondumba mo modjeba na bu ndelo ebabukeaka iyo mapa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asainedji na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Iyana adaaka bo babala mɛko mimina, Yesu iyo mɛnɛ asainedja ta ndanda e bobo ko abatɔndea bo: «Bogo bodae na nu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ibo baluma na bɔɔ, modjɔ mo Balɛnɛkɛ bo baɛni mwembo mobe. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Endelo abatɔndea bo: «Ebangakadea ino nde? Obomakadeani kitɛ ta milema mi bino tina nda? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Indjani mɔmɔ ko mako ma mbi: edii oko mbi! Bandanini ko indjani; mwembo mopeliti mini na kua, ondingo ndenge enɛkɛdea ino mbi nadii na mu.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Amaka iyo bala iboa abainedja mɔmɔ ko na mako ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />A bo baipetaka dhima, tina e balumaka na sepi ko na bokamoa, abawadja bo: «Odiini na moo eka o boyaka iya?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamopa ekenge o moswi mokalangake. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Aetomba ko aso aeyaka ta boso bo bobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ngɔngɔ imina abala na bu bo: «Ndelo edaaka mbi na nu, nabala na nu bo: midjɔ misusu mikomama tina e mbi ta mobeko mo Mose, ta buku dji Batɛli ko ta Ndjembo, mitungi mikokedjame.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Iboa abadipoa bowɛi bɛngi basipoe Makomi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />ko abala na bu bo: «Indjani midjɔ mikoma bo: Masiya atungi aenɛ saya ko asisoe ta bogwa ta disu di basato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuanedja a Isa 53; Ose 6.2.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ko bolehadea kombe e nde boso bo bikomi bisusu, bobanga ta Yelusalɛmɛ; iboa, bato bahombedjadea milema ko badiadea ekutubanedji e pekato. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Odiini ba temo ba midjɔ mimina. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ko mbi, nalomeadea ta diko di bino eka ediikana Sesa. Ko dikamani ta ngando enɛnɛ mbunoko olumeni na ngulu iyeye edongadea o diko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Bik 1.4-5.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aiwei ta busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 16:19-20">Mat 16, 19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bik 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ngɔngɔ imina Yesu akɛɛ na bu mbunoko pamba e Betania; ko iho, aangɔdjɔ mɔmɔ ko abadjongoa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ehole ebadjongoaka iyo, abɔtɔ na bu ko atombama ta busa. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ibo, bakwa magbunda boso bo nde ko basɔmbɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ, baluma na sepi enɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Badikamaka ehole esusu ta tepelo ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>